    schema:dateModified "2026-04-13T12:04:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Verteilt auf 600 Quadratmeter bietet die Spa-Landschaft des <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/292416\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f000a4-5b64-437e-9fe6-31d3b5b8871e\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Hotels Mercure Z&uuml;rich City</a> in Z&uuml;rich-West viel Entspannung. Geschwitzt wird in einem Dampfbad, einer Biosauna oder einer finnischen Panoramasauna, w&auml;hrend ein Eisbrunnen f&uuml;r Abk&uuml;hlung sorgt. Diverse Erlebnisduschen und Ruher&auml;ume sorgen f&uuml;r weitere Erholung.<p>Sportliche freuen sich &uuml;ber den Fitnessraum mit modernsten Cardio- und Kraftger&auml;ten. An der Vitalbar im f&uuml;nften Stock warten ausserdem kleine Snacks und frische Smoothies.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Spread over an area of 600 square meters (6,500 sq.ft), the wellness area at the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/292416\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f000a4-5b64-437e-9fe6-31d3b5b8871e\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Mercure Z&uuml;rich City hotel</a> in Z&uuml;rich-West offers plenty of opportunity to relax and recuperate. Guests can sweat in a steam bath, a bio sauna or a Finnish panorama sauna, and then cool down in the ice fountain. There are also various experience showers and relaxation rooms.<p>Sports enthusiasts will enjoy the fitness room with its state-of-the-art cardio and weight equipment. In addition, the Vitalbar on the fifth floor offers light snacks and fresh smoothies.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>L&rsquo;espace spa de 600 m&egrave;tres carr&eacute;s &agrave; <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/292416\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f000a4-5b64-437e-9fe6-31d3b5b8871e\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Mercure Z&uuml;rich City&nbsp;</a>&agrave; Z&uuml;rich-West est riche en d&eacute;tente: bain de vapeur, sauna bio ou sauna panoramique finlandais pour transpirer, puis fontaine de glace pour se rafra&icirc;chir ainsi que diverses douches sp&eacute;ciales et salles de relaxation pour une d&eacute;tente encore plus grande.<p>Les amateurs de sport appr&eacute;cieront la salle de fitness dot&eacute;e des &eacute;quipements de cardio et de musculation les plus modernes. Le &laquo;&nbsp;Vitalbar&nbsp;&raquo; au cinqui&egrave;me &eacute;tage propose de petits encas et des smoothies frais.&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Su una superficie di 600 metri quadrati, la SPA dell&rsquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/292416\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f000a4-5b64-437e-9fe6-31d3b5b8871e\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Hotel Mercure Z&uuml;rich City</a>&nbsp;di Z&uuml;rich-West offre tantissimo relax. Dopo una bella sudata tra bagno turco, biosauna e sauna finlandese panoramica, la fontana di ghiaccio garantisce il giusto refrigerio. Varie docce emozionali e aree relax assicurano ancora pi&ugrave; pace e tranquillit&agrave;.<p>I pi&ugrave; sportivi non possono perdersi la palestra con i pi&ugrave; moderni attrezzi per cardio e potenziamento. Il bar al quinto piano propone piccoli snack e smoothie freschi.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Hotel Mercure Zürich City entspannen Gäste in einer Saunawelt, Ruheräumen oder bei einer Massage."@de,
        "At the Mercure Zürich hotel, guests can wind down in the sauna, in the relaxation rooms, or during a massage."@en,
        "A l’hôtel Mercure Zürich City, les clients peuvent se détendre dans un espace sauna, dans des salles de relaxation ou lors d’un massage."@fr,
        "All’Hotel Mercure Zürich City, gli ospiti si rilassano grazie a saune, aree relax e massaggi."@it ;
    schema:email "HC260@accor.com" ;
