    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-09-24T14:42:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Die modern ausgestatteten Zimmer und Suiten verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber raumhohe Fenster, die viel nat&uuml;rliches Tageslicht hineinlassen. Die bequemen Betten und grossz&uuml;gigen Arbeitsbereiche kreieren einen Ort, wo Arbeit und Erholung Hand in Hand gehen.<p>Das Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle&nbsp;ist direkt mit dem Circle Convention Center verbunden, wo einzigartige Veranstaltungsr&auml;ume f&uuml;r Anl&auml;sse jeglicher Art gebucht werden k&ouml;nnen. Der 80&rsquo;000m2 grosse Park befindet sich gegen&uuml;ber vom Kongresszentrum und bietet den idealen Ort f&uuml;r Erholung zwischen Business-Meetings und Stunden vor dem Computer.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The modern, well-appointed guest rooms and suites feature floor-to-ceiling windows that let in an abundance of natural daylight. The comfortable beds and spacious work areas create a place where work and relaxation go hand in hand.<p>The Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle is directly connected to the Circle Convention Center, where unique spaces can be booked for events of all kinds. The 80,000 sq. m (861,100 sq. ft) large park is located opposite the convention center and is the ideal place to relax between business meetings and hours spent in front of the computer screen.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Les chambres et suites disposent d&rsquo;un &eacute;quipement moderne et de hautes fen&ecirc;tres qui laissent copieusement entrer la lumi&egrave;re naturelle du jour. Des lits confortables et des espaces de travail spacieux en font un lieu o&ugrave; travail et d&eacute;tente vont de pair.<p>Le Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle b&eacute;n&eacute;ficie d&rsquo;une liaison directe vers le Circle Convention Center o&ugrave; l&rsquo;on peut r&eacute;server des salles &eacute;v&eacute;nementielles uniques pour toutes les occasions. Le parc de 80&nbsp;000 m2 en face du centre de congr&egrave;s est l&rsquo;endroit id&eacute;al pour se d&eacute;tendre entre les r&eacute;unions d&rsquo;affaires et apr&egrave;s des heures pass&eacute;es devant l&rsquo;ordinateur.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Le moderne camere e suite sono dotate di finestre a tutta altezza, che fanno entrare tantissima luce naturale. I comodi letti e le spaziose aree di lavoro danno vita a un luogo in cui professione e relax vanno a braccetto.<p>L&rsquo;hotel Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle &egrave; collegato direttamente con il The Circle Convention Center, dove &egrave; possibile affittare straordinarie sale per qualsiasi tipo di ricorrenza o evento. Di fronte al centro congressi si estendono gli 80.000 m2 del parco, un luogo ideale per rilassarsi tra una riunione d&rsquo;affari e diverse ore passate davanti al computer.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In Gehdistanz zum Flughafen und nur wenige Minuten vom Stadtzentrum entfernt, bietet das Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle in der Circle Destination alles, was Reisende brauchen."@de,
        "Situated within walking distance of the airport and just minutes from the city center, the Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle has everything that travelers need."@en,
        "A distance de marche de l’aéroport et à seulement quelques minutes du centre-ville, le Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle offre tout ce dont les voyageurs ont besoin."@fr,
        "Raggiungibile a  piedi dall’aeroporto e a pochi minuti dal centro, l’hotel Hyatt Regency Zurich Airport The Circle offre tutto ciò che serve a chi viaggia."@it ;
    schema:email "zrhrz-rfp@hyatt.com" ;
