    schema:dateModified "2025-09-24T14:40:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Der traditionelle Landgasthof verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber 14 heimelige Hotelzimmer. Jedes ist mit WC/Dusche, grossen Flatscreens, Minibar, Telefon und Wifi eingerichtet.<p>F&uuml;r den grossen oder kleinen Hunger heissen die &laquo;Buurestube&raquo; oder &laquo;Leuen-Beiz&raquo; ihre G&auml;ste willkommen.</p><p>Wer auf schlichte Eleganz und beste Gerichte mit erlesenen Weinen setzt, wird in der Buurestube sein Gl&uuml;ck finden. F&uuml;r ungezwungene Gem&uuml;tlichkeit, schmackhafte Gerichte und mundige Weine geht&rsquo;s in die Leuen-Beiz. Und wenn die Sonne scheint, l&auml;dt der Garten mit Lounge zu gem&uuml;tlichen Momenten umgeben von Natur ein.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The traditional country guesthouse features 14 comfortable guest rooms. Each is equipped with a WC/shower, large flatscreen TV, minibar, telephone, and Wi-Fi.<p>The Buurestube and Leuen-Beiz restaurants welcome hungry guests with a good selection of snacks and hearty fare.</p><p>Those who prefer simple elegance and first-class cuisine accompanied by choice wines will find what they are looking for in the Buurestube. For casual coziness, tasty dishes, and mouth-watering wines, the Leuen-Beiz is the place to be. And when the sun is shining, the garden with a lounge area invites guests to spend some pleasant moments out-of-doors surrounded by nature.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Cet h&ocirc;tel rural traditionnel dispose de 14 chambres confortables chacune &eacute;quip&eacute;e de toilette/douche, grand &eacute;cran plat, minibar, t&eacute;l&eacute;phone et wifi.<p>Les salles &laquo;&nbsp;Buurestube&nbsp;&raquo; ou &laquo;&nbsp;Leuen-Beiz&nbsp;&raquo; accueillent les client-e-s et assouvissent les petites et grandes faims.</p><p>Si vous privil&eacute;giez une &eacute;l&eacute;gance simple et de bons petits plats avec vins s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;s, la salle &laquo;&nbsp;Buurestube&nbsp;&raquo; fera votre bonheur. Pour une ambiance conviviale et d&eacute;contract&eacute;e, et de merveilleux plats et vins, la salle &laquo;&nbsp;Leuen-Beiz&nbsp;&raquo; est parfaite. Le jardin avec son lounge vous invite &agrave; passer d&rsquo;agr&eacute;ables moments ensoleill&eacute;s dans un environnement naturel.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il tradizionale albergo di campagna conta 14 accoglienti camere, ognuna delle quali &egrave; dotata di WC/doccia, grande schermo piatto, minibar, telefono e Wi-Fi.<p>Buurestube o Leuen-Beiz accontentano gli ospiti che vogliono mangiare un pasto sostanzioso o solo uno spuntino.</p><p>Chi ama l&rsquo;eleganza sobria e piatti di qualit&agrave;, accompagnati da vini selezionati, trova pane per i propri denti alla Buurestube. Chi, invece, preferisce un&rsquo;ospitalit&agrave; spensierata, piatti gustosi e vini equilibrati non pu&ograve; perdersi la Leuen-Beiz. Quando splende il sole, la scelta giusta &egrave; senz&rsquo;altro il giardino con lounge, che invita a trascorrere istanti di pace immersi nella natura.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Am Fusse des wunderschönen Uetlibergs und nur wenige Minuten vom Stadtzentrum entfernt, befindet sich der gemütliche Gasthof."@de,
        "This cozy country guesthouse is situated at the foot of the beautiful Uetliberg and just a few minutes from the city center."@en,
        "Cet hôtel chaleureux est situé au pied du magnifique Uetliberg et à seulement quelques minutes du centre-ville."@fr,
        "Ai piedi dello splendido Uetliberg, a pochi minuti dal centro, si trova questo accogliente albergo."@it ;
