    schema:dateModified "2025-11-10T13:50:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Das moderne Hotel bietet 116 Zimmer, die mit jeglichem Komfort wie Klimaanlage, Kaffeemaschinen, WLAN und weiterem ausgestattet sind. F&uuml;r Tagungen und Events bietet das Hotel zwei lichtdurchflutete Veranstaltungsr&auml;ume sowie Co-Working-Spaces f&uuml;r Einzelpersonen und Gruppen in der Lobby.<p>F&uuml;r Business-Meetings und -Reisen ist das Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport strategisch perfekt gelegen. Dank der direkten Anbindung an die Flughafen Terminals sind die G&auml;ste in wenigen Augenblicken bereit zum Take-Off. Wer die abwechslungsreiche Stadt Z&uuml;rich aus purer Freude oder gesch&auml;ftlich besuchen will, ist in nur 15 Minuten im Stadtzentrum.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The modern hotel features 116 rooms equipped with every amenity, including air conditioning, a coffee machine, Wi-Fi, and more. For meetings and events, the hotel offers two light-flooded function rooms, as well as co-working spaces for individuals and groups in the lobby.<p>The Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport is ideally located for business trips and meetings. Thanks to its direct access to the airport terminals, guests can check in in no time at all. Those who want to visit the multi-faceted city, whether for business or pleasure, can reach the city center in just 15 minutes.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Cet h&ocirc;tel moderne tout confort propose 116 chambres &eacute;quip&eacute;es de climatisation, machine &agrave; caf&eacute;, wifi et bien plus encore. Les deux salles de r&eacute;union tr&egrave;s lumineuses de l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel ainsi que les espaces de travail partag&eacute;s du hall, en individuel ou en groupe, sont parfaits pour les conf&eacute;rences et &eacute;v&egrave;nements.<p>L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Leonardo Zurich Airport b&eacute;n&eacute;ficie d&rsquo;une situation strat&eacute;gique id&eacute;ale pour les r&eacute;unions et voyages d&rsquo;affaires. Une liaison directe vers les terminaux de l&rsquo;a&eacute;roport permet d&rsquo;embarquer en un clin d&rsquo;&oelig;il. 15 minutes suffisent pour atteindre le centre-ville et d&eacute;couvrir par pur plaisir ou pour affaires la grande diversit&eacute; de Zurich.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il moderno hotel propone 116 camere dotate di ogni comfort, come aria condizionata, macchina del caff&egrave;, Wi-Fi e altro. Per riunioni ed eventi sono a disposizione due luminose sale, mentre nella lobby si trovano postazioni di co-working per singoli e gruppi.<p>Il Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport &egrave; situato in posizione strategica per meeting e viaggi di lavoro. Grazie al collegamento diretto ai terminal dell&rsquo;aeroporto, gli ospiti sono pronti per decollare in pochi istanti. Chi desidera visitare la variegata citt&agrave; di Zurigo per piacere o per lavoro pu&ograve; raggiungerla in soli 15 minuti.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport befindet sich in unmittelbarer Nähe des Zürcher Flughafens und nur 15 Minuten vom Stadtzentrum entfernt."@de,
        "The Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport is located in the immediate vicinity of Zurich Airport and only 15 minutes from the city center."@en,
        "L’hôtel Leonardo Zurich Airport se trouve à proximité immédiate de l’aéroport de Zurich et à seulement 15 minutes du centre-ville."@fr,
        "Il Leonardo Hotel Zurich Airport si trova nelle immediate vicinanze dell’aeroporto di Zurigo e a soli 15 minuti dal centro."@it ;
