    namiont:textTeaser "An schöner Lage am Zürichsee geniessen Gäste im LUX Restaurant & Bar Gerichte mit Zürich-Bezug."@de,
        "In a superb location on Lake Zurich the LUX Restaurant & Bar serves dishes with a Zurich connection."@en,
        "Les client-e-s du LUX Restaurant & Bar peuvent savourer d’authentiques plats zurichois au bord du lac."@fr,
        "Gli ospiti del LUX Restaurant & Bar, in riva al Lago di Zurigo, gustano piatti che parlano di Zurigo."@it ;
