    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Mais-Tortillas,&nbsp;gef&uuml;llt&nbsp;mit&nbsp;diversen&nbsp;saftigen&nbsp;Fleischst&uuml;cken&nbsp;oder&nbsp;vegetarisch&nbsp;mit&nbsp;Oaxaca-K&auml;se&nbsp;und&nbsp;s&uuml;ss-gegarten&nbsp;Ananas&nbsp;oder&nbsp;ein&nbsp;Ceviche&nbsp;aus&nbsp;Meerhechtfilet: Alle&nbsp;diese&nbsp;K&ouml;stlichkeiten&nbsp;gibt&rsquo;s&nbsp;im&nbsp;Cartell in Z&uuml;rich.&nbsp;&nbsp;<p>Wer&nbsp;Mexiko&nbsp;vermisst&nbsp;oder&nbsp;wissen&nbsp;m&ouml;chte,&nbsp;wie&nbsp;Mexiko&nbsp;schmeckt,&nbsp;ist&nbsp;hier&nbsp;am&nbsp;richtigen&nbsp;Ort:&nbsp;Authentisch&nbsp;sind&nbsp;im&nbsp;&laquo;Cartell&raquo;&nbsp;neben&nbsp;den&nbsp;Speisen&nbsp;aber&nbsp;auch&nbsp;die Cocktails, der Tequila,&nbsp;der&nbsp;Mezcal und die&nbsp;Wandgem&auml;lde.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Nat&uuml;rlich&nbsp;wird&nbsp;der &laquo;Taco Tuesday&raquo;&nbsp;auch&nbsp;im&nbsp;Cartell&nbsp;Grossgeschrieben&nbsp;und an&nbsp;einer&nbsp;h&uuml;bschen&nbsp;Bar&nbsp;bekommen&nbsp;G&auml;ste&nbsp;die&nbsp;besten&nbsp;Drinks&nbsp;mit&nbsp;einem&nbsp;Hauch&nbsp;Mexiko.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Corn tortillas filled with various juicy pieces of meat or vegetarian-style&nbsp;with Oaxaca cheese and sweet&nbsp;cooked&nbsp;pineapple,&nbsp;or ceviche&nbsp;made from&nbsp;hake fillet: all these delicacies are&nbsp;on the menu&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;Cartell in Zurich.&nbsp;&nbsp;<p>Those who&nbsp;miss Mexico or want to know what Mexico tastes like&nbsp;are at the right address at the&nbsp;Cartell. And not only the&nbsp;food is&nbsp;authentic here, but also&nbsp;the cocktails, the tequila, the mezcal,&nbsp;and the&nbsp;wall paintings.&nbsp;</p><p>Of course,&nbsp;&ldquo;Taco Tuesday&rdquo;&nbsp;is also a&nbsp;major&nbsp;event at the&nbsp;Cartell, and guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the best drinks with a&nbsp;hint&nbsp;of Mexico at&nbsp;the attractive&nbsp;bar.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Tortillas de ma&iuml;s&nbsp;fourr&eacute;es avec diff&eacute;rents et succulents morceaux de&nbsp;viande,&nbsp;tortillas v&eacute;g&eacute;tariennes&nbsp;avec&nbsp;fromage&nbsp;oaxaca&nbsp;et&nbsp;ananas doux cuit ou ceviche de merlu&#8239;: toutes ces sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s sont propos&eacute;es au&nbsp;Cartell&nbsp;de&nbsp;Zurich.&nbsp;&nbsp;<p>Si le&nbsp;Mexique vous manque ou si vous voulez&nbsp;red&eacute;couvrir ses saveurs, vous &ecirc;tes&nbsp;ici&nbsp;au bon endroit.&nbsp;Au&nbsp;&laquo;&#8239;Cartell&#8239;&raquo;&nbsp;tout est authentique&#8239;:&nbsp;plats,&nbsp;cocktails, tequila, mezcal et peintures murales.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Au&nbsp;Cartell&nbsp;le&nbsp;&laquo;&#8239;Mardi des Tacos&#8239;&raquo; est&nbsp;un moment fort o&ugrave;&nbsp;les clients peuvent&nbsp;aussi d&eacute;guster au&nbsp;magnifique&nbsp;bar les meilleurs cocktails&nbsp;concoct&eacute;s avec&nbsp;une&nbsp;petite&nbsp;touche&nbsp;mexicaine.&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Tortilla di mais ripiene di succulenti pezzi di carne o in versione vegetariana con formaggio Oaxaca, dolcissimo ananas cotto oppure un&nbsp;ceviche&nbsp;di nasello: tutte queste prelibatezze vengono servite&nbsp;al&nbsp;Cartell&nbsp;a Zurigo.&nbsp;&nbsp;<p>Chi ha nostalgia del Messico o vuole sapere che sapore abbia questo paese &egrave; nel posto giusto. Al&nbsp;Cartell&nbsp;i piatti sono autentici, proprio come i cocktail, la tequila, il&nbsp;mezcal&nbsp;e i murales.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Ovviamente non pu&ograve; mancare il &ldquo;Taco&nbsp;Tuesday&rdquo;, mentre al grazioso bar si servono drink favolosi dal sapore messicano.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Wer in Zürich ein Stückchen Mexiko erleben möchte, geht zum «Cartell»."@de,
        "Anyone who would like to experience a little bit of Mexico in Zurich should head for the Cartell."@en,
        "Si vous voulez avoir une petite idée de ce qu’est le Mexique, venez au « Cartell »."@fr,
        "Per vivere un po’ di Messico a Zurigo si va al Cartell."@it ;
    schema:email "zuerich@cartell.ch" ;
