    schema:description "<p>Drei verschiedene &Uuml;bernachtungskonzepte, 8 Seminarr&auml;ume und 10 Gruppenr&auml;ume stehen den G&auml;sten zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die grossz&uuml;gige Parkanlage eignet sich optimal f&uuml;r Pausen w&auml;hrend den Seminaren.&nbsp;<table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><strong>Fl&auml;che (m2)</strong></td><td><strong>Seminar</strong></td><td><strong>Konzert</strong></td><td><strong>Anzahl Personen</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Grosser Mythen</strong></td><td>164</td><td>96</td><td>130</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kleiner Mythen</strong></td><td>56</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Amselspitz</strong></td><td>85</td><td>50</td><td>60</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gross Aubrig</strong></td><td>111</td><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chli Aubrig</strong></td><td>26</td><td>12</td><td>130</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Druesberg</strong></td><td>66</td><td>44</td><td>50</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Etzel</strong></td><td>88</td><td>44</td><td>70</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hummel</strong></td><td>115</td><td>60</td><td>76</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Atelier</strong></td><td>106</td><td>42</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Annuntiata-Kapelle</strong></p></td><td>154</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>bis 100</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Club</strong></td><td>110</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>bis 50</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Three different accommodation options, 8 seminar rooms, and 10 group rooms are available to guests. The spacious park is ideal for breaks during seminars.&nbsp;<table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><strong>Area (m2)</strong></td><td><strong>Classroom</strong></td><td><strong>Concert</strong></td><td><strong>No. of people</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Grosser Mythen</strong></td><td>164</td><td>96</td><td>130</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kleiner Mythen</strong></td><td>56</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Amselspitz</strong></td><td>85</td><td>50</td><td>60</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gross Aubrig</strong></td><td>111</td><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chli Aubrig</strong></td><td>26</td><td>12</td><td>130</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Druesberg</strong></td><td>66</td><td>44</td><td>50</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Etzel</strong></td><td>88</td><td>44</td><td>70</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hummel</strong></td><td>115</td><td>60</td><td>76</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Atelier</strong></td><td>106</td><td>42</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Annuntiata-Kapelle</strong></td><td>154</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>up to 100</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Club</strong></td><td>110</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>up to 50</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@en ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel Allegro befindet sich zwischen dem Klosterdorf und dem Sihlsee. Das seit dem Jahr 2016 zertifizierte Seminarhotel hat eine Infrastruktur, welche konsequent auf Seminare und Workshops ausgerichtet ist."@de,
        "The Hotel Allegro is located between the monastery and Lake Sihl. Certified since 2016, this seminar hotel has infrastructure that is consistently geared towards seminars and workshops."@en ;
