    schema:description "<p>Wer demn&auml;chst eine Bergwanderung oder einen Ausflug in die Natur plant, nicht aber &uuml;ber die angemessene Ausr&uuml;stung verf&uuml;gt, besucht am besten den Secondhand-Shop 2nd Peak in Z&uuml;rich.<p>Gleich an der Europaallee gelegen, finden Abenteurer:innen hier hochwertige und erprobte Outdoorbekleidung und Ausr&uuml;stung. So gut wie neu &ndash; nur g&uuml;nstiger und nachhaltiger. Von ihren Vorbesitzenden mit Liebe getragen und sorgf&auml;ltig vom 2nd-Peak-Team ausgew&auml;hlt, finden die Secondhand-St&uuml;cke mit wenig Gebrauchsspuren und zu stark reduzierten Preisen neue und gl&uuml;ckliche Besitzer:innen.</p><p>Der Laden ist gleich an der Europaallee nahe dem Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich zu finden und bietet auf 2 Etagen ein grosses Sortiment an Wanderhosen, -Shirts, -Schuhen, -Jacken, aber auch Accessoires wie Caps und Sonnenbrillen oder Ausr&uuml;stung wie Schlafs&auml;cke und Rucks&auml;cke.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>If you are planning a mountain hike or a trip into the great outdoors but do not have the appropriate equipment, you should pay a visit to the 2nd Peak secondhand store in Zurich.<p>Here adventurers will find high-quality, tried-and-tested outdoor clothing and equipment. As good as new &ndash; only cheaper and more sustainable. Worn with love by their previous owners and carefully selected by the 2nd Peak team, the secondhand items &ndash; which show little sign of wear and tear and are on sale at greatly reduced prices &ndash; can find new and happy owners.</p><p>The store is situated on Europaallee, near Zurich Main Station, and spread over two stories offers a wide range of hiking pants, shirts, jackets and boots, as well as accessories such as caps and sunglasses and equipment such as sleeping bags and backpacks.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Si vous planifiez prochainement une randonn&eacute;e en montagne ou une excursion dans la nature mais ne disposez pas du bon &eacute;quipement, rendez-vous &agrave; la boutique d&rsquo;occasion 2nd Peak de Zurich.<p>&Agrave; l&rsquo;Europaallee les aventurier-i&egrave;re-s trouveront des v&ecirc;tements et &eacute;quipements de plein air de qualit&eacute; et &eacute;prouv&eacute;s. Quasi neufs mais &agrave; bas prix et durables. Port&eacute;es avec amour par les propri&eacute;taires pr&eacute;c&eacute;dent-e-s et soigneusement s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;es par l&rsquo;&eacute;quipe de 2nd Peak, les articles d&rsquo;occasion peu us&eacute;s et propos&eacute;s &agrave; prix fortement r&eacute;duit font le bonheur des nouveaux-velles propri&eacute;taires.</p><p>La boutique situ&eacute;e &agrave; l&rsquo;Europaallee pr&egrave;s de la gare centrale de Zurich propose sur deux &eacute;tages un vaste choix de pantalons, tee-shirts, chaussures, vestes de randonn&eacute;e mais aussi des accessoires comme les casquettes et les lunettes de soleil ou des &eacute;quipements comme les sacs de couchage et les sacs &agrave; dos.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>State programmando una gita in montagna o un&rsquo;escursione nella natura, ma non avete l&rsquo;attrezzatura giusta? Ci pensa il negozio di seconda mano 2nd Peak di Zurigo.<p>Situato nella Europaallee, propone agli amanti dell&rsquo;avventura abbigliamento e accessori outdoor di qualit&agrave;. Pari al nuovo, ma pi&ugrave; economici e sostenibili. Indossati con cura dai precedenti proprietari e selezionati con attenzione dal team di 2nd Peak, gli articoli di seconda mano presentano pochi segni di usura, sono fortemente scontati e aspettano solo i loro nuovi proprietari.</p><p>Il negozio &egrave; nella Europaallee, vicino alla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo. Su 2 piani, offre un ampio assortimento di pantaloni, magliette, scarpe e giacche da trekking, ma anche accessori come cappellini da baseball e occhiali da sole, oppure equipaggiamento come sacchi a pelo e zaini.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Hier finden Abenteurer:innen hochwertige Outdoorbekleidung und -Accessoires zu günstigen Preisen. Und handeln dabei nachhaltig."@de,
        "Here adventurers can find high-quality outdoor clothing and accessories at reasonable prices. And act sustainably, too."@en,
        "Les aventurier-ière-s trouveront ici des vêtements et accessoires de plein air de qualité, à bas prix et en même temps durables."@fr,
        "Qui, gli animi avventurosi trovano abbigliamento e accessori outdoor di qualità a prezzi convenienti. E favoriscono la sostenibilità."@it ;
    schema:email "info@2ndpeak.ch" ;
