    schema:description "<p>Die Kaffeebar mit angeschlossenem City-Hotel ist jung und typisch z&uuml;rcherisch. Altbew&auml;hrte Z&uuml;rcher Beizen Tradition vermischt mit modernem und mond&auml;nem Lebensgef&uuml;hl. Die Pension verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber liebevoll eingerichtete Zimmer. Besonders geeignet f&uuml;r City-Touristen, die Z&uuml;rich hautnah erleben m&ouml;chten. &Ouml;ffnungszeiten Kafi: Montag-Mittwoch 08.00-24.00 Uhr/Donnerstag-Freitag 08.00-01.00 Uhr/Samstag 09.00-01.00 Uhr/Sonntag 09.00-24.00 Uhr. Check in:15.00-23.45/Check out: bis 11.00 Uhr.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The charming guesthouse with its in-house caf&eacute;-bar is nestled between the lively Kreis 5 and the university quarter. Each of the five rooms has been individually and lovingly designed by local artists. The shared bathroom is on the same floor as the rooms.<p>The Caf&eacute;-Bar Kafischnaps combines tried-and-tested caf&eacute; tradition with cosmopolitan lifestyle. Here, locals come together with tourists, and intellectuals with manual workers &ndash; a reflection of Zurich&rsquo;s attitude to life.</p><p>In summer, guests can reach the legendary Letten riverside bathing facility in just a few minutes, or meet for a drink or meal in any of the numerous bars and restaurants in the Kreis 5 district.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Room category&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Cost per night&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Kirsch &ndash;&nbsp;Single room</td><td>80.00 CHF</td></tr><tr><td>Zw&auml;tschge &ndash;&nbsp;Double room</td><td>95.00 CHF</td></tr><tr><td>Williams &ndash;&nbsp;Double room with separate beds</td><td>105.00 CHF</td></tr><tr><td>Quitte &ndash;&nbsp;Double room</td><td>120.00 CHF</td></tr><tr><td>Pfl&uuml;mli &ndash; Double room with balcony</td><td>130.00 CHF</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le caf&eacute;-bar attenant &agrave; l'hotel City est r&eacute;cent et typiquement zurichois. L'ancienne tradition zurichoise des bistros se mele &agrave; une fa&ccedil;on de vivre moderne et chic. La pension dispose de chambres tendrement am&eacute;nag&eacute;es. Convient particuli&egrave;rement aux touristes qui souhaitent profiter pleinement de la ville de Zurich. Heures d&acute;ouverture, caf&eacute;: du lundi &agrave; mercredi 08.00-24.00/jeudi &agrave; vendredi 08.00-01.00/samedi 09.00-01.00h/dimanche 09.00-24.00 Check in: 15.00-23.45 Check out: jusqu&acute;&agrave; 11:00</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il bar caff&egrave; con annesso city hotel offre un ambiente giovane e tipicamente zurighese, dove l&acute;antica tradizione delle \"beizen\" si unisce ad un&acute;atmosfera moderna e mondana. La pensione dispone di camere amorosamente arredate. Particolarmente consigliabile per i turisti in visita alla citt&agrave; che vogliono scoprire la vera Zurigo. Orario di apertura caffetteria:Lunedi fino Mercoledi ore 08.00-24.00h / Giovedi fino Venerdi 08.00-01.00h/ Sabato 09.00-01.00h/Domenica ore 09.00-24.00h. Check in: 15.00-23.:45 Check out: 11.00</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Herzen von Zürich, zwischen den Quartieren Wipkingen und Unterstrass und nur wenige Minuten von der Langstrasse entfernt, befindet sich die Pension Kafischnaps."@de,
        "The Pension Kafischnaps is located in the heart of Zurich, between the Wipkingen and Unterstrass quarters and just a few minutes from Langstrasse."@en,
        "La pension Kafischnaps est située au cœur de Zurich, entre les quartiers de Wipkingen et d’Unterstrass, à seulement quelques minutes de la rue Langstrasse."@fr,
        "Nel cuore di Zurigo, tra i quartieri di Wipkingen e Unterstrass, a pochi minuti dalla Langstrasse, si trova la pensione Kafischnaps."@it ;
    schema:email "contact@kafischnaps.ch" ;
