        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Wer sich &uuml;ber sch&ouml;ne und dabei nachhaltige Produkte freut, sollte collab z&uuml;rich an der Pfingstweidstrasse in Z&uuml;richs Westen unbedingt besuchen.<p>Hier gibt es von lokal produzierter Mode &uuml;ber Wohnaccessoires, M&ouml;bel und Dekorationsartikel bis hin zu kleinen Alltagshelfern alles, was das &ouml;kologische Herz begehrt.</p><p>Wer also etwas Sch&ouml;nes aus Z&uuml;rich nach Hause mitbringen m&ouml;chte, ist in dieser jungen Boutique am richtigen Ort.</p><p>Weiterer Standort:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/collab+z%C3%BCrich/@47.3768901,8.526247,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xfd51bfa04b0ecbd2?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj_xILWrfj4AhU0_rsIHUpMDykQ_BJ6BAhBEAU\">Langstrasse 64, 8004 Zurich</a></p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Anyone who likes beautiful products that are also sustainable should definitely pay a visit to collab z&uuml;rich on Pfingstweidstrasse in Z&uuml;rich-West.<p>Here they can find everything their ecological heart desires &ndash; from locally produced fashion to home accessories, furniture and decorative items, right through to small everyday aids.</p><p>So if you want to take home something beautiful from Zurich, this young boutique is the place to go.</p><p>Additional branch at <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/collab+z%C3%BCrich/@47.3768901,8.526247,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xfd51bfa04b0ecbd2?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj_xILWrfj4AhU0_rsIHUpMDykQ_BJ6BAhBEAU\">Langstrasse 64, 8004 Zurich</a></p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Si vous aimez les produits &agrave; la fois beaux et durables, collab z&uuml;rich dans la rue Pfingstweidstrasse de Z&uuml;rich-West est la bonne adresse.<p>Tout ce dont un-e &eacute;cologiste peut r&ecirc;ver est ici&nbsp;: des v&ecirc;tements locaux tendance aux petites aides pratiques en passant par les accessoires d&rsquo;int&eacute;rieur, meubles et articles de d&eacute;coration.</p><p>Si vous voulez rapporter de belles choses de Zurich, cette jeune boutique est le bon choix.</p><p>Autre site&nbsp;: &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/collab+z%C3%BCrich/@47.3768901,8.526247,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xfd51bfa04b0ecbd2?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj_xILWrfj4AhU0_rsIHUpMDykQ_BJ6BAhBEAU\">Langstrasse 64, 8004 Zurich</a></p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Gli amanti dei prodotti belli e sostenibili non possono perdersi collab z&uuml;rich, nella Pfingstweidstrasse di Z&uuml;rich-West.<p>Moda di produzione locale, complementi d&rsquo;arredo, mobili, articoli decorativi, piccoli aiutanti per la quotidianit&agrave;: qui c&rsquo;&egrave; tutto ci&ograve; che un cuore ecologico possa desiderare.</p><p>Chi desidera portare a casa qualcosa di bello da Zurigo deve fare tappa in questa giovane boutique.</p><p>Altra filiale: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/collab+z%C3%BCrich/@47.3768901,8.526247,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xfd51bfa04b0ecbd2?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj_xILWrfj4AhU0_rsIHUpMDykQ_BJ6BAhBEAU\">Langstrasse 64, 8004 Zurigo</a></p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Lokal und nachhaltig wird bei collab zürich grossgeschrieben."@de,
        "Local and sustainable is of prime importance at collab zürich."@en,
        "Pour collab zürich, régionalité et durabilité sont primordiales."@fr,
        "“Locale” e “sostenibile” sono aggettivi importanti da collab zürich."@it ;
