    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-08-31T15:16:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>In der Visitor Information (ehem. Tourist Information) beraten fachkundige G&auml;steberater:innen mit vielen Insidertipps und Informationen zu den folgenden Themen:<ul><li>Massgeschneiderte Reiseprogramme</li><li>Stadtf&uuml;hrungen und Tagesausfl&uuml;ge</li><li><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/3083\" data-entity-uuid=\"4c88fa5a-a7ff-491a-acb9-617fcb1887fd\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Z&uuml;rich Card</a> und andere Fahrkarten f&uuml;r &ouml;ffentliche Verkehrsmittel</li><li>Hotelvermittlungen</li><li>Konzert- und Veranstaltungstickets (Seetickets und Ticketino, aber kein Ticketcorner-Vorverkauf)</li><li>Buchungen von <a href=\"https://www.flixbus.ch/\">Flixbus&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;und anderen Reiseveranstaltenden/besuchen/shopping/visitor-information</li><li>Privat- und/oder Gruppenf&uuml;hrungen</li></ul><p><strong>Souvenirs</strong><br>Im <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/122308\" data-entity-uuid=\"ab921f00-8bee-4c64-a5af-5258edd84b14\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Souvenir Shop</a> vor Ort gibt es Schokolade, Postkarten, Holzfiguren, das typische Schweizer &laquo;Sackmesser&raquo; (Taschenmesser) und mehr.</p><p><strong>Gut zu wissen:</strong></p><ul><li>In der Visitor Information wird die &laquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich-geschenkkarte.ch/\">Z&uuml;rich Geschenkkarte</a>&raquo; als Zahlungsmittel akzeptiert.</li><li>Die Visitor Information befindet sich im Erdgeschoss des Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich und ist <a href=\"https://www.ginto.guide/de/entries/9a92494f-a50f-4aa9-8ea6-2c96b6bfedfa\">barrierefrei zug&auml;nglich</a>.</li></ul></p>"@de,
        "<p>At the Visitor Information (formerly Tourist Information), knowledgeable consultants provide visitors with numerous insider tips and information on the following topics:<ul><li>Tailor-made travel programs</li><li>City tours and day trips</li><li><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/3083\">Z&uuml;rich Card</a> and other public transportation tickets</li><li>Hotel reservations</li><li>Concert and event tickets&nbsp;(Seetickets and Ticketino, but no Ticketcorner presale)</li><li>Tickets for <a href=\"https://www.flixbus.ch/\">Flixbus</a>&nbsp; coaches and other tour operators</li><li>Private and/or group tours</li></ul><p><strong>Souvenirs</strong></p><p>The on-site <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/122308\" data-entity-uuid=\"ab921f00-8bee-4c64-a5af-5258edd84b14\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\"><strong>souvenir shop</strong></a> offers chocolate, postcards, wooden figurines, the typical Swiss &ldquo;Sackmesser&rdquo; (Swiss Army Knife) and more.</p><p><strong>Good to know:</strong></p><ul><li>The &ldquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich-geschenkkarte.ch/\">Z&uuml;rich Gift Card</a>&rdquo; is accepted as a means of payment at the Visitor Information.</li><li>The Visitor Information is located on the ground floor of Zurich Main Station and is&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ginto.guide/en/entries/9a92494f-a50f-4aa9-8ea6-2c96b6bfedfa\">wheelchair accessible</a>.</li></ul></p>"@en,
        "<p>&Agrave; la Visitor Information (anciennement Tourist Information), le personnel qualifi&eacute; fournit des conseils pratiques et des informations sur les sujets suivants :<ul><li>Programmes de voyage personnalis&eacute;s</li><li>Visites guid&eacute;es de la ville et excursions d&rsquo;une journ&eacute;e</li><li><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/fr/node/3083\">Z&uuml;rich Card </a>et autres billets de transport public</li><li>R&eacute;servations d&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel</li><li>Billets de concert et d&rsquo;&eacute;v&eacute;nements&nbsp;(Seetickets et Ticketino, mais pas de pr&eacute;vente Ticketcorner)</li><li>R&eacute;servations de billets de <a href=\"https://www.flixbus.ch/\">Flixbus</a>&nbsp;et d&rsquo;autres voyagistes</li><li>Visites guid&eacute;es priv&eacute;es et/ou de groupe</li></ul><p><strong>Souvenirs</strong></p><p>La <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/122308\" data-entity-uuid=\"ab921f00-8bee-4c64-a5af-5258edd84b14\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\"><strong>boutique de souvenirs</strong></a> sur place propose du chocolat, des cartes postales, des figurines en bois, le &laquo; couteau suisse &raquo; typique (couteau de poche) et bien plus encore.</p><p><strong>Bon &agrave; savoir :</strong></p><ul><li>Le &laquo; <a href=\"https://www.zuerich-geschenkkarte.ch/\"><strong>bon-cadeau Zurich</strong></a> &raquo; est accept&eacute; comme moyen de paiement au guichet de Visitor Information.</li><li>Le guichet de Visitor Information se trouve au rez-de-chauss&eacute;e de la gare centrale de Zurich et est <a href=\"https://www.ginto.guide/de/entries/9a92494f-a50f-4aa9-8ea6-2c96b6bfedfa\"><strong>accessible aux personnes &agrave; mobilit&eacute; r&eacute;duite</strong></a>.</li></ul></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Presso il Visitor Information (ex Tourist Information), consulenti turistici esperti forniscono consigli da persone esperte e informazioni sui seguenti argomenti:<ul><li>programmi di viaggio su misura</li><li>visite guidate ed escursioni giornaliere</li><li><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/it/node/3083\">Z&uuml;rich Card</a> e altri biglietti per i trasporti pubblici</li><li>prenotazioni alberghiere</li><li>biglietti per concerti ed eventi&nbsp;(Seetickets e Ticketino, ma nessuna prevendita Ticketcorner)</li><li>prenotazioni di <a href=\"https://www.flixbus.ch/\">Flixbus</a>&nbsp;e altri tour operator</li><li>visite guidate private e/o di gruppo</li></ul><p><strong>Souvenir</strong><br>Nel <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/122308\" data-entity-uuid=\"ab921f00-8bee-4c64-a5af-5258edd84b14\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\"><strong>negozio di souvenir</strong></a> in loco si trovano cioccolato, cartoline, statuine in legno, il tipico &ldquo;coltellino svizzero&rdquo; (coltellino tascabile) e altro ancora.</p><p><strong>Buono a sapersi:</strong></p><ul><li>Il Visitor Information accetta la &ldquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich-geschenkkarte.ch/\">Zurich Gift Card</a>&rdquo; come mezzo di pagamento</li><li>La Visitor Information si trova al piano terra della Stazione Centrale di Zurigo ed &egrave; <a href=\"https://www.ginto.guide/it/entries/9a92494f-a50f-4aa9-8ea6-2c96b6bfedfa\">priva di barriere architettoniche</a>.</li></ul></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Insidertipps, Informationen zu Stadtführungen, Exkursionen und viel mehr erhalten Interessierte in der Visitor Information im Hauptbahnhof Zürich."@de,
        "Visitors can get insider tips and information about city tours, excursions, and much more at the Visitor Information at Zurich Main Station."@en,
        "Les personnes intéressées trouveront des conseils d'initiés, des informations sur les visites guidées de la ville, les excursions et bien plus encore à la Visitor Information dans la gare centrale de Zurich."@fr,
        "Per consigli esclusivi, informazioni su visite guidate, escursioni e molto altro, gli ospiti possono rivolgersi alla Visitor Information nella stazione centrale di Zurigo."@it ;
    schema:email "info@zuerich.com" ;
    schema:geo _:N112918c2ab914f65b7267750c766eff4 ;
    schema:identifier "1010791" ;
