    schema:description "<p>Als erste komplett vegane B&auml;ckerei begr&uuml;sst Bakery Bakery hungrige Schleckerm&auml;uler in der Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse im Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich. Das Sortiment umfasst zahlreiche salzige wie s&uuml;sse K&ouml;stlichkeiten &ndash; alles 100% pflanzlichen Ursprungs. Von den Sandwiches bis hin zu den Donuts: Bei diesem vielseitigen Angebot werden alle f&uuml;ndig. Bakery Bakery setzt grossen Wert auf Frische, Regionalit&auml;t und Qualit&auml;t. Alle Backwaren stammen aus der Backstube in Bern und werden t&auml;glich mit dem ersten Zug direkt an den Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich geliefert.<br>&nbsp;<h5><strong>Weitere Filiale:</strong></h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/schaffhauserplatz\"><strong>Schaffhauserplatz</strong></a><br>Hotzestrasse 65<br>8006 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/threeofive\">ThreeOfive</a><br>Hardstrasse 305<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong><br>&nbsp;</li></ul></p>"@de,
        "<p>As the first completely vegan bakery, Bakery Bakery welcomes customers in the Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse at Zurich Main Station. The product range comprises numerous salty as well as sweet baked delicacies &ndash; all of 100% plant origin. From sandwiches to donuts: with such a varied assortment, everyone will find what they are looking for. Bakery Bakery places great emphasis on freshness, regionality, and quality. All the baked products come from the bakery in Bern and are delivered daily on the first train direct to Zurich Main Station.<h5><br><strong>Additional store:&nbsp;</strong></h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/schaffhauserplatz\"><strong>Schaffhauserplatz</strong></a><br>Hotzestrasse 65<br>8006 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/threeofive\">ThreeOfive</a><br>Hardstrasse 305<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li></ul></p>"@en,
        "<p>Bakery Bakery, la premi&egrave;re boulangerie enti&egrave;rement v&eacute;g&eacute;talienne, accueille sa client&egrave;le dans le passage L&ouml;wenstrasse de la gare centrale de Zurich. L&rsquo;assortiment comprend de nombreux d&eacute;lices sal&eacute;s et sucr&eacute;s, tous d&rsquo;origine 100% v&eacute;g&eacute;tale. Le choix est vaste, des sandwichs aux donuts&nbsp;: tout le monde trouvera son bonheur dans cette offre vari&eacute;e.&nbsp; Bakery Bakery accorde une grande importance &agrave; la fra&icirc;cheur, &agrave; la r&eacute;gionalit&eacute; et &agrave; la qualit&eacute;. Tous les produits de boulangerie proviennent du fournil de Berne et sont livr&eacute;s chaque jour par le premier train directement &agrave; la gare centrale de Zurich.<br>&nbsp;<h5><strong>Autre magasin :</strong>&nbsp;</h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/schaffhauserplatz\"><strong>Schaffhauserplatz</strong></a><br>Hotzestrasse 65<br>8006 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/threeofive\">ThreeOfive</a><br>Hardstrasse 305<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li></ul></p>"@fr,
        "<p>In qualit&agrave; di primo panificio interamente vegano, la Bakery Bakery accoglie i suoi golosi clienti nel passaggio della Stazione Centrale di Zurigo che conduce alla L&ouml;wenstrasse. L'assortimento comprende numerose prelibatezze dolci e salate, tutte vegetali al 100%. Dai sandwich ai donut, qui chiunque trova ci&ograve; che preferisce. Bakery Bakery punta su freschezza, regionalit&agrave; e qualit&agrave;. Tutti i prodotti da forno provengono dalla filiale di Berna e vengono consegnati tutti i giorni alla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo con il primo treno.<p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>Un'altra filiale:&nbsp;</strong></h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/schaffhauserplatz\"><strong>Schaffhauserplatz</strong></a><br>Hotzestrasse 65<br>8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.bakerybakery.ch/threeofive\">ThreeOfive</a><br>Hardstrasse 305<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li></ul></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Vom veganen Bagel bis zur Crèmeschnitte: Hier werden alle fündig, die Lust auf komplett pflanzliche Backwaren haben."@de,
        "From vegan bagels to cream slices: here, everyone who has a desire for 100% plant-based baked goods will find what they are looking for."@en,
        "Du bagel au millefeuille végétaliens :  ici, il y a de quoi satisfaire les envies de pâtisseries entièrement végétales."@fr,
        "Dal bagel vegano alla diplomatica vegana: chi ha voglia di prodotti da forno interamente vegetali li trova qui."@it ;
