    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Die saisonalen &Ouml;ffnungszeiten der Bahnen und Freizeiteinrichtungen k&ouml;nnen der <a href=\"https://pizol.com/winter/wintersportbericht/\">Website</a> entnommen werden.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@de,
        "<p>The seasonal opening hours of the railways and leisure facilities can be found on the <a href=\"https://pizol.com/en/winter/winter-sports-report/\">website</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@en,
        "<p>Les horaires d'ouverture saisonniers des remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques et des installations de loisirs sont disponibles sur le <a href=\"https://pizol.com/en/winter/winter-sports-report/\">site web</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Gli orari stagionali di apertura delle funivie e delle strutture ricreative sono disponibili sul <a href=\"https://pizol.com/en/winter/winter-sports-report/\">sito web</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@it ;
