    namiont:placeType namiont:Indoors ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Das grosse Kaufhaus an zentraler Lage bietet alles für den täglichen Bedarf an."@de,
        "This large department store in a central location offers everything for your daily needs."@en,
        "Ce grand magasin bien situé propose tout ce dont on a besoin au quotidien."@fr,
        "I grandi magazzini in posizione centrale offrono tutto ciò che serve per le esigenze quotidiane."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Coop City Zürich St. Annahof"@de,
