    schema:description "<p>Seit 1976 verw&ouml;hnt die B&auml;ckerei Jung die Kundschaft mit verschiedenen Brot-Sorten. Die Zutaten dazu stammen aus regionaler, &ouml;kologischer und saisonaler Herkunft. Die Backkreationen werden in traditionellen Verfahren gebacken. Neben Broten bietet die B&auml;ckerei auch diverse salzige und s&uuml;sse Backwaren, hausgemachte Getr&auml;nke, Sandwiches und vieles mehr an. S&auml;mtliche Jung B&auml;ckereien&nbsp; erstrahlen in einem eleganten und zugleich schlichten Innendesdesign.<p>Diese direkt am Central gelegene Niederlassung bietet neben dem Verkauf von Backwaren und Z&uuml;rcher Spezialit&auml;ten auch Kaffeespezialit&auml;ten von Stoll an.<br>&nbsp;</p><h6>Weitere Filialen:</h6><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\">Jung Altstetten,</a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\">Jung Bahnhof Enge</a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\">Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\">Jung Kreuzplatz</a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\">Jung Limmatplatz</a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Schanzengraben/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!3m1!5s0x47900a01bc6da4a3:0xe60ce645f9b3e9ff!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x47900a01ba3483f1:0x38e21701a4e54206!8m2!3d47.3686171!4d8.5370864!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F1tgx5j12?entry=ttu\">Jung Schanzengraben</a>, Bleicherweg 10, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\">Jung Vulkanplatz</a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\">Jung Wipkingen</a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich<br><br>&nbsp;</li></ul></p>"@de,
        "<p>The B&auml;ckerei Jung has been treating customers to different types of bread since 1976. It uses ingredients that are organic and seasonal, and are sourced from the surrounding region. The baked creations are made using traditional methods. In addition to bread, the bakery also offers various sweet and savory baked goods, homemade drinks, sandwiches, and much more. All Jung bakeries have an elegant yet simple interior design.<p>Besides selling baked goods and Zurich specialties, the bakery &ndash; which is located directly on Central &ndash; also selling coffee specialties from Stoll.<br>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>Additional stores:&nbsp;</strong></h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Schanzengraben/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!3m1!5s0x47900a01bc6da4a3:0xe60ce645f9b3e9ff!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x47900a01ba3483f1:0x38e21701a4e54206!8m2!3d47.3686171!4d8.5370864!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F1tgx5j12?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Schanzengraben</strong></a>, Bleicherweg 10, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@en,
        "<p>Depuis 1976, la boulangerie B&auml;ckerei Jung r&eacute;gale sa client&egrave;le avec diff&eacute;rentes sortes de pain. Les ingr&eacute;dients utilis&eacute;s sont d&rsquo;origine r&eacute;gionale, &eacute;cologique et saisonni&egrave;re. Les cr&eacute;ations boulang&egrave;res sont cuites selon des m&eacute;thodes traditionnelles. Outre les pains, la boulangerie propose &eacute;galement divers produits boulangers sal&eacute;s et sucr&eacute;s, des boissons faites maison, des sandwichs et bien d&rsquo;autres choses encore. Toutes les Jung boulangeries pr&eacute;sentent un design int&eacute;rieur &eacute;l&eacute;gant et sobre.<p>Cette succursale situ&eacute;e sur la place &laquo; Central &raquo; vend des produits de boulangerie, de sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s zurichoises et des sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s de caf&eacute; de Stoll.<br><br><strong>Autres magasins :</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Schanzengraben/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!3m1!5s0x47900a01bc6da4a3:0xe60ce645f9b3e9ff!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x47900a01ba3483f1:0x38e21701a4e54206!8m2!3d47.3686171!4d8.5370864!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F1tgx5j12?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Schanzengraben</strong></a>, Bleicherweg 10, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Dal 1976, il panificio Jung vizia i suoi clienti con vari tipi di pane. Gli ingredienti sono di origine regionale, ecologica e stagionale. I prodotti da forno vengono realizzati seguendo procedimenti tradizionali. Oltre al pane, il negozio offre anche vari prodotti da forno dolci e salati, bevande fatte in casa, sandwich e molto altro. Tutte le Jung panetterie si presentano con interni eleganti e sobri.<p>La sede alla fermata di Central vende prodotti da forno, specialit&agrave; zurighesi e specialit&agrave; di caff&egrave; di Stoll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>Altre filiali:&nbsp;</strong></h5><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Schanzengraben/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!3m1!5s0x47900a01bc6da4a3:0xe60ce645f9b3e9ff!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x47900a01ba3483f1:0x38e21701a4e54206!8m2!3d47.3686171!4d8.5370864!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F1tgx5j12?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Schanzengraben</strong></a>, Bleicherweg 10, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In dieser Filiale, die mit schlichtem Innendesign ins Auge sticht, stehen eine grosse Auswahl an Broten und sonstigen Leckereien im Fokus."@de,
        "At this bakery, which catches the eye with its simple interior design, the focus is on a large selection of breads and other delicacies."@en,
        "Dans cette succursale au design intérieur sobre, l‘accent est mis sur le grand choix de pains boulangers et autres gourmandises."@fr,
        "In questa filiale, che colpisce per il suo sobrio interior design, si trova un’ampia selezione di pane e altre bontà."@it ;
