    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Ge&ouml;ffnet von April bis Oktober&nbsp;April, Mai und OktoberT&auml;glich 12.00 &ndash; 20.00 Uhr&nbsp;Juni bis September&nbsp;T&auml;glich 15.00 &ndash; 23.00 Uhr</p>"@de,
        "<p>Open from April to October&nbsp;April, May &amp; OctoberDaily 12.00pm &ndash; 8.00pm&nbsp;June &ndash; SeptemberDaily 3.00pm &ndash; 11.00pm</p>"@en,
