        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Der Jungkoch Noah Rechsteiner und sein Team entf&uuml;hren G&auml;ste in eine Welt des pflanzlichen Genusses: An der Brauerstrasse, nur wenige Gehminuten von der Seilbahn Rigiblick entfernt, bietet das Restaurant mittwochs bis samstags abends sowie am Wochenende zum Brunch exklusive Men&uuml;s.<p>Die F&uuml;nf- und Sechs-G&auml;nge-Men&uuml;s bestehen aus rein pflanzlichen, saisonalen und regionalen Zutaten. Highlight des Men&uuml;s sind der Signature Dishes &laquo;Purple Rain&raquo;, ein Rotkohl-Risotto mit Tr&uuml;ffel und Kimchi sowie monatlich wechselnde Gerichte, begleitet von erlesenen Weinen oder alkoholfreien Juice-Pairings.</p><p>Das Ambiente des Restaurants, gepr&auml;gt von einer offenen K&uuml;che und dem Leitspruch &laquo;Make Food not War&raquo;, schafft eine einladende Atmosph&auml;re.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The young chef, Noah Rechsteiner, and his team take guests on a journey into their world of plant-based cuisine. Located on Brauerstrasse, just a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the Rigiblick funicular, the Anoha restaurant offers exclusive menus in the evenings from Wednesday to Saturday, as well as brunch at the weekend.<p>The five- and six-course menus comprise purely plant-based, seasonal, and regional ingredients. The highlight of the menu is the signature dish, &ldquo;Purple Rain&rdquo;, a red cabbage risotto with truffle and kimchi, but there are also monthly changing dishes. The food is accompanied by exquisite wines or non-alcoholic juice pairings.</p><p>The restaurant&rsquo;s open kitchen and its motto, &ldquo;Make Food not War&rdquo;, give rise to an inviting atmosphere.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le jeune cuisinier Noah Rechsteiner et son &eacute;quipe vous entra&icirc;neront dans un monde de plaisirs v&eacute;g&eacute;taux. Situ&eacute; dans la Brauerstrasse, &agrave; quelques minutes &agrave; pied du t&eacute;l&eacute;ph&eacute;rique Rigiblick, le restaurant Anoha propose des menus originaux du mercredi au samedi soir ainsi que des brunchs le week-end.<p>Les menus de cinq ou six plats sont compos&eacute;s d&rsquo;ingr&eacute;dients purement v&eacute;g&eacute;taux, saisonniers et r&eacute;gionaux. Le point fort du menu est le plat signature &laquo;&nbsp;Purple Rain&nbsp;&raquo;, un risotto au chou rouge avec truffes et kimchi. Savourez des plats qui changent tous les mois, accompagn&eacute;s de vins exquis ou de jus et cocktails non alcoolis&eacute;s.</p><p>De par sa cuisine ouverte et la devise &laquo;&nbsp;Make Food not War&nbsp;&raquo;, l&rsquo;ambiance du restaurant est tr&egrave;s accueillante.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il giovane cuoco Noah Rechsteiner e il suo team accompagnano i loro ospiti in un mondo di sapori vegetali: nella Brauerstrasse, a pochi minuti a piedi dalla funivia Rigiblick, da mercoled&igrave; a sabato sera il ristorante propone un brunch a base di menu esclusivi.<p>I menu da cinque o sei portate sono realizzati interamente con ingredienti vegetali stagionali e regionali. Il clou del menu sono i signature dish &ldquo;Purple Rain&rdquo;, un risotto al cavolo rosso con tartufo e kimchi, cos&igrave; come i piatti che cambiano ogni mese, accompagnati da vini selezionati e juice pairing analcolico.</p><p>Caratterizzato da una cucina aperta e dal motto &ldquo;Make Food not War&rdquo;, il locale diffonde un&rsquo;atmosfera invitante.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Kreative Menüs aus regionalen Zutaten bieten nahe der Seilbahn Rigiblick eine pflanzenbasierte Genusswelt."@de,
        "Near the Rigiblick funicular, creative dishes made from regional ingredients take guests on a journey into a plant-based world of culinary indulgence."@en,
        "Près du téléphérique Rigiblick se trouve un monde gourmand végétal avec des menus créatifs à base d’ingrédients régionaux."@fr,
        "Vicino alla funivia Rigiblick, menu creativi a base di ingredienti regionali propongono un gustoso viaggio nel mondo della cucina vegetale."@it ;
    schema:email "info@anoah.ch" ;
