        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-11-05T16:12:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Die Bear Street Bakery ist der Hotspot f&uuml;r Cookie-Liebhaber:innen. Hier werden t&auml;glich dicke, fluffige und aussen leicht knusprige American Cookies gebacken, die s&uuml;chtig machen. Von klassischen Chocolate Chip Cookies bis zu kreativen Special Editions &ndash; der Duft dieser frisch gebackenen Cookies verf&uuml;hrt die Sinne und ist ideal f&uuml;r eine kleine Auszeit und eine s&uuml;sse St&auml;rkung im Alltag.<p>Die Bear Street Bakery liegt zentral, nur wenige Schritte von der Bahnhofstrasse und dem Paradeplatz entfernt &ndash; perfekt f&uuml;r einen genussvollen Zwischenstopp in der Stadt.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The Bear Street Bakery is the place to be for cookie lovers. Here, incredibly moreish American-style chunky cookies with a light, crisp crust and a soft and fluffy middle are baked daily. From classic chocolate chip cookies to creative special editions, the delicious smell of these freshly baked cookies is hard to resist: take a break here for the perfect sweet boost to help you get through the daily grind.<p>The Bear Street Bakery is centrally located just a few steps from Bahnhofstrasse and Paradeplatz&nbsp;&ndash; ideal for a tasty stop-off point in the city.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La Bear Street Bakery est le lieu de pr&eacute;dilection des fans de cookies. Chaque jour, on y pr&eacute;pare des cookies am&eacute;ricains &eacute;pais, moelleux et l&eacute;g&egrave;rement croustillants &agrave; l&rsquo;ext&eacute;rieur, qui rendent accro. Des classiques &laquo;&nbsp;chocolate chip cookies&nbsp;&raquo; aux &eacute;ditions sp&eacute;ciales cr&eacute;atives, l&rsquo;odeur de ces cookies fra&icirc;chement cuits s&eacute;duit les sens et est id&eacute;ale pour une petite pause et un r&eacute;confort sucr&eacute; au quotidien.<p>La Bear Street Bakery est situ&eacute;e au centre-ville, &agrave; quelques pas de la Bahnhofstrasse et de la Paradeplatz &ndash; parfaite pour une pause gourmande en ville.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>La Bear Street Bakery &egrave; l&rsquo;hotspot per gli amanti dei cookie. Qui si preparano tutti i giorni American Cookie che creano dipendenza, alti, soffici e leggermente croccanti fuori. Dai classici Chocolate Chip Cookie a creative edizioni speciali, il profumo di questi biscottoni appena sfornati inebria i sensi ed &egrave; ideale per una piccola pausa e un po&rsquo; di energia nella vita quotidiana.<p>La Bear Street Bakery si trova in posizione centrale, a pochi passi dalla Bahnhofstrasse e dalla Paradeplatz, perfetta per fare una tappa gustosa in citt&agrave;.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Fluffig, dick und warm– für manche die besten American Cookies der Stadt."@de,
        "Soft, chunky, and still warm from the oven – it’s easy to see why many people think these are the best American-style cookies in the city."@en,
        "Moelleux, épais et chauds – pour certains, les meilleurs American Cookies de la ville."@fr,
        "Soffici, alti e caldi: per alcuni sono i migliori American Cookie della città."@it ;
