        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Richie's Chicken, ein Paradies f&uuml;r Liebhaber:innen von Fried Chicken. Inspiriert von den kulinarischen Reisen des Gr&uuml;nders vereint das Konzept Aromen aus Amerika, Europa und Asien.<p>Auf der Speisekarte stehen verschiedene Varianten von Fried Chicken: zarte Tenders aus Schweizer Pouletbrust, saftige Bites aus Pouletschenkelst&uuml;cken und knusprige Flats. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die es sch&auml;rfer m&ouml;gen, gibt es die Option, das Chicken in einer w&uuml;rzigen Gochujang-Sauce marinieren zu lassen. Erg&auml;nzt wird das Angebot durch verschiedene Chicken Sandwiches, wie das Classic Sandwich mit Brioche Bun, knusprigem Fried Chicken und Richie's Specialsauce.</p><p>Als Beilagen werden Super Fries, Cajun Fries und R&ouml;sti Fries angeboten, die perfekt mit den hausgemachten Dips wie Garlic Ranch, Honey Mustard und Spicy Mayo harmonieren.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Richie&rsquo;s Chicken, a paradise for lovers of fried chicken. Inspired by the founder&rsquo;s culinary travels, the idea of this place was to combine flavors from the United States, Europe and Asia.<p>The menu lists different versions of fried chicken: juicy tenders made with Swiss chicken breasts, tender bites from chicken drumsticks and crispy flats. Those who like it hot go for the chicken marinated in Gochujang sauce. There are also different chicken sandwiches to choose from, such as the classic sandwich with brioche bun, crispy fried chicken and Richie&rsquo;s secret sauce.</p><p>The sides dishes: super fries, cajun fries and r&ouml;sti fries all go perfectly well with the homemade dips such as the garlic ranch, honey mustard and spicy mayo.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Richie's Chicken est un paradis pour les amateurs de poulet frit. Inspir&eacute; par les voyages culinaires du fondateur, le concept combine des saveurs d&rsquo;Am&eacute;rique, d&rsquo;Europe et d&rsquo;Asie.<p>Le menu propose diff&eacute;rentes variantes de poulet frit&#8239;: les d&eacute;licieux &laquo;&#8239;tenders&#8239;&raquo; de blanc de poulet suisse, les succulents &laquo;&#8239;bites&#8239;&raquo; de cuisses de poulet et les &laquo;&#8239;flats&#8239;&raquo; croustillants. Pour celles et ceux qui aiment les plats piquants, il est possible de faire mariner le poulet dans une sauce Gochujang. L&rsquo;offre est compl&eacute;t&eacute;e par diff&eacute;rents sandwichs au poulet, par exemple le sandwich classique compos&eacute; de pain brioch&eacute;, poulet frit croustillant et sauce sp&eacute;ciale Richie&rsquo;s.</p><p>&laquo;&#8239;Super fries&#8239;&raquo;, &laquo;&#8239;Cajun fries&#8239;&raquo; et &laquo;&#8239;R&ouml;sti fries&#8239;&raquo; sont propos&eacute;es en accompagnement, ainsi que des sauces maison comme la &laquo;&#8239;Garlic Ranch&#8239;&raquo;, la &laquo;&#8239;Honey Mustard&#8239;&raquo; et la &laquo;&#8239;Spicy Mayo&#8239;&raquo;.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Richie&rsquo;s Chicken &egrave; un paradiso per gli amanti del pollo fritto. Ispirato ai viaggi culinari del fondatore, il concept fonde aromi provenienti da America, Europa e Asia.<p>Il men&ugrave; presenta diverse varianti di pollo fritto: morbidi Tenders di petto di pollo svizzero, succulenti Bites di cosce di pollo e croccanti Flats. Chi preferisce le cose pi&ugrave; piccanti pu&ograve; far marinare il pollo in una speziata salsa Gochujang. L&rsquo;offerta viene completata da diversi sandwich al pollo, come il Classic Sandwich con Brioche Bun, croccante Fried Chicken e Richie&rsquo;s Special Sauce.</p><p>I contorni sono Super Fries, Cajun Fries e R&ouml;sti Fries, che si sposano perfettamente con salse fatte in casa come Garlic Ranch, Honey Mustard e Spicy Mayo.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Goldbraun, saftig und voller Geschmack – Richie's Chicken kombiniert asiatischen Street-Food-Geschmack mit amerikanischem Fast-Food-Flair."@de,
        "Golden-brown, juicy and full of flavor – Richie’s Chicken combines the taste of Asian street food with the American flair for fast food."@en,
        "Doré, juteux et plein de saveur – Richie's Chicken allie les saveurs de la cuisine de rue asiatique au style de la restauration rapide américaine."@fr,
        "Pietanze dorate, succulente e gustosissime: Richie’s Chicken combina i sapori dello street food asiatico con il fascino del fast food americano."@it ;
