    schema:description "<p>Drei verschiedene Gew&auml;sser pr&auml;gen diesen abwechslungsreichen Spaziergang mitten durch Z&uuml;rich: der historische Schanzengraben, die ruhige Uferpromenade des Z&uuml;richsees und die belebte Limmat. Die rund vier Kilometer lange Route bietet Naturerlebnis und Stadtflair in perfekter Kombination.<p>Die Tour startet am Z&uuml;rich Hauptbahnhof und f&uuml;hrt direkt zum <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2054\" data-entity-uuid=\"e10c1789-467d-44f2-aa49-486cd543ddcc\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Schanzengraben</a> &ndash; einem ehemaligen Wassergraben. Vorbei am Alten Botanischen Garten geht es weiter zum <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2619\" data-entity-uuid=\"16a2c668-9f2f-459a-9ee2-46c9c8b4e4d8\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Z&uuml;richsee</a>, wo die Promenade zwischen <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1961\" data-entity-uuid=\"9cb942fb-a1c4-49ec-98e0-27777bb4d263\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">B&uuml;rkliplatz</a> und Bellevue zum Flanieren einl&auml;dt.</p><p>Zum Abschluss geht es entlang des <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1974\" data-entity-uuid=\"1b4b3502-4e62-486d-9f50-d7972d11cb40\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Limmatquais</a> &ndash; mit Blick auf historische Fassaden, die <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1578\" data-entity-uuid=\"1aee6b16-e46f-4516-886b-ffafc002d8c3\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Grossm&uuml;nster-T&uuml;rme</a> und die lebendige Z&uuml;rcher Altstadt.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/de-de/tour/2050999996\">Route auf Komoot</a></p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Three different waterways make up the route for this varied walk through the center of Zurich: the historic Schanzengraben canal, the laid-back waterfront promenade by Lake Zurich, and the lively banks of the Limmat. This route, which is approximately four kilometers (2.5&#8239;miles) long, offers a perfect combination of natural splendors and city flair.<p>The route starts at Zurich Main Station and leads straight to the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2054\" data-entity-uuid=\"e10c1789-467d-44f2-aa49-486cd543ddcc\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Schanzengraben</a> canal &ndash; a former moat. After passing the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2526\" data-entity-uuid=\"75a64b1b-59ce-4dbb-9123-088cc03b9538\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Old Botanical Garden</a>, it continues on to <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2619\" data-entity-uuid=\"16a2c668-9f2f-459a-9ee2-46c9c8b4e4d8\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lake Zurich</a>, where the promenade between <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1961\" data-entity-uuid=\"9cb942fb-a1c4-49ec-98e0-27777bb4d263\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">B&uuml;rkliplatz</a> and Bellevue is the ideal place for a relaxed stroll.</p><p>The final stretch of the walk is along the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1974\" data-entity-uuid=\"1b4b3502-4e62-486d-9f50-d7972d11cb40\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Limmatquai</a> &ndash; offering a view of historic facades, the towers of the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1578\" data-entity-uuid=\"1aee6b16-e46f-4516-886b-ffafc002d8c3\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Grossm&uuml;nster</a>, and Zurich&rsquo;s lively Old Town.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/tour/2050999996\">Route on Komoot</a></p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Trois cours d&rsquo;eau caract&eacute;risent cette balade vari&eacute;e au c&oelig;ur de Zurich&#8239;: le Schanzengraben historique, la promenade tranquille sur les rives du lac de Zurich et la Limmat anim&eacute;e. L&rsquo;itin&eacute;raire d'environ quatre kilom&egrave;tres offre une combinaison parfaite entre d&eacute;couverte de la nature et ambiance urbaine.<p>La balade commence &agrave; la gare centrale de Zurich et m&egrave;ne directement au <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2054\" data-entity-uuid=\"e10c1789-467d-44f2-aa49-486cd543ddcc\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Schanzengraben</a>, un ancien foss&eacute;. En passant devant<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2526\" data-entity-uuid=\"75a64b1b-59ce-4dbb-9123-088cc03b9538\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\"> l&rsquo;ancien jardin botanique</a>, le parcours se poursuit jusqu&rsquo;au <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2619\" data-entity-uuid=\"16a2c668-9f2f-459a-9ee2-46c9c8b4e4d8\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">lac de Zurich</a>, o&ugrave; le boulevard entre <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1961\" data-entity-uuid=\"9cb942fb-a1c4-49ec-98e0-27777bb4d263\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">B&uuml;rkliplatz</a> et Bellevue invite &agrave; la fl&acirc;nerie.</p><p>Pour finir, vous longerez le <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1974\" data-entity-uuid=\"1b4b3502-4e62-486d-9f50-d7972d11cb40\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Limmatquai</a> et pourrez admirer les fa&ccedil;ades historiques, les tours de l&rsquo;&eacute;glise <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1578\" data-entity-uuid=\"1aee6b16-e46f-4516-886b-ffafc002d8c3\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Grossm&uuml;nster</a> et la vieille ville anim&eacute;e de Zurich.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/fr-fr/tour/2050999996\">Route sur Komoot</a></p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Tre corsi d&rsquo;acqua diversi caratterizzano questa variegata passeggiata nel cuore di Zurigo: lo storico Schanzengraben, il tranquillo lungolago e l&rsquo;animata Limmat. I circa quattro chilometri dell&rsquo;itinerario propongono un mix perfetto di natura e fascino urbano.<p>Il tour parte alla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo, portando direttamente allo <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2054\" data-entity-uuid=\"e10c1789-467d-44f2-aa49-486cd543ddcc\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Schanzengraben</a>, un antico fossato. Passando davanti <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2526\" data-entity-uuid=\"75a64b1b-59ce-4dbb-9123-088cc03b9538\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">all&rsquo;Antico Orto Botanico</a>, si prosegue alla volta del <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2619\" data-entity-uuid=\"16a2c668-9f2f-459a-9ee2-46c9c8b4e4d8\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lago di Zurigo</a>, dove la passeggiata tra <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1961\" data-entity-uuid=\"9cb942fb-a1c4-49ec-98e0-27777bb4d263\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">B&uuml;rkliplatz</a> e Bellevue invita a rilassarsi.</p><p>Infine si percorre il <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1974\" data-entity-uuid=\"1b4b3502-4e62-486d-9f50-d7972d11cb40\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Limmatquai</a>, con vista su facciate storiche, sulle torri della chiesa di <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1578\" data-entity-uuid=\"1aee6b16-e46f-4516-886b-ffafc002d8c3\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Grossm&uuml;nster</a> e sul vivace centro storico di Zurigo.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/it-it/tour/2050999996\">Percorso su Komoot</a></p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Dieser Spaziergang führt mitten durch Zürich und folgt dabei drei charakteristischen Wasserwegen – vom ruhigen Schanzengraben über die weite Seepromenade bis zur lebendigen Limmat."@de,
        "This walk winds through the center of Zurich, following three iconic waterways – from the tranquil Schanzengraben canal to the wide promenade at Lake Zurich and the vibrant banks of the Limmat river."@en,
        "Cette balade mène au cœur de Zurich en suivant trois voies d’eau caractéristiques : du paisible Schanzengraben au large boulevard longeant le lac, jusqu’à la Limmat animée."@fr,
        "Questa passeggiata attraversa il centro di Zurigo seguendo tre caratteristici corsi d’acqua, dal tranquillo Schanzengraben, passando per l’ampio lungolago, fino alla vivace Limmat."@it ;
    schema:geo _:N504abae81d594bd3a41d0cf74eb64c3d ;
