    schema:dateModified "2026-02-11T11:40:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Erholsame Parkanlagen, markante Industriebauten, kreative Konzepte und ein Hauch Ausgehkultur: Diese rund f&uuml;nf Kilometer lange Route f&uuml;hrt durch die aufstrebenden und vielseitigen Quartiere n&ouml;rdlich des Hauptbahnhofs Z&uuml;rich.<p>Vom <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2662\" data-entity-uuid=\"7a451f5c-e030-4320-82ae-18725e88da4b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Platzspitzpark</a> geht es dem Wasser der Limmat entlang zum beliebten <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2495\" data-entity-uuid=\"4492285b-c790-4011-80a0-efe504d09753\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Flussbad Oberer Letten</a>. Weiter verl&auml;uft der Weg durch das Industriequartier &ndash; vorbei an der markanten Eisenbahnbr&uuml;cke <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2058\" data-entity-uuid=\"07ea01bd-6c75-4d67-a9d2-77fa89306018\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lettenviadukt</a> mit ihren Design- und M&ouml;belgesch&auml;ften, charmanten Caf&eacute;s und urbanem Flair.</p><p>Die <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/16870\" data-entity-uuid=\"26d18e98-b3b9-46cf-bd27-de883f72eb65\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Josefwiese</a> und die nahegelegene <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1970\" data-entity-uuid=\"76c9a9c5-4320-4e4d-b128-43a631378812\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Langstrasse</a> sorgen f&uuml;r entspannte Kontraste und runden den Spaziergang mit einer Mischung aus Gr&uuml;nraum, Szeneviertel und Gastronomievielfalt ab.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/de-de/tour/2050993500\">Route auf Komoot</a></p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Relaxing parks, distinctive industrial buildings, creative concepts and an idea of party culture: The approximately 5-kilometer-long route leads through up-and-coming and diverse neighborhoods north of Zurich main station.<p>This city walk starts at park <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2662\" data-entity-uuid=\"7a451f5c-e030-4320-82ae-18725e88da4b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Platzspitz</a> and leads along the Limmat river to <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2495\" data-entity-uuid=\"4492285b-c790-4011-80a0-efe504d09753\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Oberer Letten</a> lido. The route continues through the industrial quarter &ndash; past the striking Letten <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/4026\" data-entity-uuid=\"c9a34050-3a0c-43a0-8aea-678f099f9d51\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Viaduct</a> railroad bridge with its design and furniture stores, charming caf&eacute;s and urban flair.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/16870\" data-entity-uuid=\"26d18e98-b3b9-46cf-bd27-de883f72eb65\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Josefwiese</a> and nearby <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1970\" data-entity-uuid=\"76c9a9c5-4320-4e4d-b128-43a631378812\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Langstrasse</a> provide relaxed contrasts and complement the walk with a mixture of parks, trendy district and a variety of restaurants.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/de-de/tour/2050993500\">Route on Komoot</a></p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Parcs propices &agrave; la d&eacute;tente, b&acirc;timents industriels marquants, concepts cr&eacute;atifs et un soup&ccedil;on de culture nocturne&#8239;: cette balade d&rsquo;environ cinq kilom&egrave;tres traverse les quartiers en plein essor et diversifi&eacute;s situ&eacute;s au nord de la gare centrale de Zurich.<p>Du parc <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2662\" data-entity-uuid=\"7a451f5c-e030-4320-82ae-18725e88da4b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Platzspitz</a>, on longe la Limmat jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2495\" data-entity-uuid=\"4492285b-c790-4011-80a0-efe504d09753\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Oberer Letten</a>, une zone de baignade tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e au bord de la rivi&egrave;re. Le chemin se poursuit &agrave; travers le quartier industriel, en passant par l&rsquo;imposant pont ferroviaire <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2058\" data-entity-uuid=\"07ea01bd-6c75-4d67-a9d2-77fa89306018\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lettenviadukt</a> avec ses boutiques de design et de meubles, ses charmants caf&eacute;s et son ambiance urbaine.</p><p>Le parc <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/16870\" data-entity-uuid=\"26d18e98-b3b9-46cf-bd27-de883f72eb65\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Josefwiese</a> et la <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1970\" data-entity-uuid=\"76c9a9c5-4320-4e4d-b128-43a631378812\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Langstrasse</a> toute proche cr&eacute;ent des contrastes d&eacute;tendus et compl&egrave;tent la balade avec un m&eacute;lange d&rsquo;espaces verts, de quartier branch&eacute; et de diversit&eacute; gastronomique.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/fr-fr/tour/2050993500\">Route sur Komoot</a></p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Parchi rigeneranti, imponenti edifici industriali, concept creativi e un tocco di vita notturna: questo itinerario lungo circa cinque chilometri attraversa gli eclettici quartieri emergenti a nord della Stazione Centrale di Zurigo.<p>Dal parco <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2662\" data-entity-uuid=\"7a451f5c-e030-4320-82ae-18725e88da4b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Platzspitz</a> si costeggiano le acque della Limmat fino al famoso <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2495\" data-entity-uuid=\"4492285b-c790-4011-80a0-efe504d09753\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">stabilimento fluviale Oberer Letten</a>. Si prosegue poi nel quartiere industriale, passando dal vistoso ponte ferroviario <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2058\" data-entity-uuid=\"07ea01bd-6c75-4d67-a9d2-77fa89306018\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lettenviadukt</a>, con negozi di design e arredamento, pittoreschi caff&egrave; e fascino urbano.</p><p>La <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/16870\" data-entity-uuid=\"26d18e98-b3b9-46cf-bd27-de883f72eb65\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Josefwiese</a> e la vicina <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1970\" data-entity-uuid=\"76c9a9c5-4320-4e4d-b128-43a631378812\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Langstrasse</a> creano piacevoli contrasti, completando la passeggiata con un miscuglio di spazi verdi, quartiere di tendenza e variet&agrave; gastronomica.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.komoot.com/it-it/tour/2050993500\">Percorso su Komoot</a></p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Dieser Stadtspaziergang verbindet Wasser, Design, Industriegeschichte und Stadtleben – von der Limmat über das kreative Viadukt zum belebten Kreis 5."@de,
        "The city walk that combines water, design, industrial history and city life – from the Limmat river to creative Viadukt to bustling district 5."@en,
        "Cette promenade urbaine allie eau, design, histoire industrielle et vie citadine. Elle mène de la Limmat au 5e arrondissement animé en passant par le Viadukt créatif."@fr,
        "Questa passeggiata urbana unisce acqua, design, storia industriale e vita cittadina, partendo dalla Limmat, passando dal creativo Viadukt e arrivando al vivace Kreis 5."@it ;
    schema:geo _:Ne9912589871d4941bfcd424ae74dbbfd ;
    schema:identifier "1012243" ;
