    schema:description "<p>Mitten im Herzen Z&uuml;richs, nur wenige Schritte vom Paradeplatz entfernt, verbindet die B&auml;ckerei Jung am Schanzengraben traditionelle Backkunst mit modernem, urbanem Design. Seit 1976 steht die Marke Jung f&uuml;r hochwertiges Handwerk, nat&uuml;rliche Zutaten aus der Region und eine grosse Leidenschaft f&uuml;r Brot und feine Backwaren.<p>Besonders beliebt: die gem&uuml;tlichen Nachmittage von 14 bis 17 Uhr. Dann serviert das Jung-Team nebst den klassischen Angeboten auch ausgew&auml;hlte Drinks und feine H&auml;ppchen &ndash; ideal f&uuml;r eine kurze Auszeit oder einen stilvollen Afterwork-Apero direkt am Wasser.</p><p><strong>Weitere Filialen:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Central/@47.3763711,8.5414725,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bcd66040eed:0xd8c1b3c313a4d8b3!8m2!3d47.3763675!4d8.5440474!16s%2Fg%2F1vgw7k5y?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Central</strong></a>, Niederdorfstrasse 90, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@de,
        "<p>Right in the heart of Zurich, just a few steps from Paradeplatz, B&auml;ckerei Jung am Schanzengraben combines traditional artisan baking with modern, urban design. Since 1976, the Jung brand has stood for high-quality handcrafted products, natural and local ingredients, and a passion for bread and fine baked goods.<p>The bakery&rsquo;s welcoming afternoon sessions from 2 PM to 5 PM are particularly popular. During these hours, the Jung team serves selected drinks and delicious nibbles alongside its classic range of products &ndash; perfect for a short break or a stylish after-work &ldquo;Apero&rdquo; by the canal.</p><p><strong>Additional stores:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Central/@47.3763711,8.5414725,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bcd66040eed:0xd8c1b3c313a4d8b3!8m2!3d47.3763675!4d8.5440474!16s%2Fg%2F1vgw7k5y?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Central</strong></a>, Niederdorfstrasse 90, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@en,
        "<p>Au c&oelig;ur de Zurich, &agrave; deux pas de la Paradeplatz, la boulangerie Jung am Schanzengraben propose tout l&rsquo;art boulanger traditionnel dans un cadre moderne et urbain. Depuis 1976, la marque Jung est synonyme d&rsquo;artisanat de qualit&eacute;, d&rsquo;ingr&eacute;dients naturels issus de la r&eacute;gion et d&rsquo;une grande passion pour le pain et les p&acirc;tisseries.<p>L&rsquo;offre de l&rsquo;apr&egrave;s-midi, de 14h &agrave; 17h, est particuli&egrave;rement appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e&nbsp;: outre la carte classique, Jung propose &eacute;galement des boissons s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;es et de d&eacute;licieux amuse-bouches &ndash; le moment id&eacute;al pour une petite pause ou un ap&eacute;ritif raffin&eacute; au bord de l&rsquo;eau apr&egrave;s le travail.</p><p><strong>Autres magasins :</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Central/@47.3763711,8.5414725,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bcd66040eed:0xd8c1b3c313a4d8b3!8m2!3d47.3763675!4d8.5440474!16s%2Fg%2F1vgw7k5y?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Central</strong></a>, Niederdorfstrasse 90, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Nel cuore di Zurigo, a pochi passi dalla Paradeplatz, il panificio Jung sullo Schanzengraben fonde l&rsquo;arte tradizionale della panificazione con un design moderno e urbano. Dal 1976, il marchio Jung &egrave; sinonimo di artigianalit&agrave; di livello, ingredienti naturali provenienti dalla regione e una grande passione per il pane e i prodotti da forno.<p>Particolarmente amati sono i tranquilli pomeriggi dalle 14 alle 17, quando il team serve non solo le proposte classiche, ma anche drink selezionati e deliziosi stuzzichini, ideali per una breve pausa o un raffinato aperitivo in riva all&rsquo;acqua dopo il lavoro.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Altre filiali:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/B%C3%A4ckerei+Jung/@47.3884073,8.4845293,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bc865ab1971:0x68d7c928f02d0792!8m2!3d47.3884037!4d8.4871042!16s%2Fg%2F11b6j9v527?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Altstetten,</strong></a> Altstetterstrasse 145, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Enge/@47.3793527,8.5295104,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sb%C3%A4ckerei+jung!3m6!1s0x479009003a9051ed:0xfea3487ac9cd4949!8m2!3d47.3639076!4d8.5310531!15sCg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ1oQIg5iw6Rja2VyZWkganVuZ5IBBmJha2VyeeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11y2stdtv4?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Bahnhof Enge</strong></a>, Tessinerplatz 12, 8002 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Central/@47.3763711,8.5414725,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bcd66040eed:0xd8c1b3c313a4d8b3!8m2!3d47.3763675!4d8.5440474!16s%2Fg%2F1vgw7k5y?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Central</strong></a>, Niederdorfstrasse 90, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Goldbrunnenplatz/@47.3704084,8.513553,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900b30402ed479:0x6c8beebe290f6958!8m2!3d47.3704084!4d8.513553!16s%2Fg%2F11s0x4xw30?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Goldbrunnenplatz, &nbsp;</strong></a>Kalkbreitestrasse 138, 8003 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/JUNG+Limmatplatz/@47.3840986,8.5294871,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a1267ab66db:0x11abc67ad66e894c!8m2!3d47.384095!4d8.532062!16s%2Fg%2F1tkqz531?hl=de&amp;entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Limmatplatz</strong></a>, Limmatstrasse 123, 8005 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vxMjkMMXTVyt4cir7\"><strong>Jung Vulkanplatz</strong></a>, Aargauerstrasse 250, 8048 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/JUNG+Wipkingen/@47.3930969,8.5292872,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a6945e13995:0x424cc15424eadd1!8m2!3d47.3930969!4d8.5292872!16s%2Fg%2F11bwzxbgt2?entry=ttu\"><strong>Jung Wipkingen</strong></a>, Dammstrasse 54, 8037 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZSSncDCzoDkb4XPm7\"><strong>Jung Kreuzplatz</strong></a>, Kreuzplatz 22, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Zwischen Paradeplatz und Schanzengraben trifft feines Bäckerhandwerk auf stilvolle Architektur und entspannte Atmosphäre."@de,
        "Exquisite artisan baking meets stylish architecture and a relaxed welcome at this bakery between Paradeplatz and the Schanzengraben canal."@en,
        "Entre Paradeplatz et Schanzengraben, artisanat boulanger, architecture élégante et hospitalité décontractée sont au rendez-vous."@fr,
        "Tra la Paradeplatz e lo Schanzengraben, l’arte della panificazione incontra architettura elegante e ospitalità disinvolta."@it ;
