        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Keen bietet im Z&uuml;rcher Viadukt einen einzigartigen Ort f&uuml;r k&ouml;rperliche, mentale und emotionale Regeneration.<p>Die sogenannten &laquo;Recovery Experiences&raquo; vereint Sauna, Eisb&auml;der und Atemarbeit, erg&auml;nzt durch &laquo;Active Experiences&raquo; wie Dehnung und Atemtraining. Kein klassisches Workout, sondern bewusstes Erleben mit multisensorischen Erlebnissen aus Licht, Klang und Duft.</p><p>Das minimalistisch gestaltete Studio im Z&uuml;rcher Viadukt schafft mit nat&uuml;rlichen Materialien und stimmungsvoller Atmosph&auml;re einen R&uuml;ckzugsort der anderen Art.&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Located in Zurich&rsquo;s Viadukt mall, Keen is a unique venue for physical, mental, and emotional regeneration.<p>Here, &ldquo;Recovery Experiences&rdquo; combine a sauna, ice baths, and breathwork, and are complemented by &ldquo;Active Experiences&rdquo; such as stretching and breathing exercises. This isn&rsquo;t a conventional workout, but a mindful, multisensory experience with lights, sounds, and scents.</p><p>The studio in the Zurich Viadukt has a minimalist aesthetic and offers a different kind of retreat thanks to its natural materials and evocative atmosphere.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Keen offre un lieu unique pour la r&eacute;g&eacute;n&eacute;ration physique, mentale et &eacute;motionnelle au Viadukt de Zurich.<p>Les &laquo;&#8239;Recovery Experiences&#8239;&raquo; combinent sauna, bains de glace et travail respiratoire, compl&eacute;t&eacute;s par des &laquo;&#8239;Active Experiences&#8239;&raquo; telles que des &eacute;tirements et des exercices de respiration. Il ne s&rsquo;agit pas d&rsquo;un entra&icirc;nement classique, mais d&rsquo;une exp&eacute;rience consciente multisensorielle alliant lumi&egrave;re, sons et parfums.</p><p>Gr&acirc;ce &agrave; son am&eacute;nagement aux mat&eacute;riaux naturels et son ambiance r&eacute;confortante, le studio au design minimaliste situ&eacute; au Viadukt de Zurich est un lieu de retraite hors pair.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>All&rsquo;interno del Viadukt di Zurigo, Keen &egrave; un luogo unico per la rigenerazione fisica, mentale ed emotiva.<p>Le cosiddette &ldquo;Recovery Experiences&rdquo; combinano sauna, bagni di ghiaccio e respiro, completate da &ldquo;Active Experiences&rdquo; come stretching ed esercizi di respirazione. Al posto di un workout classico, un&rsquo;esperienza multisensoriale consapevole, fatta di luci, suoni e aromi.</p><p>Lo studio minimalista nel Viadukt zurighese &egrave; caratterizzato da materiali naturali e un&rsquo;atmosfera suggestiva, che danno vita a un&rsquo;oasi speciale.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Europas erster «Active Recovery Club» vereint Regenration, Design und Wissenschaft."@de,
        "Europe’s first “Active Recovery Club” combines regeneration, design, and expertise."@en,
        "Le premier « Active Recovery Club » d’Europe allie régénération, design et science."@fr,
        "Il primo “Active Recovery Club” d’Europa fonde rigenerazione, design e scienza."@it ;
