    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>M&auml;rz, April, Oktober<p>Montag bis Freitag 13.00 &ndash; 18.00 Uhr<br>Samstag und Sonntag 11.30 &ndash; 18.30 Uhr</p><p>Mai, September:</p><p>Montag bis Freitag 13.00 &ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br>Samstag und Sonntag 11.00 &ndash; 19.00</p><p>Juni, Juli, August:</p><p>Montag bis Freitag 13.00 &ndash; 20.00 Uhr<br>Samstag und Sonntag 10.00 &ndash; 20.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>March, April, October:<p>Monday to Friday 1.00pm &ndash; 6.00pm<br>Saturday and Sunday 11.30am &ndash; 6.30pm</p><p>May, September:</p><p>Monday to Friday 1.00pm &ndash; 7.00pm<br>Saturday and Sunday 11.00am &ndash; 7.00pm</p><p>June, July, August:</p><p>Monday to Friday 1.00pm &ndash; 8.00pm<br>Saturday and Sunday 10.00am &ndash; 8.00pm</p></p>"@en,
