    geo:hasGeometry _:Ncada110c303f4aa099dc9680d78fe697 ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Das Burgerlokal mit seinem legendären Cheeseburger ist direkt im Zürcher Hauptbahnhof."@de,
        "The burger restaurant with its legendary cheeseburger is located right in Zurich's main train station."@en,
        "Le restaurant spécialisé dans les burgers, avec son légendaire cheeseburger, se trouve directement dans la gare centrale de Zurich."@fr,
        "Il locale specializzato in hamburger con il suo leggendario cheeseburger si trova proprio nella stazione centrale di Zurigo."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Action Burger"@de,
        "Action Burger"@en,
        "Action Burger"@fr,
        "Action Burger"@it ;
    namiont:zurichCard false ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Zürich" ;
            schema:postalCode "8001" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Bahnhofplatz 15" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-01-22T13:46:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Die Lage des Action-Burger-Take-aways ist so prominent wie seine Burgers. Direkt vis-&agrave;-vis vom Treffpunkt des Z&uuml;rcher Hauptbahnhofs stehen die Leute &ndash; zumindest zu Stosszeiten &ndash; Schlange.<p>Vom Double Cheeseburger &uuml;ber die Veggie-Variante bis zum Heat Burger, hier kommen alle auf den Geschmack. F&uuml;r den grossen Hunger g&ouml;nnt man sich noch k&ouml;stliche Loaded Fries, gleich das Menu oder ein s&uuml;sses Action Cookie. Gut zu wissen: Bestellungen k&ouml;nnen auch &uuml;ber die Website aufgegeben werden, so dass man seinen Burger ohne Wartezeiten abholen kann.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The location of the Action Burger takeaway is as prominent as its burgers. Directly opposite the meeting point at Zurich's main station, people queue up &ndash; at least during rush hour.<p>From the double cheeseburger to the veggie option to the heat burger, there's something for everyone here. If you're really hungry, treat yourself to some delicious loaded fries, the whole menu, or a sweet action cookie.&nbsp;Good to know: Orders can also be placed via the website, so you can pick up your burger without having to wait.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>L'emplacement du restaurant Action Burger &agrave; emporter est aussi prestigieux que ses burgers. Juste en face du point de rencontre de la gare centrale de Zurich, les gens font la queue, du moins aux heures de pointe.<p>Du double cheeseburger &agrave; la variante v&eacute;g&eacute;tarienne en passant par le &laquo; Heat Burger &raquo;, il y en a pour tous les go&ucirc;ts. Pour les plus gourmands, il y a aussi les frites garnies, le menu ou le &laquo; Action Cookie &raquo;.&nbsp;Bon &agrave; savoir : les commandes peuvent &eacute;galement &ecirc;tre pass&eacute;es via le site web, ce qui permet de r&eacute;cup&eacute;rer son burger sans attendre.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>La posizione dell'Action Burger Take Away &egrave; importante quanto i suoi hamburger. Proprio di fronte al punto di ritrovo della stazione centrale di Zurigo, le persone fanno la fila, soprattutto nelle ore di punta.<p>Dal doppio cheeseburger alla variante vegetariana fino all\"Heat Burger\", qui ce n'&egrave; per tutti i gusti. Per chi ha davvero fame, ci si pu&ograve; concedere delle deliziose patatine fritte guarnite, il menu completo o un dolce \"Action Cookie\".&nbsp;Buono a sapersi: Gli ordini possono essere effettuati anche tramite il sito web, in modo da poter ritirare il proprio hamburger senza tempi di attesa.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Sei es der aromatische Rindfleisch-Mix oder der vegetarische Portobello-Pilz im Bio-Bun, der Kult-Cheeseburger hat treue Fans."@de,
        "Whether it's the aromatic beef mix or the vegetarian portobello mushroom in an organic bun, the cult cheeseburger has loyal fans."@en,
        "Que ce soit pour son mélange de viande de bœuf aromatique ou son champignon portobello végétarien dans un bun bio, le cheeseburger culte a ses fans fidèles."@fr,
        "Che si tratti dell'aromatico mix di carne bovina o del fungo portobello vegetariano nel panino biologico, il cheeseburger cult ha conquistato fedeli fan."@it ;
    schema:geo _:Ncada110c303f4aa099dc9680d78fe697 ;
    schema:identifier "1012506" ;
    schema:license "CC BY-SA" ;
    schema:openingHours "Fr,Sa 10:00:00-00:30:00",
        "Mo,Tu,We,Th,Su 10:00:00-22:00:00" ;
    schema:photo [ a schema:ImageObject ;
            schema:caption "Menü von Action Burger"@de ;
            schema:contentUrl <https://www.zuerich.com/sites/default/files/image/2026/2504_Action_Burger_Lukas%20Lienhard.jpg> ] ;
    schema:url <https://actionburger.ch> .

<https://example.org/nami/data/poi/1012519> a schema:LocalBusiness,
