    schema:description "<p>Seit 1941 verbindet CALIDA hochwertige Materialien, durchdachte Verarbeitung und ein nat&uuml;rliches Tragegef&uuml;hl mit Schweizer Markentradition und kontinuierlicher Innovation.<br><br>In den CALIDA-Stores in Z&uuml;rich wird dieser Anspruch erlebbar: mit W&auml;sche, Nightwear und Loungewear, die durch den ganzen Tag begleiten. Langlebige Styles f&uuml;r Tag, Nacht und jeden Moment dazwischen. In der Schweiz verwurzelt und international gesch&auml;tzt, steht CALIDA heute f&uuml;r 24h-Komfort mit Schweizer Qualit&auml;tsanspruch &ndash; gemacht f&uuml;r Menschen, die Komfort, Qualit&auml;t und ein gutes Gef&uuml;hl auf der Haut in jedem Moment verbinden m&ouml;chten.<p>Hinweis an alle Inhaber:innen einer Z&uuml;rich Card: 10% Rabatt in allen CALIDA-Stores in Z&uuml;rich. Nicht mit anderen Aktionen kombinierbar. Bereits reduzierte Artikel sowie der Kauf von Geschenkkarten sind ausgeschlossen.<br><br><strong>Weitere Filialen:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/CALIDA+Store/@47.3760772,8.5345417,590m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a05e2b4ab91:0xee10645590b2370!8m2!3d47.3760772!4d8.537122!16s%2Fg%2F1ptxqnd0q!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">CALIDA L&ouml;wenstrasse</a>, L&ouml;wenstrasse 49, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/q1CLmrtrfqjfWvCP9\">CALIDA Niederdorf</a>, St&uuml;ssihofstatt 8 Niederdorf, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsVBm9ZyhzDXWkmY6\">CALIDA Z&uuml;rich Hauptbahnhof</a>, ShopVille/Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/UZXRWTgaWw875V2F9\">CALIDA Seefeld</a>, Seefeldstrasse 172, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Since 1941, CALIDA has combined high-quality materials, thoughtful craftsmanship and a natural feel on the skin with Swiss heritage and continuous innovation.<br><br>In the CALIDA stores in Zurich, this promise comes to life through underwear, nightwear and loungewear designed to accompany you all day long. Long-lasting styles for day, night and every moment in between. Rooted in Switzerland and appreciated internationally, CALIDA today stands for 24-hour comfort with a Swiss commitment to quality. Made for people who value comfort, quality and a good feeling on the skin in every moment.<br><br>Note to all Zurich Card holders: 10% discount in all CALIDA stores in Zurich. Cannot be combined with other promotions. Already reduced items and the purchase of gift cards are excluded.<p><strong>Additional stores:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/CALIDA+Store/@47.3760772,8.5345417,590m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a05e2b4ab91:0xee10645590b2370!8m2!3d47.3760772!4d8.537122!16s%2Fg%2F1ptxqnd0q!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">CALIDA L&ouml;wenstrasse</a>, L&ouml;wenstrasse 49, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/q1CLmrtrfqjfWvCP9\">CALIDA Niederdorf</a>, St&uuml;ssihofstatt 8 Niederdorf, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsVBm9ZyhzDXWkmY6\">CALIDA Z&uuml;rich Hauptbahnhof</a>, ShopVille/Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/UZXRWTgaWw875V2F9\">CALIDA Seefeld</a>, Seefeldstrasse 172, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Depuis 1941, CALIDA associe des mati&egrave;res de haute qualit&eacute;, un savoir-faire soign&eacute; et une sensation naturelle sur la peau &agrave; un h&eacute;ritage suisse et &agrave; une innovation continue.<br><br>Dans les boutiques CALIDA de Zurich, cette exigence prend vie &agrave; travers des sous-v&ecirc;tements, des v&ecirc;tements de nuit et du loungewear con&ccedil;us pour accompagner chaque instant de la journ&eacute;e. Des styles durables pour le jour, la nuit et chaque moment entre les deux. Ancr&eacute;e en Suisse et appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e &agrave; l&rsquo;international, CALIDA incarne aujourd&rsquo;hui un confort 24h/24 r&eacute;pondant aux plus hauts standards de qualit&eacute; suisse. Con&ccedil;u pour celles et ceux qui recherchent, &agrave; chaque instant, du confort, de la qualit&eacute; et une sensation agr&eacute;able sur la peau.<p>Information &agrave; l'attention de tous les d&eacute;tenteurs d'une Z&uuml;rich Card : 10 % de r&eacute;duction dans toutes les boutiques CALIDA &agrave; Zurich. Non cumulable avec d&rsquo;autres promotions. Les articles d&eacute;j&agrave; r&eacute;duits ainsi que l&rsquo;achat de cartes cadeaux sont exclus.<br><br><strong>Autres magasins :</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/CALIDA+Store/@47.3760772,8.5345417,590m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a05e2b4ab91:0xee10645590b2370!8m2!3d47.3760772!4d8.537122!16s%2Fg%2F1ptxqnd0q!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">CALIDA L&ouml;wenstrasse</a>, L&ouml;wenstrasse 49, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/q1CLmrtrfqjfWvCP9\">CALIDA Niederdorf</a>, St&uuml;ssihofstatt 8 Niederdorf, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsVBm9ZyhzDXWkmY6\">CALIDA Z&uuml;rich Hauptbahnhof</a>, ShopVille/Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/UZXRWTgaWw875V2F9\">CALIDA Seefeld</a>, Seefeldstrasse 172, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Dal 1941, CALIDA coniuga materiali di alta qualit&agrave;, lavorazioni curate nei minimi dettagli e una sensazione di naturalezza al corpo con la tradizione svizzera e l&rsquo;innovazione continua.<p>Nei negozi CALIDA di Zurigo &egrave; possibile vivere in prima persona questa filosofia: con intimo, abbigliamento da notte e da casa che ti accompagnano per tutta la giornata. Modelli intramontabili per il giorno, la notte e ogni momento intermedio. Con radici in Svizzera e apprezzata a livello internazionale, CALIDA &egrave; oggi sinonimo di comfort 24 ore su 24 con gli standard di qualit&agrave; svizzeri &ndash; pensata per chi desidera coniugare comfort, qualit&agrave; e una piacevole sensazione sulla pelle in ogni momento.</p><p>Avviso per tutti i titolari della Z&uuml;rich Card: Sconto del 10% in tutti i negozi CALIDA di Zurigo. Non cumulabile con altre promozioni. Sono esclusi gli articoli gi&agrave; in saldo e l&rsquo;acquisto di buoni regalo.</p><p><strong>Altre filiali:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/CALIDA+Store/@47.3760772,8.5345417,590m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a05e2b4ab91:0xee10645590b2370!8m2!3d47.3760772!4d8.537122!16s%2Fg%2F1ptxqnd0q!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">CALIDA L&ouml;wenstrasse</a>, L&ouml;wenstrasse 49, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/q1CLmrtrfqjfWvCP9\">CALIDA Niederdorf</a>, St&uuml;ssihofstatt 8 Niederdorf, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsVBm9ZyhzDXWkmY6\">CALIDA Z&uuml;rich Hauptbahnhof</a>, ShopVille/Passage L&ouml;wenstrasse, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/UZXRWTgaWw875V2F9\">CALIDA Seefeld</a>, Seefeldstrasse 172, 8008 Z&uuml;rich<br>&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "CALIDA steht für Komfort, der durch den ganzen Tag begleitet – mit Wäsche, Nightwear und Loungewear, ob klassisch oder innovativ."@de,
        "CALIDA offers comfort that lasts all day and night – with lingerie, nightwear, and loungewear, whether classic or innovative."@en,
        "CALIDA est synonyme de confort tout au long de la journée, avec une gamme de lingerie, de vêtements de nuit et de tenues d'intérieur, qu'ils soient classiques ou innovants."@fr,
        "CALIDA è sinonimo di comfort che accompagna le persone per tutta la giornata, con intimo, abbigliamento da notte e da casa, sia in stile classico che innovativo."@it ;
