    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Montag &ndash; Freitag: warme K&uuml;che 11.30 &ndash; 14.00 Uhr und 17.30 &ndash; 21.30 Uhr<p>Samstag: durchgehend warme K&uuml;che bis 21.30 Uhr</p><p><strong>&Ouml;ffnungszeiten Metzgerei</strong></p><p>Montag &ndash; Freitag: 11.30 &ndash; 19.00 Uhr</p><p>Samstag: 11.00 &ndash; 17.00 Uhr</p><p>Weitere Infos zu den &Ouml;ffnungszeiten sind <a href=\"https://www.williamsbutcherstable.ch/oeffnungszeiten-kontakt/zuerich-am-bellevue/\">hier</a> zu finden.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Monday &ndash; Friday: Hot meals served from 11:30am &ndash; 2pm and 5:30pm &ndash; 9:30pm.<p>Saturday: Hot meals served continuously until 9:30 p.m.</p><p><strong>Butcher Shop Hours</strong></p><p>Monday&ndash;Friday: 11:30 a.m.&ndash;7:00 p.m.</p><p>Saturday: 11:00 a.m.&ndash;5:00 p.m.</p><p>Further information about the hours of operation is available <a href=\"https://www.williamsbutcherstable.ch/en/opening-hours-contact/zuerich-bellevue/\">here</a>.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Du lundi au vendredi : plats chauds de 11 h 30 &agrave; 14 h et de 17 h 30 &agrave; 21 h 30<p>Samedi : plats chauds servis sans interruption jusqu'&agrave; 21 h 30</p><p><strong>Horaires d'ouverture de la boucherie</strong></p><p>Du lundi au vendredi : de 11 h 30 &agrave; 19 h 00</p><p>Samedi : de 11 h 00 &agrave; 17 h 00</p><p>De plus amples informations sur les horaires d'ouverture sont disponibles <a href=\"https://www.williamsbutcherstable.ch/en/opening-hours-contact/zuerich-bellevue/\">ici</a>.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Dal luned&igrave; al venerd&igrave;: piatti caldi da 11.30 a 14.00 e da 17.30 a 21.30<p>Sabato: piatti caldi serviti senza interruzioni fino alle 21:30</p><p><strong>Orari di apertura della macelleria</strong></p><p>Dal luned&igrave; al venerd&igrave;: da 11:30 a 19:00</p><p>Sabato: da 11:00 a 17:00</p><p>Maggiori informazioni sugli orari di apertura sono disponibili <a href=\"https://www.williamsbutcherstable.ch/en/opening-hours-contact/zuerich-bellevue/\">qui</a>.</p></p>"@it ;
