    schema:description "<p>NEU: Alle Zimmer mit Klimaanlage ausgestattet! Willkommen im Hotel Adler, dem modernen *** Hotel im Herzen der Z&uuml;rcher Altstadt. Ein idealer Ausgangspunkt - auch f&uuml;r Ihren Aufenthalt, gesch&auml;ftlich oder ferienhalber. Z&uuml;richs wirtschaftliches Zentrum, Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten, Z&uuml;ri-See, Hauptbahnhof, Gesch&auml;fte, Boutiquen - alles befindet sich in n&auml;chster N&auml;he. Alle Zimmer sind rauchfrei, das Schweizer Spezialit&auml;ten Restaurant \"Swiss Chuchi\" und der Charme des Z&uuml;rcher Niederdorfes erwarten Sie. Bis bald im Hotel Adler.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Here guests do not just stay the night in a typical Old Town establishment dating from the 16th century, but also in the place where the famous Swiss animal and landscape artist Rudolf Koller made his first sketches on the walls. The elegant rooms have a very special style and invite guests to relax and indulge themselves.<p>The Swiss Chuchi restaurant serves authentic Swiss specialties &ndash; such as the classic cheese fondue dish, &ldquo;Adler K&auml;sefondue&rdquo;, and crispy r&ouml;sti potato cakes.</p><p>The picturesque Lake Z&uuml;rich and world-famous Bahnhofstrasse are just a stone&rsquo;s throw away. In addition, there are numerous charming caf&eacute;s, bars, and restaurants nearby. And the Limmatquai invites visitors to stroll and linger awhile.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Bienvenue &agrave; l'h&ocirc;tel Adler, l'h&ocirc;tel *** moderne au c&oelig;ur de la vieille ville de Zurich. Un point de d&eacute;part id&eacute;al - aussi pour votre s&eacute;jour, affaires ou vacances. Centre d'affaires de Zurich, sites touristiques, lac de Zurich, gare principale, magasins, boutiques - tout est facilement accessible. Toutes les chambres sont non-fumeurs, le restaurant sp&eacute;cialis&eacute; suisse \"Swiss Chuchi\" et le charme du Niederdorf de Zurich vous attendent. A bient&ocirc;t &agrave; l'h&ocirc;tel Adler.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Benvenuti all'Hotel Adler, il moderno hotel *** nel cuore del centro storico di Zurigo. Un punto di partenza ideale - anche per il tuo soggiorno, lavoro o vacanza. Il centro affari di Zurigo, i luoghi d'interesse, il Lago di Zurigo, la stazione ferroviaria principale, i negozi, le boutique: tutto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile. Tutte le camere sono non fumatori, il ristorante di specialit&agrave; svizzere \"Swiss Chuchi\" e il fascino del Niederdorf di Zurigo vi attendono. A presto all'Hotel Adler.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel Adler befindet sich im Herzen des Niederdorfs, der berühmten Zürcher Altstadt."@de,
        "The Hotel Adler is located in the heart of the Niederdorf, Zurich’s famous Old Town."@en,
        "L’hôtel Adler est situé au cœur d’une partie de la vieille ville zurichoise, le fameux Niederdorf."@fr,
        "L’Hotel Adler si trova nel cuore del Niederdorf, famoso quartiere del centro storico zurighese."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotel-adler.ch" ;
