    schema:description "<p>Das neu renovierte Hotel Alexander*** verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber 41 gr&ouml;ssz&uuml;gige und gepflegte Nichtraucher-Zimmer. Der WLAN-Zugang ist im ganzen Hotel kostenlos. Zudem sind die meisten Zimmer mit Klimaanlage ausgestattet.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Alexander Guesthouse is not just affordable and well looked after, but also enjoys a very central location in Zurich&rsquo;s Old Town. It is just a short walk to the financial and business district, as well as to the university quarter with Zurich University and the ETH.<p>The numerous bars and restaurants in the Niederdorf invite visitors to sit and linger awhile. And those interested in culture and music can find various museums and theaters nearby.</p><p>Besides the Alexander Guesthouse, guests can also stay at the Hotel Alexander. Both establishments are situated very close to each other. The reception and breakfast room for guesthouse guests are located in the Hotel Alexander.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Zurich: s&eacute;journez au c&oelig;ur de la ville - Situ&eacute; au c&oelig;ur de la vieille ville de Zurich, &agrave; 5 minutes &agrave; pied de la gare, l'Hotel Alexander propose des chambres climatis&eacute;es et une connexion WiFi gratuite. Le centre financier, le c&eacute;l&egrave;bre quartier commer&ccedil;ant de Bahnhofstrasse, l'&Eacute;cole polytechnique f&eacute;d&eacute;rale de Zurich et la promenade autour du lac et de la rivi&egrave;re interdite aux voitures sont accessibles en quelques minutes de marche. Vous trouverez de nombreux restaurants, bars et magasins &agrave; proximit&eacute; de l'h&ocirc;tel Alexander.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Soggiorna nel cuore di Zurigo - Situato nel vero e proprio centro storico di Zurigo, a soli 5 minuti a piedi dalla stazione ferroviaria, l'Hotel Alexander dispone di camere dotate di aria condizionata e connessione Internet WiFi gratuita. In pochi minuti a piedi raggiungerete il centro finanziario, la famosa zona dello shopping di Bahnhofstrasse, il Politecnico federale di Zurigo (la pi&ugrave; prestigiosa universit&agrave; svizzera) e la passeggiata pedonale del lago e del lungo fiume. Nelle vicinanze dell'Hotel Alexander si trovano numerosi ristoranti, bar e negozi. La zona di Centro storico di Zurigo - Centro Citt&agrave; &egrave; consigliatissima dagli ospiti per: Acquisti gastronomici, Tour dei bar e Teatro</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Die persönliche und familiär geführte Pension befindet sich im Niederdorf, nur wenige Schritte vom Zürcher Hauptbahnhof entfernt."@de,
        "The personal, family-run guesthouse is located in the Niederdorf quarter, just a stone’s throw from Zurich Main Station."@en,
        "Cette pension familiale est située au Niederdorf, à seulement quelques pas de la gare centrale de Zurich."@fr,
        "Questa familiare pensione si trova nel quartiere di Niederdorf, a pochi passi dalla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo."@it ;
