    schema:description "<p>Der Name steht seit &uuml;ber 175 Jahren f&uuml;r Tradition durch Innovation. Im Herzen Z&uuml;richs inmitten eines eigenen Parks gelegen, empf&auml;ngt Sie das historische 5-Sterne-Hotel mit herrlichem Blick auf den Z&uuml;richsee und die Alpen. Seine einzigartige, privilegierte Lage, stilvollen Zimmer &amp; Suiten, mehrfach ausgezeichnete Gastronomie und der unvergleichliche Baur au Lac Service begeistern G&auml;ste aus aller Welt. Das Baur au Lac hat den Standard in der Schweizer Luxushotellerie von Beginn an gepr&auml;gt und geniesst bis heute den Ruf als eines der besten Hotels der Welt.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The hotel offers 119 rooms, including 27 Junior Suites and 18 Suites, ranging between 25m2 and 100m2. Considerable emphasis has been placed on using the finest materials and creating a sense of spaciousness. The style of the rooms varies between Art Deco, Louis XVI and English Regency, along with some more contemporary touches.<p>Guests can strengthen body and soul with an energizing workout at the hotel&rsquo;s fitness club, which enjoys a breathtaking view over the park, Lake Zurich and the Alps. Every possible requirement is catered for thanks to a host of services including a 24-hour concierge, a limousine service and an in-house florist.<br><br>The hotel houses two exquisite restaurants: <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/543922\" data-entity-uuid=\"feb5f65e-9c4a-4565-8655-89f021d33d51\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Baur's</a>, which offers European classics and exquisite wines, and <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/visit/restaurants/marguita\">Marguita</a>, which is renowned for its first-class Mediterranean cuisine.</p><p>As a member of Leading Hotels of the World and Swiss Deluxe Hotels, the Baur au Lac has been meeting the highest expectations for over 150 years.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>5* Sup&eacute;rieur: Situation tr&egrave;s centrale dans son propre parc, donnant sur le lac et sur la Bahnhofstrasse. Depuis l`ouverture (1844) propri&eacute;t&eacute; de la m&ecirc;me famille. Nouveau fitness club avec une vue splendide sur le lac et les Alpes. Travaux de r&eacute;novations en 2008/2009.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>5* Superiore: Situato in centro nel suo parco privato al lago di Zurigo, sulla Bahnhofstrasse, nel centro d`affari. Dalla sua apertura, nel 1844, &egrave; di propriet&agrave; della stessa famiglia. Nuovo fitness club con una vista panoramica sul lago e sulle Alpi. Lavori di rinnovazioni da 2008/2009.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Herzen Zürichs inmitten eines eigenen Parks gelegen, empfängt das traditionsreiche Baur au Lac seine Gäste in exklusivem Wohlfühl-Ambiente."@de,
        "A rich tradition and an exclusive atmosphere of well-being await guests at the Baur au Lac, situated in its own park in the heart of Zurich."@en,
        "Au cœur de Zurich, l’hôtel traditionnel Baur au Lac accueille ses clients au centre de son parc privé dans une ambiance exclusive de bien-être."@fr,
        "Nel cuore di Zurigo, in mezzo a un parco, l’antico Baur au Lac accoglie i suoi ospiti in un ambiente esclusivo."@it ;
    schema:email "info@bauraulac.ch" ;
