    schema:description "<p>Stadthotel mit Z&uuml;rcher Tradition, neu renovierte Zimmer, alle Zimmer klimatisiert, Restaurants Conrad, Glogge-Egge-Bar, idyllisches Gartenrestaurant, Bankett- und Seminarr&auml;ume. Wenige Schritte zur Bahnhofstrasse, in 7 Min. zu Fuss zum Hauptbahnhof und zum See.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Glockenhof, which dates from 1911, has 91 modern, comfortable guest rooms, all of which are equipped with air-conditioning and free Wi-Fi. The family-friendly hotel in the heart of the city has plenty to offer in terms of cuisine, too. The <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/3589\">Glogge Egge restaurant</a> is open daily and serves lovingly prepared dishes.<p>The <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/88912\">Conrad</a>, an idyllic garden restaurant situated in what is arguably the most picturesque courtyard in the city, provides the perfect surroundings for a stylish meal with family, friends, or business clients. Coffee and cake, meanwhile, can be enjoyed in the boulevard caf&eacute;, which also offers an unrestricted view of the hustle and bustle on the street outside.</p><p>At the Glockenhof, guests can enjoy a stay in the very heart of the inimitable city of Zurich. Whether on a business trip or private visit, the hotel features all the necessary amenities and is distinguished by its prime location.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://v8a-moving-pictures.com/glockenhof_zuerich/\">Virtual tour of the hotel</a></p></p>"@en,
        "<p>H&ocirc;tel situ&eacute; au centre de Zurich. Chambres nouvellement r&eacute;nov&eacute;es. Toutes les chambres sont climatis&eacute;es, Restaurants Conrad, Bar Glogge-Egge, idyllique jardin-restaurant. Salles pour banquets et s&eacute;minaires. A quelques pas de la Bahnhofstrasse, 7 minutes de la gare et du lac.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Hotel situato in centro con tradizione zurighese, camere rinnovate, camere con airconditioning, ristoranti Conrad, Glogge-Egge-Bar, con meraviglioso giardino, sale conferenze e banchetti. 7 minuti a piedi dalla stazione e per il lago.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Herzen von Zürich wenige Schritte von der Bahnhofstrasse entfernt, befindet sich das Stadthotel Glockenhof."@de,
        "The city hotel, Glockenhof, is located in the very heart of Zurich, just a stone’s throw from the Bahnhofstrasse."@en,
        "Au cœur de Zurich et à seulement quelques pas de la Bahnhofstrasse trône l’hôtel Glockenhof."@fr,
        "Nel cuore di Zurigo, a pochi passi dalla Bahnhofstrasse, si trova l’Hotel Glockenhof."@it ;
