    schema:dateModified "2025-11-26T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Herzlich willkommen im Gl&auml;rnischhof - dem gediegenen Hotel in unmittelbarer N&auml;he zu Bahnhofstrasse, Kongresshaus, Tonhalle und Seepromenade. Das Viersternehotel im Herzen von Z&uuml;rich bietet mit seinem motivierten Team pers&ouml;nlichen, freundlichen Service, wobei Effizienz sowie das Handeln im Sinne unserer G&auml;ste immer im Mittelpunkt stehen. Wir offerieren unseren Hotelg&auml;sten kostenfreien W-LAN Zugang, kostenfreien Zutritt zum Luxos Sportsclub und kostenfreie Minibar im Zimmer.</p>"@de,
        "<p>This luxury hotel near Zurich&rsquo;s Tonhalle concert hall is fully focused on protecting the environment and conserving resources. And with its efforts in the sphere of sustainability, it shows that sincere hospitality and ecological awareness go hand-in-hand.<p>The Hotel Gl&auml;rnischhof by Trinity also has much to offer in terms of cuisine. In the two restaurants, Le Poisson and Gl&auml;rnischhof, as well as in the Tapas Bar, Oak Bar, and the To GHo takeaway outlet, guests can enjoy a modern and diverse range of freshly prepared dishes, all prepared using regional and fairly produced ingredients. The hotel also has various banqueting and meeting rooms, a fitness center, and parking spaces. Pets are allowed.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>H&ocirc;tel d`affaires, enti&egrave;rement r&eacute;nov&eacute; en 1996, au coeur de la ville et du centre d`affaires, &agrave; 2 minutes &agrave; pied de la Bahnhofstrasse, du lac, du palais des congr&egrave;s et de la Tonhalle. Suites junior. Rest. Le Poisson (fruits de mer) et Vivace (cuisine italienne) et bar.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>The Hotel Gl&auml;rnischhof is located in the very centre of Zurich, right next to famous Bahnhofstrasse, the congress hall, the music hall and Lake Zurich. It offers free Wi-Fi and free access to the Luxor Fitness Center in the same building. The Vivace Casual restaurant serves Italian specialities. The Le Poisson restaurant serves exquisite seafood and fresh fish and offers a 20% discount for hotel guests. The Bar features an aperitif buffet on weekday afternoons. Guests of the Gl&auml;rnischhof receive a welcome drink upon arrival. Fresh fruit, mineral water and a newspaper are provided in the room on arrival.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel befindet sich im Herzen der Stadt Zürich, unweit von der Bahnhofstrasse und dem Banken- und Finanzviertel."@de,
        "This hotel is located in the heart of the city of Zurich, not far from the Bahnhofstrasse and the banking and financial district."@en,
        "L’hôtel est situé au cœur de la ville de Zurich, non loin de la rue Bahnhofstrasse et du quartier des banques et des finances."@fr,
        "L’hotel si trova nel cuore di Zurigo, non lontano dalla Bahnhofstrasse e dal quartiere bancario e finanziario."@it ;
