    schema:dateModified "2025-11-26T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Das Placid Hotel Zurich verbindet moderne Architektur mit pers&ouml;nlichem Service. 115 Zimmer, Lofts und Suiten im zeitgen&ouml;ssischem Design bieten funktionalen Komfort und freie Ausblicke &uuml;ber die stets wandelnde Metropolen. Das Placid Hotel Zurich ist Ihre Verbindung zu den hipsten Boutiquen und dem Gesch&auml;ftsviertel von Z&uuml;rich-Altstetten. Am Mittag oder Abend speist man in dem Quartier-Szenelokal Buckhuser oder nippt an Cocktails in der dazugeh&ouml;renden Bar. Das K&uuml;chenteam begr&uuml;sst seine G&auml;ste mit nachhaltigen marktfrischen Gerichten aus Produkten der Region. 5 Konferenz und Seminarr&auml;umlichkeiten mit modernstem Equipment bieten MICE M&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r bis zu 150 Teilnehmende an.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The new business hotel in Zurich is a place for cosmopolites, business travelers, and bon vivants &#8210; for here modern architecture meets personal service. A total of 115 rooms and lofts in contemporary design offer functional comfort and unrestricted views over the ever-changing metropolis.<p>The Placid Hotel is the ideal business and seminar hotel, with high-speed Wi-Fi, five multifunctional conference rooms, and a lobby complete with newspaper table, printer, and scanner.</p><p>But the Placid is also a great choice for families with children: on two floors, it offers specially furnished family suites &ndash; the Boutique Smart Suites &ndash; as well as spaces that are ideal for families. These have completely barrier-free accessibility and offer additional extras especially for the youngest guests.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/160570\">Buckhuser</a> is a restaurant with heart and soul: lively and friendly, it unites a lounge, bar, and bistro and serves newly interpreted classic dishes featuring regional products.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le Placid H&ocirc;tel Zurich allie une architecture moderne avec service personnalis&eacute;. 115 chambres et lofts design contemporain offrent un confort fonctionnel et superbes vues sur l'&eacute;volution constante m&eacute;tropole. Le Placid H&ocirc;tel Zurich est votre lien avec les boutiques branch&eacute;es et du centre des affaires de Zurich-Altstetten. A midi ou le soir d&icirc;ner dans cette sc&egrave;ne de quartier Buckhuser local ou siroter des cocktails au bar correspondant. L'&eacute;quipe de cuisine accueille ses clients avec des produits locaux frais du march&eacute; durable. 5 salles de conf&eacute;rences et de s&eacute;minaires avec un &eacute;quipement moderne et MICE dans des installations pouvant accueillir jusqu'&agrave; 150 participants.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il Placid Hotel Zurich combina l'architettura moderna con un servizio personalizzato. 115 camere e loft in stile contemporaneo offrono comfort funzionale e vista stupenda metropoli in continua evoluzione. Il Placid Hotel Zurich &egrave; il tuo collegamento per le boutique pi&ugrave; alla moda e al centro commerciale di Zurigo-Altstetten. A mezzogiorno o la sera in questa scena quartiere di mangiare Buckhuser locale o sorseggiare un cocktail nel bar corrispondente. L'equipaggio della cucina accoglie i suoi ospiti con prodotti locali freschi di mercato sostenibile. 5 sale per conferenze e seminari con attrezzature moderne e topi presso le strutture per un massimo di 150 partecipanti.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In Zürich Altstetten, unweit vom Stadion Letzigrund und der Innenstadt, befindet sich das Placid Hotel Design & Lifestyle."@de,
        "The Placid Hotel Design & Lifestyle is located in Zürich Altstetten, not far from the Letzigrund stadium and the city center."@en,
        "Le Placid Hotel Design & Lifestyle Zurich est situé à Zurich Altstetten, près du stade Letzigrund et du centre-ville."@fr,
        "A Zürich Altstetten, poco lontano dallo stadio Letzigrund e dal centro, si trova il Placid Hotel Design & Lifestyle."@it ;
