    schema:dateModified "2026-06-18T14:34:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Home sweet Helvetia - In Z&uuml;rich zu Hause. Unser Boutique-Hotel mit seinen 35 charmanten Zimmern und den 2 luxuri&ouml;sen Business-Apartments im Dachgeschoss ist ein wahres Bijou im Herzen der Stadt. Mit viel Liebe zum Detail werden klassische Jugendstilelemente mit modernem Interieur kombiniert und schaffen so eine einzigartige Wohnatmosph&auml;re. Das famili&auml;r gef&uuml;hrte und individuelle Hotel Helvetia versteht sich als ein St&uuml;ck Heimat in einer globalen Welt. Ein Zuhause f&uuml;r t&uuml;chtige Gesch&auml;ftsreisende, aktive St&auml;dteentdecker und andere Z&uuml;rich-Verliebte.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Everyone who lives in the city of Zurich is familiar with the &ldquo;Helvti&rdquo;, as it is affectionately known. For in the turbulent 1980s, people gathered here before and after a demonstration; it was also a popular meeting place for musicians, artists, students, and journalists, and it was here that the myth surrounding &ldquo;Z&uuml;ri br&auml;nnt&rdquo; (Zurich is burning) &ndash; relating to a series of youth protests &ndash; arose. Nowadays, this magnificent establishment, with its 34 stylish rooms and two luxurious Attic Junior suites on the top floor, is an absolute gem in the heart of the city.<p>The Helvti bar serves up Zurich history and delicious cocktails. Meanwhile, in the Helvetia restaurant &ndash; which has been awarded 14 points by the Gault-Millau gourmet guide &ndash; guests can enjoy regional, market-fresh dishes and Mediterranean delicacies. The roof terrace with its unrestricted view over the rooftops of Zurich can be rented for private events.</p><p>When the weather is fine, guests can also discover one of Zurich&rsquo;s most amazing pool bars. Located directly on the banks of the Sihl river, it serves crossover food and exotic cocktails Miami-style.</p><p>Situated at Stauffacher, the Boutique &amp; Art Hotel Helvetia lies directly on the intersection between the vibrant Langstrasse quarter and the elegant Kreis 1 district.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Home sweet Helvetia - se sentir chez soi &agrave; Zurich Notre boutique h&ocirc;tel avec ses 35 chambres de charme et ses 2 appartements d'affaires de luxe au dernier &eacute;tage est un v&eacute;ritable bijou nich&eacute; au c&oelig;ur de la ville. Avec un grand amour du d&eacute;tail, des &eacute;l&eacute;ments Art nouveau classiques ont &eacute;t&eacute; combin&eacute;s avec un int&eacute;rieur moderne pour cr&eacute;er une ambiance de vie unique. L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Helvetia, &agrave; la gestion familiale et individuel, offre un chez-soi dans un monde globalis&eacute; aux voyageurs d&rsquo;affaires, aux explorateurs de la ville et aux passionn&eacute;s de Zurich.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Casa dolce Helvetia - sentirsi a casa a Zurigo Il nostro hotel boutique con le sue 35 camere affascinanti e 2 appartamenti business di lusso nel piano attico &egrave; un vero gioiello incastonato nel cuore della citt&agrave;. Con grande amore per i dettagli, gli elementi art nouveau classici sono stati combinati con un interno moderno per creare un ambiente di vita unico. L'hotel Helvetia, a conduzione familiare e individuale, offre una casa lontano da casa in un mondo globalizzato a viaggiatori d'affari, esploratori della citt&agrave; e amanti della citt&agrave;.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Boutique & Art Hotel Helvetia befindet sich am Stauffacher, zwischen dem eleganten Kreis 1 und dem lebendigen Langstrasse-Quartier."@de,
        "The Boutique & Art Hotel Helvetia is located at Stauffacher, between the elegant Kreis 1 district and the vibrant Langstrasse quarter."@en,
        "Le Boutique & Art Hôtel Helvetia est situé près de l’arrêt de tram Stauffacher, entre l’élégant 1er arr. et le quartier animé de la Langstrasse."@fr,
        "Il Boutique & Art Hotel Helvetia si trova alla fermata del tram Stauffacher, tra l’elegante Kreis 1 e il vivace quartiere della Langstrasse."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotel-helvetia.ch" ;
