    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Auch an Feiertagen ist die Visitor Information telefonisch erreichbar. Die Zeiten k&ouml;nnen jedoch abweichen.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Visitor Information is also available by phone on public holidays; however, the opening hours may vary.</p>"@en,
        "<p>L&rsquo;office du tourisme est &eacute;galement joignable par t&eacute;l&eacute;phone les jours f&eacute;ri&eacute;s, mais les horaires peuvent varier.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>L&rsquo;ufficio turistico &egrave; raggiungibile anche telefonicamente nei giorni festivi, ma gli orari possono variare.</p>"@it ;
