    schema:dateModified "2025-11-26T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Das KINDLI verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber 20 individuell gestaltete G&auml;stezimmer auf vier Etagen. Bei der Einrichtung wurde h&ouml;chsten Wert auf behaglichen Komfort und zeitlose Eleganz gelegt. Die G&auml;ste sollen sich wohl f&uuml;hlen; sich in gepflegter Umgebung entspannen, wunderbar schlafen in Betten von H&auml;stens und im Bad sp&uuml;rbar belebtes Wasser geniessen. Und dank modernster Internet-Infrastruktur ist man jederzeit mit der Welt verbunden. Jedes Zimmer im KINDLI hat seinen eigenen Charakter. Die Preise richten sich nach Raumgr&ouml;sse und Komfort. Inbegriffen sind der Service, das gepflegte Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;cks-Buffet, die Getr&auml;nke in der Minibar und Internetzugang.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Pilgrims first stayed at the Haus zum Kindli over 500 years ago. And still today, the city hotel is committed to the tradition of its past and remains an open house for visitors from all over the world, who stay for a few days and always want to return.<p>Located close to the history-steeped Lindenhof, in the heart of Zurich&rsquo;s Old Town and just a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the famous Bahhnhofstrasse, this charming boutique hotel retains the character of a private residence. The 20 rooms and 6 business apartments are individually designed and radiate warmth, comfort, and simple elegance.</p><p>Guests can enjoy top cuisine and traditional Swiss hospitality in the Restaurant Kindli on Rennweg, where classic Central European dishes are accompanied by discreet and attentive service.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel KINDLI dispose de plus de 20 chambres d&rsquo;h&ocirc;te individuelles sur quatre &eacute;tages. Par la d&eacute;coration, on a donn&eacute; une grande valeur au confort et &agrave; une &eacute;l&eacute;gance ind&eacute;modable. Les convives doivent se sentir &agrave; l&rsquo;aise, et dans un environnement soign&eacute; et relaxant, dormira merveille dans des lits de Hastens et savourer dans les bains une eau revigorante. Gr&acirc;ce a son infrastructure moderne et l&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;Internet permettent une constante communication avec le monde. Chaque chambre a sa propre personnalit&eacute;. Les prix transparents sont model&eacute;s selon la taille et le confort. Dans les tarifs sont inclus le ser&shy;vice, le buffet soign&eacute; du petit-d&eacute;jeuner, les boissons du minibar et l&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; Internet.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>The KINDLI has 20 individually designed guest rooms located on four floors. The rooms are decorated for comfort in a style of timeless elegance. Guests should feel relaxed and at ease sleep well in beds made by Haestens and bathe in especially energized Grander water. A constant link to the outside world is ensured by the latest Internet infrastructure. Each room in the KINDLI has its own individual character. The pricing is according to the size and comfort level of the rooms. Service, a delicious breakfast buffet, the drinks in the mini-bar and Internet access are all free of charge and included in the room price.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das charmante Boutique Hotel liegt am historischen Lindenhof, mitten in der Zürcher Altstadt."@de,
        "This charming boutique hotel is situated close to the historic Lindenhof, in the heart of Zurich’s Old Town."@en,
        "Ce charmant hôtel-boutique sur l’historique sommet Lindenhof est au cœur de la vieille ville de Zurich."@fr,
        "L’affascinante boutique hotel si trova vicino allo storico Lindenhof, nel cuore del centro storico zurighese."@it ;
    schema:email "hotel@kindli.ch" ;
