    schema:dateModified "2026-08-10T10:09:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Am Tor zur Z&uuml;rcher Altstadt, nur 300 Schritte vom Hauptbahnhof entfernt steht unser Hotel. Die Strassenbahn Haltestelle Central befindet sich direkt vor dem Haus. Alle unsere Zimmer sind mit TV Radio&amp;Telefon ausgestattet. Unmittelbare N&auml;he zur Einkaufspassage, Museen, Theater, Kino, Universit&auml;t und ETH.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Hotel Limmathof stands right where the romantic Old Town meets the bustling city life. It is housed in a historical building, in which both business and leisure travelers immediately feel at home.<p>In the Pot au Vert restaurant, lovers of meat-free cuisine can enjoy exciting and varied vegetarian dishes, while the Weinstube 1923 serves hearty specialties featuring popular Swiss cuisine.</p><p>The picturesque Lake Zurich and the famous Bahnhofstrasse are only a few minutes away from the hotel. There are also numerous charming caf&eacute;s, bars, and restaurants in the immediate vicinity.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Situ&eacute; &agrave; seulement 300 m&egrave;tres de la gare principale de Zurich, vous trouverez notre h&ocirc;tel. L'arr&ecirc;t de tram CENTRAL juste en face de l'immeuble. Toutes nos chambres disposent de la t&eacute;l&eacute;vision, radio et t&eacute;l&eacute;phone. &Agrave; distance de marche de la zone commer&ccedil;ante, des mus&eacute;es, des th&eacute;&acirc;tres, des cin&eacute;mas et universitaire.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Situato a soli 300 metri dalla stazione centrale di Zurigo, si trova il nostro albergo. La fermata del tram CENTRAL proprio di fronte all'edificio. Tutte le camere sono dotate di TV, radio e telefono. A pochi passi da centri commerciali, musei, teatri, cinema e universit&agrave;.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "An bester Lage, in der romantischen Zürcher Altstadt, befindet sich das Hotel Limmathof."@de,
        "The Hotel Limmathof is situated in a prime location in the romantic Old Town of Zurich."@en,
        "L’hôtel Limmathof est très bien placé au cœur de la vieille ville romantique de Zurich."@fr,
        "In posizione ottimale, nel romantico centro storico di Zurigo, si trova l’Hotel Limmathof."@it ;
