    schema:description "<p>Das Hotel Marta im Z&uuml;rcher Niederdorf liegt sehr zentral &ndash; nur wenige Gehminuten vom Z&uuml;rcher Hauptbahnhof und verschiedenen Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten entfernt. Angesagte Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s, der Z&uuml;richsee oder kleine Gesch&auml;fte und Boutiquen sind in wenigen Minuten zu Fuss erreichbar. G&auml;ste geniessen einen erlebnisreichen Aufenthalt im Herzen von Z&uuml;rich in den 39 schlichten, modernen Hotelzimmern mit eigenem Bad verteilt auf sieben Etagen. Im Zimmerpreis ist auch ein vegetarisches Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;cksbuffet enthalten.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Hotel Marta is situated directly at the entrance to the Old Town, surrounded by restaurants, bars, and numerous tourist attractions. Spread over the six stories of the building on Z&auml;hringerstrasse are 39 modern, simple, and urban rooms, each with their own bathroom with shower/WC. The diversity of the building materials used and the subtly coordinated color scheme give the hotel a very special ambiance and individual feel. &nbsp;<p>Thanks to the hotel&rsquo;s central location, shopping facilities, places of interest, restaurants, and various bars can be reached in just a few minutes on foot, by bicycle or by public transportation.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>L'h&ocirc;tel marta dans le Niederdorf zurichois est tr&egrave;s bien situ&eacute; - &agrave; quelques minutes &agrave; pied seulement de la gare centrale de Zurich et de diverses attractions touristiques. Les restaurants et caf&eacute;s branch&eacute;s, le lac de Zurich ou les petits magasins et boutiques sont accessibles en quelques minutes &agrave; pied. Dans les 39 chambres sobres et modernes de l'h&ocirc;tel, r&eacute;parties sur sept &eacute;tages et &eacute;quip&eacute;es d'une salle de bain priv&eacute;e.les clients profitent de s&eacute;jours riches en exp&eacute;riences au c&oelig;ur de Zurich. Le prix de la chambre comprend en outre un buffet de petit-d&eacute;jeuner v&eacute;g&eacute;tarien.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>L'hotel Marta a Niederdorf di Zurigo &egrave; situato in posizione centrale, a pochi minuti a piedi dalla stazione ferroviaria principale di Zurigo e da varie attrazioni turistiche. Ristoranti e caff&egrave; alla moda, il lago di Zurigo o piccoli negozi e boutique sono raggiungibili a piedi in pochi minuti. Gli ospiti potranno godere di un soggiorno ricco di eventi nel cuore di Zurigo nelle 39 camere dell'hotel, semplici e moderne, con bagno privato distribuite su sette piani. Il prezzo della camera include anche una colazione vegetariana a buffet.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Garnihotel Hotel Marta befindet sich gleich beim Central, in unmittelbarer Nähe von Zürich HB und Limmatquai."@de,
        "The Garnihotel, Hotel Marta, is located directly on Central, in the immediate vicinity of Zurich Main Station and the Limmatquai."@en,
        "L’hôtel garni Marta est situé près de la place centrale, à proximité immédiate de la gare de Zurich et du quai de la Limmat."@fr,
        "L’hotel garni Marta si trova a Central, nelle immediate vicinanze della Stazione Centrale di Zurigo e del Limmatquai."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotelmarta.ch" ;
