    schema:description "<p>Drei Sterne in neuem Glanz in Z&uuml;rich. Nach der vollst&auml;ndigen Renovation des ganzen Hauses geniessen Sie das Gef&uuml;hl von gem&uuml;tlichem Komfort. Lassen Sie sich von unserer individuellen Ambiance und einem originellen kulinarischen Angebot in der Bistro--Bar L</p>"@de,
        "<p>To ensure the perfect stay in Zurich, the hotel offers different types of rooms, whereby 29 of the 74 guest rooms are furnished with French fair and modern elegance. All the rooms feature free hi-speed Wi-Fi, satellite and pay TV, and a minibar. In the mornings, guests are treated to the best breakfast in the city, prepared with love and using high-quality, regional products.<p>The Montana is an ideal base for excursions through Zurich: the Main Train Station is just a 3-minute walk and the trendy Z&uuml;rich-West quarter only 5 tram stops away. The Old Town with the Niederdorf quarter is also within easy walking distance.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Trois &eacute;toiles brillent d`un nouvel &eacute;clat &agrave; Zurich. Apr&egrave;s la r&eacute;novation compl&egrave;te de toute la maison vous pouvez jouir du sentiment de confort total. Une nouvelle ambiance plus individuelle y r&egrave;gne et l`offre gastronomique du bistro--bar Le Lyonnais est ori</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Hotel 3 Stelle a Zurigo, Dopo il restauro du tutto l'hotel godetevi le sensazioni del Comfort totale. Fatevi viziare dal nostro ambiente e la nostra originale offerta culinaria.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Unmittelbar neben dem Hauptbahnhof, im ruhigeren Teil des lebendigen Kreis 5, in der Nähe des Museums für Gestaltung und des Landesmuseums befindet sich das Hotel Montana."@de,
        "The Hotel Montana is located directly next to the Main Train Station in the quieter part of the lively Kreis 5 district, near the Museum für Gestaltung and the National Museum."@en,
        "L’hôtel Montana est situé tout près de la gare centrale, dans la partie calme du très animé 5e arrondissement, à proximité du musée du design et du musée national."@fr,
        "Accanto alla Stazione Centrale, nella parte più tranquilla del vivace Kreis 5, vicino al Museo di arti figurative e al Museo Nazionale Zurigo, si trova l’Hotel Montana."@it ;
    schema:email "reservation@hotelmontana.ch" ;
