    schema:description "<p>Neu renoviertes Deluxe Hotel mit h&ouml;chstem Komfort, Stil und Exklusivit&auml;t, 5 Minuten vom Flughafen und 10 Minuten von der City entfernt. Flughafenhotel mit Erlebnischarakter und kulinarischer Vielfalt, 333 grosse und sch&ouml;ne Zimmer, davon 58 Executive Zimmer und 10 Suiten, Klassisches M&ouml;venpick Hotel Restaurant und das \"Le Chalet-Swiss Grill\" (Schweizer Grillrestaurant), moderne Bar, Sommerterrasse und Lobby Lounge</p>"@de,
        "<p>The hotel offers a high level of comfort, style, and exclusivity and features beautiful, spacious rooms with a high-quality interior design.<p>The M&ouml;venpick Hotel Zurich Airport also treats guests to a wide range of first-class culinary experiences. Four highly renowned restaurants invite guests to indulge and enjoy. In addition, the completely renovated, multifunctional business center provides flexible meeting rooms with state-of-the-art technology to meet the highest of requirements.</p><p>Guests also benefit from a complimentary shuttle service to the airport, which runs every 15 minutes during the main flight arrival and departure times.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>H&ocirc;tel de luxe r&eacute;cemment r&eacute;nov&eacute; avec le plus grand confort, style et exclusivit&eacute;, &agrave; 5 minutes de l'a&eacute;roport et &agrave; 10 minutes de la ville. H&ocirc;tel d'a&eacute;roport avec une vari&eacute;t&eacute; d'aventure et de cuisine, 333 grandes et belles chambres, dont 58 chambres ex&eacute;cutives et 10 suites, restaurant de l'h&ocirc;tel Classic M&ouml;venpick et \"Le Chalet-Swiss Grill\", un bar moderne, une terrasse d'&eacute;t&eacute; et un salon dans le hall.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Nuovo hotel rinnovato di recente con massimo comfort, stile ed esclusivit&agrave;, a 5 minuti dall'aeroporto ea 10 minuti dalla citt&agrave;. L'hotel dispone di 333 ampie e bellissime camere, tra cui 58 camere executive e 10 suite, il ristorante dell'hotel Classic M&ouml;venpick e il ristorante \"The Le Chalet-Swiss Grill\", il bar moderno, la terrazza estiva e la hall</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In Glattbrugg, nur 5 Minuten vom Flughafen Zürich und 10 Minuten von der City entfernt, befindet sich das Mövenpick Hotel Zürich Airport."@de,
        "The Mövenpick Hotel Zurich Airport is located in Glattbrugg, only 5 minutes from Zurich Airport and 10 minutes from the city center."@en,
        "L’hôtel Mövenpick Zurich Airport est situé à Glattbrugg, à seulement 5 minutes de l’aéroport de Zurich et à 10 minutes du centre-ville."@fr,
        "A Glattbrugg, a soli 5 minuti dall’aeroporto di Zurigo e a 10 dalla city, si trova il Mövenpick Hotel Zürich Airport."@it ;
    schema:email "hotel.zurich.airport@movenpick.com" ;
