    schema:dateModified "2025-11-18T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>5* Superior: Das Park Hyatt Z&uuml;rich ist ein zeitgem&auml;sses 5-Sterne-Hotel, vereint hochmoderne Technologie mit einer &auml;usserst komfortablen und anspruchsvollen Ausstattung der Hotelzimmer. F&uuml;r die Architektur dieser Stahl-Glas-Konstruktion zeichnen sich die Meili Peter Architekten AG aus Z&uuml;rich verantwortlich. Das Konzept f&uuml;r das Design der Inneneinrichtung haben HBA, Hirsch, Bedner Associates aus den USA, entwickelt. Insgesamt 138 grossz&uuml;gige Zimmer, davon 24 Suiten und eine Pr&auml;sidential Suite, sind so gestaltet,dass Reisende ein Optimum an Erholung mit dem Komfort modernster Kommunikationsausstattung finden.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The spacious rooms and suites offer every amenity that guests could wish for. The elegant and modern design runs through every room of this centrally located hotel, creating perfect harmony between modern concepts and personal service.<p>The <a data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5d0918fd-8878-48b1-9a81-caa123138dbb\" href=\"/node/2305\">Parkhuus restaurant</a> treats its guests to Swiss gourmet cuisine made from local ingredients, while the <a data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"fd83d43e-be30-4cd1-96bb-43c898a618f3\" href=\"/node/29534\">Onyx Bar</a> offers signature cocktails, rare spirits, and first-class wines. And those who are looking to relax after an eventful day in Switzerland&rsquo;s largest city can work out on the equipment at Club Olympus Spa &amp; Fitness or simply unwind in the spa.</p><p>Eight flexible rooms, including an opulent ballroom, are available for meetings and banquets. Each function room has natural daylight, Wi-Fi, and the latest technological equipment.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>5* Sup&eacute;rieur: Le Park Hyatt Zurich est un h&ocirc;tel contemporain cinq &eacute;toiles, combine une architecture et une technologie ultra moderne avec une conception des chambres utilisant les toutes derni&egrave;res innovations en termes de confort. L'architecture de l'h&ocirc;tel, alliant le verre et l'acier, a &eacute;t&eacute; dessin&eacute;e par Meili Peter Architekten AG, Zurich, alors que le concept d'architecture d'int&eacute;rieur a &eacute;t&eacute; cr&eacute;&eacute; par HBA, Hirsch, Bedner Associates, USA. Les 138 spacieuses chambres du Park Hyatt Zurich, dont 24 suites et une suite pr&eacute;sidentielle, ont &eacute;t&eacute; sp&eacute;cialement dessin&eacute;es pour offrir un havre de paix relaxant, b&eacute;n&eacute;ficiant des plus r&eacute;cents outils de communications.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>5* Superiore: Il Park Hyatt Zurigo &egrave; un hotel di lusso, unisce una architettura ultra-moderna ad una tecnologia che prevede i comfort pi&ugrave; all'avanguardia. La struttura architettonica in acciaio e vetro &egrave; stata progettata da Meili Peter Architekten AG, Zurich, mentre il design degli interni &egrave; stato creato da HBA, Hirsch, Bedner Associates, USA. L'hotel dispone di 138 camere spaziose, di cui 24 suite e una suite presidenziale progettate e pensate nei minimi dettagli per garantire un soggiorno rilassante e confortevole con il vantaggio di tecnologie all'avanguardia.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Herzen der Stadt, nur einen Spaziergang von der Bahnhofstrasse und dem See entfernt, liegt das exklusive, urbane Park Hyatt Zürich."@de,
        "The exclusive, urban Park Hyatt Zurich. Lies in the heart of the city, just a short stroll from the Bahnhofstrasse and the lake."@en,
        "Le très exclusif hôtel urbain Park Hyatt Zurich au cœur de la ville est à courte distance à pied de la rue Bahnhofstrasse et du lac."@fr,
        "Nel cuore della città, a una passeggiata di distanza dalla Bahnhofstrasse e dal lago, si trova l’esclusivo, urbano Park Hyatt Zürich."@it ;
    schema:email "zurich.park@hyatt.com" ;
