    schema:description "<p>Beste Lage: gegen&uuml;ber dem Z&uuml;rcher HB, nur 10 Min. mit direkter Zugsverbindung vom internationalen Flughafen, an der ber&uuml;hmten und eleganten Bahnhofstrasse (ideal f&uuml;r Eink&auml;ufe und Gesch&auml;fte). Schallisoliert und Klimaanlage.</p>"@de,
        "<p>For almost 150 years, the Schweizerhof has been inspiring people from all over the world. The 95 rooms and suites skillfully combine modern-day amenities with stylish luxury.<p>The lavish breakfast is included for all overnight guests, while in the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/36154\">La Soupi&egrave;re restaurant</a> visitors are treated to regional and French cuisine. Light delicacies and antipasti are served in the Caf&eacute; Gourmet. In addition, the Schweizerhof Bar is the perfect place to bring the day to a close with a drink in elegant surroundings.</p><p>Business travelers appreciate how easily the Schweizerhof can be reached from the airport by train, while tourists value its prime location for exploring the city and other destinations in Switzerland.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La meilleure position: vis-&agrave;-vis de la gare principale, 10 min. en train direct de l`a&eacute;roport international et &agrave; la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre et &eacute;l&eacute;gante \"Rue de la Gare\" (id&eacute;al pour vos achats et vos affaires). Insonoris&eacute;e et &agrave; air-conditionn&eacute;e.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Situato in centro: di fronte alla stazione centrale, a soli 10 min. di distanza con collegamento ferroviario diretto dall`aeroporto, sulla elegante \"Bahnhofstrasse\" (shopping). Finestre a triplo-vetro e aria condizionata.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das historische Haus liegt direkt gegenüber dem Zürcher Hauptbahnhof. Sowohl die berühmte Bahnhofstrasse wie auch die aufstrebende Europaallee sind nur einen Steinwurf entfernt."@de,
        "This history-steeped establishment lies directly opposite Zurich Main Station. Both the famous Bahnhofstrasse and the up-and-coming Europaallee are just a stone’s throw away."@en,
        "Ce bâtiment historique est situé juste en face de la gare centrale de Zurich et à une encablure de la rue Bahnhofstrasse et de l’émergeante Europaallee."@fr,
        "Questo storico albergo si trova di fronte alla stazione centrale di Zurigo, vicinissimo alla famosa Bahnhofstrasse e all’emergente Europaallee."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotelschweizerhof.com" ;
    schema:geo _:N7c5edc43dc914b45860fc5bbf274913c ;
