    schema:description "<p>Das Eventhotel verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber 40 helle Seminar- und Konferenzr&auml;ume f&uuml;r 4 bis 550 Personen. Auch f&uuml;r Gala-Events oder Firmenanl&auml;sse f&uuml;r bis zu 1000 Personen ist das SEEDAMM PLAZA die ideale Location. Die im Herzen des Hauses angesiedelte Gastronomie-Oase mit Restaurants, Bar, Lounge und Lobbybereich bietet zu jeder Tages- und Abendzeit das passende Angebot. Regional, international, mediterran und japanisch. Hier geht es beim Business Lunch z&uuml;gig voran, das Essen mit Freunden und Familie wird gem&uuml;tlich und unkompliziert zelebriert. Saisonal wechselnde Speisen, kreativ und mit Leidenschaft zubereitet, erfreuen anspruchsvolle Gaumen. F&uuml;r Entspannung sorgen die behagliche Ambiance in den 142 G&auml;stezimmern wie auch der Saunabereich mit Bio-Sauna, klassischer Sauna und Dampfbad. Sportbegeisterte treffen sich im Gym mit KINESIS&trade; Kraftger&auml;ten. Das Casino Pf&auml;ffikon befindet sich direkt im Geb&auml;ude.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The event hotel has 40 bright and airy seminar and conference rooms with capacity for 4&ndash;550 persons. The Seedamm Plaza in Pf&auml;ffikon is also the ideal venue for banquets and corporate events with up to 1,000 guests. The gastronomic oasis, with its restaurants, bar, and lounge, located in the heart of the hotel provides plenty of culinary diversity. The lobby area is also a relaxing place for guests to treat themselves to a refreshing drink.<p>The 142 comfortable rooms are equipped with every amenity, while the sauna area with both bio and classic saunas, as well as a steam bath, is a great place to relax and unwind. In addition, the fitness room is perfectly equipped for those who like to work off their energy after a strenuous day.&nbsp;</p><p>In this family-friendly hotel, entertainment and fun is guaranteed in the Break &amp; Game Room, complete with video game consoles, table soccer, and dartboard. A pool table and an XXL chess round off the in-house activities.</p><p>For a glamorous and &ndash; who knows &ndash; perhaps even enriching end to the day, guests can pay a visit to the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/visit/nightlife/swiss-casinos-pfaeffikon\">Casino Pf&auml;ffikon</a>, which is housed in the same building.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La &laquo;Maison des &eacute;v&eacute;nements&raquo; propose 40 salles de conf&eacute;rence et de r&eacute;union lumineuses pouvant accueillir de 4 &agrave; 550 participants. Le SEEDAMM PLAZA est &eacute;galement l'endroit id&eacute;al pour les d&icirc;ners de gala ou les &eacute;v&eacute;nements d'entreprise pouvant accueillir jusqu'&agrave; 1 000 invit&eacute;s. L'oasis culinaire avec ses restaurants, son bar, son salon et son hall d'accueil offre le bon choix, quelle que soit la journ&eacute;e. R&eacute;gional, international, m&eacute;diterran&eacute;en et japonais. Que ce soit pour un d&eacute;jeuner d&rsquo;affaires rapide ou un moment confortable et sans complication avec la famille et les amis. Plats changeants selon les saisons, cr&eacute;atifs et pr&eacute;par&eacute;s avec passion. Que ce soit apr&egrave;s une journ&eacute;e de s&eacute;minaire &eacute;puisante ou une excursion, vous pourrez vous d&eacute;tendre dans l'ambiance chaleureuse des 142 chambres ainsi que dans l'espace sauna dot&eacute; d'un sauna bio, d'un sauna classique et d'un bain &agrave; vapeur. Les amateurs d</p>"@fr,
        "<p>La &laquo;Casa degli eventi&raquo; offre 40 sale conferenze e riunioni luminose per eventi da 4 a 550 partecipanti. Anche per cene di gala o eventi aziendali per un massimo di 1000 ospiti, SEEDAMM PLAZA &egrave; il luogo perfetto. L'oasi culinaria con ristoranti, bar, lounge e una hall, offre la scelta giusta in qualsiasi giorno. Regionale, internazionale, mediterranea e giapponese. Sia per godersi un pranzo di lavoro veloce o un momento confortevole e semplice con la famiglia e gli amici. Piatti che cambiano stagionalmente, creativamente e preparati con passione. Non importa se dopo una faticosa giornata di seminari o un'escursione, troverete relax nell'atmosfera accogliente delle 142 camere e nell'area sauna con biosauna, sauna classica e bagno turco. Gli appassionati di sport si incontrano nella sala fitness con le attrezzature per il potenziamento della forza KINESIS &trade;. Il casin&ograve; Pf&auml;ffikon &egrave; collegat</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In Pfäffikon am Zürichsee befindet sich das Hotel Seedamm Plaza mit angeschlossenem Casino, nur 30 Minuten von der Stadt Zürich entfernt."@de,
        "The Seedamm Plaza hotel with its adjoining casino is located in Pfäffikon, on Lake Zurich, just 30 minutes from the city of Zurich."@en,
        "L’hôtel Seedamm Plaza, au lac de Zurich à Pfäffikon, se situe à seulement 30 minutes de Zurich et dispose de son propre casino."@fr,
        "A Pfäffikon, in riva al Lago di Zurigo, a soli 30 minuti dalla città, si trova l’Hotel Seedamm Plaza con casinò annesso."@it ;
