    schema:description "<p>Zentrale Lage, N&auml;he See und Opernhaus. Das Gesch&auml;ftszentrum/Bahnhofstrasse ist mit Tram 2 und 4 in K&uuml;rze zu erreichen. Alle Zimmer mit Bad/Dusche, WC, TV, Radio und Direktwahl-Telefon. Gen&uuml;gend Parkpl&auml;tze und Tiefgarage.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Hotel Seefeld &ndash; A Sorell Experience is located in Zurich Seefeld &ndash; where art and culture, maritime flair, and hip locations come together to create a unique vibe &ndash; and invites guests to enjoy a stylish stay with excellent service.<p>Here guests are welcomed with comfort, design, and state-of-the-art technology. The hotel is characterized by its relaxing ambiance and outstanding service. The harmoniously furnished rooms feature parquet flooring, a modern bathroom with bath/shower, and a large desk. The amenities naturally also include a TV and free Wi-Fi. The rooms overlook the courtyard or the Seefeld quarter. In addition, well-lit outdoor and indoor parking spaces are available.</p><p>Guests should not miss the adjoining <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1012267\" data-entity-uuid=\"b23d35ea-055c-435f-b842-53ee1e9db799\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Caf&eacute; Bar FLOR</a>, a relaxed meeting place offering coffee, snacks, and after-work drinks from early morning until late at night.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Situation centrale, pr&egrave;s du lac et op&eacute;ra. Tram 2 et 4 vers la Bahnhofstrasse toute proche. Chambres avec bain/douche, WC, TV, radio, t&eacute;l&eacute;phone s&eacute;lection directe. Places de stationnement et garage.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Posizione centrale vicino al lago e all'opera. La Bahnhofstrasse &egrave; raggiungibile in poco tempo con il tram 2 o 4. Tutte le camere con bagno/doccia, WC, TV, radio e telefono diretto. Posteggi a sufficienza e garage sotterraneo.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel liegt im Zentrum von Zürich, im wunderschönen Seefeldquartier, nur wenige Gehminuten vom See und dem Opernhaus."@de,
        "The Hotel is located in the center of Zurich, in the beautiful Seefeld quarter, just a few minutes’ walk from the lake and the opera house."@en,
        "L’hôtel est situé au centre de Zurich, dans le magnifique quartier de Seefeld, à seulement quelques minutes à pied du lac et de l’opéra."@fr,
        "L’Hotel si trova al centro di Zurigo, nel bellissimo quartiere di Seefeld, a pochi minuti a piedi dal lago e dal Teatro dell’Opera."@it ;
    schema:email "seefeld@sorellhotels.com" ;
