    schema:description "<p>Auf den ersten Blick merkt man es gar nicht, aber die Auslagen in dieser B&auml;ckerei sind etwas Besonderes: Der Grossteil der Ware ist vom Vortag, zusammengetragen von Partnern der &Auml;ss-Bar. Was normalerweise entsorgt w&uuml;rde, obwohl es noch von guter Qualit&auml;t und tollem Geschmack ist, das landet nun in diesem Lokal.<p>Sandwiches, Dessert und so weiter: Zu g&uuml;nstigen Preisen kann man hier dem Genuss fr&ouml;nen und auch noch etwas gegen Essensverschwendung tun.</p><p>Ebenfalls originell: Tee und Kaffee kann man selber kochen.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>At first glance, it is not evident that the food items on sale at this bakery are rather special: most of them are left-overs from the previous day that have been collected from the partners of the &Auml;ss-Bar (the name is a play on words and in Swiss-German means &ldquo;edible&rdquo;). Here, food that would normally be thrown away &ndash; despite the fact that it is still of good quality and tastes great &ndash; makes its way onto the shelves.<p>Sandwiches, desserts and much more besides: at the &Auml;ss-Bar you can indulge in tasty products at attractive prices &ndash; and at the same time contribute towards combating food wastage.</p><p>And other original idea: customers also have the opportunity to make their own tea or coffee.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>A premi&egrave;re vue, on ne s&rsquo;en rend pas compte, mais les &eacute;talages de cette boulangerie sortent du lot&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit de denr&eacute;es fabriqu&eacute;es la veille par diff&eacute;rents partenaires de l&rsquo;&Auml;ssbar. Au lieu de finir &agrave; la poubelle, ces produits de bonne qualit&eacute; et de go&ucirc;t savoureux sont vendus ici.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p>On y trouve des sandwichs, des desserts et d&rsquo;autres produits &agrave; prix r&eacute;duit&nbsp;: &agrave; savourer tout en luttant contre le gaspillage alimentaire.</p><p>On peut &eacute;galement y pr&eacute;parer soi-m&ecirc;me son th&eacute; ou son caf&eacute;.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Di primo acchito, non si nota nemmeno, ma i prodotti di questa panetteria sono davvero speciali: la maggior parte, infatti, &egrave; del giorno prima e viene raccolta dai partner dell&rsquo;&Auml;ss-Bar. Ci&ograve; che verrebbe normalmente buttato, seppur ancora di buona qualit&agrave; e ottimo sapore, finisce ora in questo locale.<p>Sandwich, dolci e cos&igrave; via: qui &egrave; possibile abbandonarsi al gusto a prezzi economici e fare qualcosa contro gli sprechi alimentari.</p><p>Un altro dettaglio originale: t&egrave; e caff&egrave; si possono preparare con le proprie mani.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Dies ist keine normale Bäckerei, sondern eine Herzensangelegenheit von Leuten, die sich gegen «Foodwaste» einsetzen."@de,
        "This is no normal bakery, but a store run by people who want to do their bit to cut down on food wastage."@en,
        "Une affaire de cœur : cette boulangerie exceptionnelle s’engage contre le gaspillage alimentaire."@fr,
        "Questa non è una panetteria normale, bensì un’iniziativa di grande importanza per chi si impegna contro gli sprechi alimentari."@it ;
    schema:email "zuerich@aess-bar.ch" ;
