    schema:dateModified "2026-07-01T15:25:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Ob im zeitgem&auml;ssen, modernen Businesszimmer, im gem&uuml;tlich, ger&auml;umigen Doppelzimmer oder im romantischen Loveroom mit Whirlpool - bei uns liegen Sie immer richtig! Unsere 101 Hotelzimmer verf&uuml;gen alle &uuml;ber Dusche oder Bad, WC, Haartrockner, TV/Radio, Telefon, kostenloser W-Lan zugriff, automatischen Weckdienst und Minibar. Rezeption ist von 6.00 - 23.00 Uhr ge&ouml;ffnet. F&uuml;r sp&auml;tere Anreisen kontaktieren Sie bitte das Hotel direkt.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Hotel Sonnental &ndash; A Sorell Experience is conveniently located on the outskirts of Zurich and offers 101 rooms in three different categories. Whether standard, business class, or suite&nbsp;&#8210; here every guest will find something to suit. Some rooms also have a private whirlpool.&nbsp;<p>The SOL restaurant combines flavors from the Levant to Liguria. Whether it's a tavolata, business lunch, or dinner with friends, it's all about enjoyment, conviviality, and that holiday feeling. Every first Sunday of the month (September to June), there is a brunch with regional specialties, baked goods from the Jung bakery, warm delicacies, freshly prepared egg dishes, and a dessert buffet.</p><p>Conferences and seminars, as well as celebrations and banquets, are held in a large meeting room with Swiss stone pine paneling, which is ideally located close to the city of Zurich and the airport.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Chambres &agrave; r&ecirc;ves! Vous trouverez toujours la bonne pi&egrave;ce au repos - que ce soit dans une de nos chambres d'affaires avec connexion W-LAN ou dans l'une des deux salles d'amour romantiques ayant leur propre bain &agrave; remous. Notre espace bien-&ecirc;tre de 300m2 offre beaucoup de possibilit&eacute;s diff&eacute;rentes. La r&eacute;ception est ouverte 6 heures-23 heures. Pour les arriv&eacute;es tardives s'il vous pla&icirc;t contacter l'h&ocirc;tel &agrave; l'avance.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Camere per sogno! Troverete sempre la stanza diritto al riposo - o in una delle nostre camere business con connessione w-lan o in una delle due camere d'amore romantiche con proprio idromassaggio. La nostra zona benessere 300m2 offre un sacco di possibilit&agrave; diverse. La reception &egrave; aperta 06:00-23:00. Per gli arrivi tardivi si prega di contattare l'hotel in anticipo.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel Sonnental in Dübendorf ist in nur 10 Minuten vom Flughafen Zürich erreichbar. Durch seine Nähe zur Messe Zürich eignet sich das Hotel auch für Geschäftsreisen."@de,
        "The Hotel Sonnental in Dübendorf is just 10 minutes from Zurich Airport. Thanks to its proximity to the Messe Zürich exhibition center, the hotel is also suitable for business trips."@en,
        "L'hôtel Sonnental à Dübendorf est situé à seulement 10 minutes de l'aéroport de Zurich. Près du centre de foires de Zurich, l'hôtel convient également aux voyages d'affaires."@fr,
        "Il Hotel Sonnental di Dübendorf dista solo 10 minuti dall’aeroporto di Zurigo. La sua vicinanza alla fiera di Zurigo lo rende perfetto per chi viaggia per affari."@it ;
