    schema:dateModified "2026-08-03T09:57:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>PREMIUM HOTELPARTNER - Im Herzen von Z&uuml;rich und direkt an der ber&uuml;hmten \"Bahnhofstrasse\" bietet das Hotel St. Gotthard modernen Komfort an erstklassiger Lage. Das historische 4 Sterne Hotel, familiengef&uuml;hrt seit 1889, verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber 138 klimatisierte Zimmer, 3 Restaurants &amp; Bars und 5 Meetingr&auml;ume. Kostenloses Wlan ist im gesamten Hotel verf&uuml;gbar. Die G&auml;ste sch&auml;tzen die zentrale Lage mitten in der Stadt und nur 100 Meter vom Hauptbahnhof entfernt. Gesch&auml;fte, Restaurants, Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten und die Z&uuml;rcher Altstadt sind nur wenige Schritte entfernt.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Built in 1889 and family-run ever since, the hotel features 138 air-conditioned rooms and suites, free Wi-Fi, three restaurants, and five meeting rooms. The rooms are timelessly elegant and inviting. Modern furnishings, warm colors, and comfortable beds guarantee a relaxing home-from-home experience.<p>The legendary Lobster and Oyster Bar at the Hotel St. Gotthard is a real Zurich institution: since 1935, guests have been treated to the most wonderful culinary delicacies amidst a French ambiance.</p><p>The hotel is just two minutes away from Zurich Main Station, and Zurich Airport can be reached in 15 minutes. Numerous shops, restaurants, and Zurich&rsquo;s Old Town are also in the immediate vicinity.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>PREMIUM HOTELPARTNER - Situ&eacute; au c&oelig;ur de Zurich, sur la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre rue commer&ccedil;ante \"Bahnhofstrasse\", l'H&ocirc;tel St. Gotthard offre un confort moderne &agrave; un excellent emplacement. Cet h&ocirc;tel 4 &eacute;toiles historique, familiale depuis 1889, impressionne avec 138 chambres climatis&eacute;es, 3 restaurants et bars et 5 salles de r&eacute;union. wifi gratuit est disponible dans tout l'h&ocirc;tel. Vous pourrez profiter d'un excellent emplacement dans le centre-ville &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres de la gare principale de Zurich. Commerces, restaurants, sites et la vieille ville sont &agrave; seulement quelques pas.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>PREMIUM HOTELPARTNER - Situato nel cuore di Zurigo, sulla famosa via dello shopping \"Bahnhofstrasse\", il St. Gotthard vanta comfort moderni in una posizione eccellente. Questo storico hotel a 4 stelle, dal 1889 a conduzione familiare, impressiona con 138 camere con aria condizionata, 3 ristoranti e bar e 5 sale riunioni. Free WiFi &egrave; disponibile in tutto l'hotel. Gli ospiti godono di una posizione eccellente nel centro della citt&agrave;, a soli 100 metri dalla stazione centrale di Zurigo. Negozi, ristoranti, attrazioni e il centro storico sono a pochi passi.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Herzen von Zürich, direkt an der berühmten Bahnhofstrasse, bietet das traditionsreiche Hotel St. Gotthard modernen Komfort an erstklassiger Lage."@de,
        "Situated in the heart of Zurich, directly on the world-famous Bahnhofstrasse, the traditional Hotel St. Gotthard offers modern-day comfort in a prime location."@en,
        "Au cœur de Zurich, sur la célèbre rue commerciale Bahnhofstrasse, le traditionnel hôtel St. Gotthard offre un confort moderne."@fr,
        "Nel cuore di Zurigo, nella famosa Bahnhofstrasse, il tradizionale Hotel St. Gotthard propone comfort moderno in posizione ideale."@it ;
