    schema:dateModified "2026-07-01T17:31:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Welche Aussicht! - Hoch &uuml;ber der Stadt, direkt am Waldrand in stilvoller Atmosph&auml;re mit wundersch&ouml;nem Blick auf die Stadt, den See und die Berge. Die G&auml;ste werden sogleich in Ferienstimmung versetzt. Elegant &amp; Einzigartig - Die interessante Verbindung eines historischen Geb&auml;udes mit einem einzigartig modernen Neubau macht das Hotel zu einem architektonischen Juwel. Design und Atmosph&auml;re werden auf dem Z&uuml;richberg gross geschrieben. 66 stillvoll eingerichtet Zimmer mit B&amp;O TV/Radio oder 42'Plasma TV. Direktwahltelefon, Wireless LAN, Minibar und Nespresso Kaffeemachine. Restaurant R21 mit Garten. Bar 21 mit Terrasse, . 5 Bankett/Meeting R&auml;ume bis zu 100 Personen.Internet-Station in Hotel Lobby. Mountain bikes. Tiefgarage. N&auml;he Tramhaltestelle.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The Hotel Z&uuml;richberg &ndash; A Sorell Experience rises high above the rooftops of the city, offering beautiful views of the lake and the Alps. The magnificent building features a mix of architecture from the 19th century and the present day, and welcomes its guests with a relaxed, stylish ambiance.<p>The character-steeped hotel has 66 guest rooms, which have been designed to ensure maximum comfort and first-class service. The bar and the Z&uuml;richberg restaurant, with its &ldquo;cuisine cr&eacute;ative du march&eacute;&rdquo;, are perfect places to relax and socialize. Larger events are held in the elegant banqueting rooms and on the spacious panorama terraces.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>The four-star Sorell Hotel Z&uuml;richberg is located high above Zurich's daily hustle and bustle, surrounded by forests and meadows. The stunning views of the city, lake and mountains will put you in a holiday mood. Whether you are here for business, cultural events or shopping, you can reach the city centre, the main railway station or Zurich's world-famous Bahnhofstrasse in just a few minutes by tram (line No. 6). With its stylish architecture and a location unmatched by any other hotel in Zurich, the Hotel Z&uuml;richberg represents a new spirit of hospitality. This modern structure blends perfectly with the natural surroundings and your stay here will be an unforgettable experience. The hotel has a restaurant and a bar and five attractive meeting rooms.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>The four-star Sorell Hotel Z&uuml;richberg is located high above Zurich's daily hustle and bustle, surrounded by forests and meadows. The stunning views of the city, lake and mountains will put you in a holiday mood. Whether you are here for business, cultural events or shopping, you can reach the city centre, the main railway station or Zurich's world-famous Bahnhofstrasse in just a few minutes by tram (line No. 6). With its stylish architecture and a location unmatched by any other hotel in Zurich, the Hotel Z&uuml;richberg represents a new spirit of hospitality. This modern structure blends perfectly with the natural surroundings and your stay here will be an unforgettable experience. The hotel has a restaurant and a bar and five attractive meeting rooms.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Hotel liegt im idyllischen Quartier Fluntern, mitten in der Natur und dennoch nur 10 Minuten vom lebendigen Stadtzentrum entfernt."@de,
        "The Hotel is located in the idyllic Fluntern quarter, surrounded by nature yet just 10 minutes from the bustling city center."@en,
        "L’hôtel est situé dans l’idyllique quartier de Fluntern, en pleine nature mais à seulement 10 minutes du centre-ville animé."@fr,
        "L'Hotel si trova nell’incantevole quartiere di Fluntern, immerso nella natura, eppure a soli 10 minuti dal vivace centro."@it ;
