    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Zürich" ;
            schema:postalCode "8005" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Zahnradstrasse 24" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-02-10T17:52:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Die Maag Halle befindet sich direkt bei der Hardbr&uuml;cke mitten im belebten Kultur- und Nightlife-Viertel Z&uuml;rich-West. Im Programm wechseln sich Shows, Partys, Konzerte und viele andere Veranstaltungen ab. K&uuml;nstler wie Billy Idol, Kid Rock oder Lady Gaga standen hier bereits auf der B&uuml;hne und musikalische Shows und Tanz-Performances machen auf ihren Tourneen in der Maag Halle Station.<p>Beim hauseigenen Musik-Festival f&uuml;r elektronische Musik &ndash; &laquo;Digital MAAG&raquo; &ndash; legen internationale Electro-K&uuml;nstler auf und locken j&auml;hrlich rund 3&lsquo;000 tanzfreudige Besucher an.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The Maag Halle is located directly behind Hardbr&uuml;cke Train Station, in the bustling cultural and nightlife quarter of Zurich-West. The program alternates between shows, parties, concerts and many other types of events.&nbsp; In the past, famous names such as Billy Idol, Kid Rock or Lady Gaga have performed on the stage, and musicals and dance shows stop off here on their tours.<p>The Maag's own Music Festival for electronic music, Digital MAAG, stars internationally renowned electro-artists and attracts around 3,000 dance enthusiasts every year.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La Maag Halle se trouve tout pr&egrave;s de Hardbr&uuml;cke, dans le c&oelig;ur anim&eacute; du quartier culturel et nocturne de Z&uuml;rich-West. Au programme : spectacles, f&ecirc;tes, concerts et de nombreuses autres manifestations. Des artistes comme Billy Idol, Kid Rock ou Lady Gaga sont d&eacute;j&agrave; mont&eacute;s sur la sc&egrave;ne de la Maag Halle. C&rsquo;est &eacute;galement une station populaire pour les tourn&eacute;es musicales et de danse.<p>Lors du festival de musique &eacute;lectronique &laquo; Digital MAAG &raquo; organis&eacute; annuellement par le centre, des DJ internationaux mixent de la musique &eacute;lectro pour plus de 3 000 visiteurs aimant danser.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>La Maag Halle si trova in corrispondenza del ponte Hardbr&uuml;cke, nel cuore del vivace quartiere di Z&uuml;rich-West, dedicato a cultura e vita notturna. In programma ci sono spettacoli, feste, concerti e tanti altri eventi. Artisti come Billy Idol, Kid Rock o Lady Gaga si sono gi&agrave; esibiti sul palco di questa location. Anche spettacoli di musica e danza fanno tappa qui durante le loro tourn&eacute;e.<p>Il \"Digital MAAG\", il festival musicale organizzato dal locale e incentrato sulla musica elettronica, vede protagonisti artisti internazionali che attirano ogni anno circa 3.000 visitatori che hanno voglia di ballare.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Konzerte, Shows, Partys und Events: Die Maag Halle bietet Raum für vielfältige Unterhaltung."@de,
        "Concerts, shows, parties and events: the Maag Halle offers space for a variety of entertainment."@en,
        "La Maag Halle offre un espace de divertissement pour concerts, spectacles, fêtes et manifestations."@fr,
        "Concerti, spettacoli, feste ed eventi: la Maag Halle offre spazio all'intrattenimento più variegato."@it ;
    schema:email "info@bymaag.ch" ;
