    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Die einen wollen einfach geniessen, den Blick schweifen lassen &uuml;ber das wundervolle Panorama, tief Atem holen in der Bergluft. Kein Problem, dank Bergbahnen, Restaurants und Grillpl&auml;tzen.<p>Andere aber suchen Bewegungsm&ouml;glichkeiten. Die gibt es zuhauf. Beispielsweise locken zahlreiche Wanderrouten, von leicht bis anspruchsvoll. Auch Mountainbiken, Klettern oder sogar Paragliding sind m&ouml;glich.</p><p>Auch spezielle Aktivit&auml;ten sind m&ouml;glich, etwa Wandern mit dem Wildh&uuml;ter oder Biologen. Immer dabei nat&uuml;rlich: die unfassbar sch&ouml;ne Natur dieser Region.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Some people want to simply indulge in the moment, to let their gaze wander over the spectacular panorama and breathe in the refreshing mountain air. That is not a problem here, thanks to the mountain railways and cableways, restaurants and BBQ sites.<p>Others, meanwhile, are looking for ways to be active. And there are certainly plenty of those, too. Such as numerous hiking routes ranging from easy to difficult. Mountain biking, climbing or even paragliding are also possible.</p><p>Special activities are also on offer, such as hiking with the gamekeeper or with biology experts. And always accompanying you along the way is, of course, the unbelievably beautiful scenery of this region.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Pour ceux qui veulent juste appr&eacute;cier le panorama et respirer profond&eacute;ment l&rsquo;air de la montagne, pas de probl&egrave;me&nbsp;: remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques, restaurants et coins barbecue sont &agrave; leur disposition.<p>Ceux qui veulent se d&eacute;penser ne seront pas d&eacute;&ccedil;us avec les nombreux chemins de randonn&eacute;e qui vont de faciles &agrave; ardus. Possibilit&eacute; &eacute;galement de randonn&eacute;es VTT, escalade ou m&ecirc;me parapente. Des activit&eacute;s sp&eacute;cifiques sont propos&eacute;es en option, comme par ex. une excursion avec le garde-chasse ou le biologiste. Toujours au sein de cette incroyable et si belle nature.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Alcuni preferiscono rilassarsi, ammirare l&rsquo;incantevole panorama, respirare a fondo l&rsquo;aria di montagna. E possono farlo grazie a ferrovie di montagna, ristoranti e aree per grigliate.<p>Altri, invece, hanno voglia di muoversi. E qui trovano tantissime opportunit&agrave; per farlo. Come i sentieri escursionistici, da facili a impegnativi. Anche chi va in mountain bike, pratica arrampicata o paragliding trova varie proposte. Da non perdere anche attivit&agrave; speciali come le escursioni con i guardacaccia o i biologi. A fare da cornice a tutto ci&ograve; &egrave; sempre lei: la spettacolare natura di questa regione.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In der Region Mythen bleibt beinahe kein Wunsch unerfüllt."@de,
        "In the Mythen region, virtually no wish is left unfulfilled."@en,
        "La région du Mythen réalise tous vos souhaits."@fr,
        "Nella regione dei Mythen non c’è nulla che non si possa fare."@it ;
    schema:email "info@mythenregion.ch" ;
