    schema:dateModified "2026-02-11T11:40:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Es knirscht unter den F&uuml;ssen, rundherum glitzert alles, und die k&uuml;hle Bergluft tut gut. Eine Winterwanderung oder eine Schneeschuhtour in diesem Gebiet ist aus vielerlei Hinsicht empfehlenswert, besonders aber wegen des wundervollen Panoramas. Naturliebhaber:innen schwelgen hier im Gl&uuml;ck, aber auch Fans von sportlichen Aktivit&auml;ten kommen nicht zu kurz.<p>Skifahren, Snowboarden, Schlitteln, Airboarden, Wandern, Langlaufen, Skitouren, Schneeschuhlaufen und einiges mehr ist m&ouml;glich. Und weil Bewegung an der frischen Luft bekanntlich besonders hungrig macht, gibt es auch besonders leckere Speisen im Gipfelrestaurant.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><th><strong>Anreisezeit vom Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich</strong></th><td>102&nbsp;Minuten mit dem Zug<br>54&nbsp;Minuten mit dem Auto</td></tr><tr><th><strong>Gr&ouml;sse</strong></th><td>35 Pisten-Km<br>Pistenplan</td></tr><tr><th><strong>Anlagen</strong></th><td>8 Lifte<br>9 Pisten<br>1 Kinderland mit Zauberteppich<br>1 Fun Park<br>1 Rodel-Piste<br>1 Airboard-Piste<br>3 Langlauf-Loipen</td></tr><tr><th><strong>Besonderheiten</strong></th><td>Skifahren, Snowboarden, Schlitteln, Airboarden, Wandern, Langlaufen, Skitouren, Schneeschuhlaufen und einiges mehr ist m&ouml;glich.</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@de,
        "<p>The snow crunches under your feet, the surrounding landscape is glittering, and the mountain air makes you feel invigorated. A winter hike or a snowshoe trail in this region is recommended for many reasons, but in particular because of the spectacular panorama. Nature lovers are in seventh heaven here &ndash; but sports enthusiasts are well catered for, too.<p>Downhill and cross-country skiing, snowboarding, tobogganing, airboarding, ski touring, snowshoeing and hiking &ndash; all of this and more is possible here. And because being active outside in the fresh air is known to make you particularly hungry, the summit restaurant serves extremely tasty dishes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Travel time from Zurich Main Train Station</strong></td><td>102 minutes by public transportation<br>54&nbsp;minutes by car</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Size</strong></td><td>35km (22 miles) of pistes<br>Area Map</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installations</strong></td><td>8 mountain transport facilities<br>9 ski pistes<br>1 kids park<br>1 fun park<br>1 toboggan run<br>1 airboard run<br>3 cross-country ski trails</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special features</strong></td><td>Downhill and cross-country skiing, snowboarding, tobogganing, airboarding, ski touring, snowshoeing and hiking &ndash; all of this and more is possible here.</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le sol craque sous les pas, tout scintille autour et l&rsquo;air frais de la montagne revigore. Nous vous conseillons une excursion hivernale dans cette belle r&eacute;gion pour tout un tas de raisons et notamment pour le magnifique panorama. Ici les amoureux de la nature trouveront leur bonheur, mais les fans de sports ne seront pas pour autant oubli&eacute;s.<p>Vous pourrez pratiquer ski, snowboard, luge, airboard, excursions &agrave; pied, ski de fond, randonn&eacute;es &agrave; ski, raquette &agrave; neige et bien plus encore. De plus, le restaurant en altitude propose des plats d&eacute;licieux &agrave; tous ceux que l&rsquo;air frais aura mis en app&eacute;tit.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Temps de voyage depuis la gare centrale de Zurich</strong></td><td>102 minutes en transports en commun<br>54&nbsp;minutes en voiture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimension</strong></td><td>35 km de pistes<br>Plan des pistes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installations</strong></td><td>8 remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques<br>9 pistes de ski<br>1 funpark pour familles<br>1 funpark<br>1 piste de luge<br>1 piste d&rsquo;airboard<br>3 pistes de ski de fond</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Particularit&eacute;</strong></td><td>Ski, snowboard, luge, airboard, excursions &agrave; pied, ski de fond, randonn&eacute;es &agrave; ski, raquette &agrave; neige et bien plus encore</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>La neve scricchiola sotto i piedi, intorno tutto luccica e la fresca aria di montagna fa bene a mente e corpo. Un&rsquo;escursione invernale in questa regione &egrave; ideale per tante ragioni, prima fra tutte i suoi meravigliosi panorami. Gli amanti della natura sono al settimo cielo qui, proprio come gli appassionati di attivit&agrave; sportive.<p>Il comprensorio propone sci, snowboard, slittino, airboard, trekking, sci di fondo, tour sciistici, racchetta da neve e molto altro ancora. E, dato che muoversi al freddo mette un grande appetito, niente di meglio che rifocillarsi al ristorante in vetta con i suoi deliziosi piatti.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Tempo di tragitto dalla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo</strong></td><td>102 minuti con i transporti pubblici<br>54&nbsp;minuti di macchina</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensione</strong></td><td>35 km di piste<br>Mappa delle piste</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Impianti</strong></td><td>8 skilift<br>9 piste da sci<br>1 fun park per famiglie<br>1 fun park<br>1 pista per slittini<br>1 pista per airboard<br>3 piste per lo sci di fondo</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Particolarit&agrave;</strong></td><td>Sci, snowboard, slittino, airboard, trekking, sci di fondo, tour sciistici, racchetta da neve e molto altro ancora.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Eine Region in der Innerschweiz, wo sich Naturgenuss und Bewegungsdrang ideal vereinen lassen."@de,
        "A region in Central Switzerland where the enjoyment of nature and the urge to be active can be ideally combined."@en,
        "Une région de la Suisse centrale où l’on peut idéalement réunir les joies de la nature et le besoin de se dépenser."@fr,
        "Una regione della Svizzera interna dove natura e movimento si fondono in un tutt’uno armonioso."@it ;
    schema:email "info@stoos.ch" ;
