    schema:description "<p>In Z&uuml;rich-West leben zwei Br&uuml;der den amerikanischen Traum &ndash; zumindest, was das Essen angeht. In ihrem urbanen und gem&uuml;tlichen Restaurant Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar dreht sich alles ums Fleisch, genauer gesagt um das Brust-St&uuml;ck vom Rind, eben dem Brisket. Dieses wird &uuml;ber Stunden im Smoker geschmort, bis das Fleisch zart vom Knochen f&auml;llt.<p>Ausserdem gibt es hier das beliebte Pulled Pork und den etwas in Vergessenheit geratenen Schweinebauch (Pork Belly) sowie den allseits beliebten Klassiker Chicken Wings. Aber auch f&uuml;r Vegetarier ist gesorgt mit leckerem Gem&uuml;se aus dem Smoker.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>In the Z&uuml;rich-West quarter, two Swiss brothers are living the American dream &ndash; at least in terms of food. At their cozy, urban restaurant, the Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, everything revolves around meat &ndash; or to be more precise, the cut of beef from the breast or lower chest of the cow known as the brisket. This is braised for hours in a smoker until the meat is so tender that it falls off the bone.<p>In addition, the menu features the much -loved pulled pork, the nowadays somewhat neglected pork belly, and the universally popular classic, chicken wings. Vegetarians are also well catered for with tasty vegetables from the smoker.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Deux fr&egrave;res vivent leur r&ecirc;ve am&eacute;ricain &agrave; Z&uuml;rich-West &ndash; au moins concernant l&rsquo;alimentation. Dans leur sympathique restaurant urbain Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, tout tourne autour de la viande ou plut&ocirc;t de la poitrine de b&oelig;uf &ndash; le brisket. On la laisse plusieurs heures au fumoir jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; ce qu&rsquo;elle devienne tendre et se d&eacute;tache facilement de l&rsquo;os.<p>On y propose d&rsquo;ailleurs aussi le tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute; porc brais&eacute; et la poitrine de porc (pork belly) tomb&eacute;e dans l&rsquo;oubli ainsi que ces classiques de tous temps tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;s que sont les ailes de poulet. Les v&eacute;g&eacute;tariens en auront aussi pour leur argent avec de d&eacute;licieux l&eacute;gumes fum&eacute;s.&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Due fratelli stanno vivendo il sogno americano a Z&uuml;rich-West, quanto meno in merito al cibo: nel loro accogliente ristorante urbano, il Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, tutto ruota attorno alla carne o, pi&ugrave; precisamente, alla punta del petto di manzo, il &ldquo;brisket&rdquo;, per l&rsquo;appunto. Questo viene stufato per ore nell&rsquo;affumicatore sino a quando la carne, tenerissima, si stacca dall&rsquo;osso.<p>Inoltre, qui si trovano l&rsquo;amato Pulled Pork e il quasi dimenticato Pork Belly, nonch&eacute; le sempre apprezzatissime Chicken Wings, ma anche verdure cotte nell&rsquo;affumicatore per i vegetariani.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In Zürichs Westen wird Fleisch auf texanische Art im Smoker zubereitet."@de,
        "In the west of Zurich, meat is served Texan-style, cooked in a smoker."@en,
        "À Zürich-West on prépare la viande au fumoir façon texane."@fr,
        "A Zürich-West, la carne si prepara alla texana nell’affumicatore."@it ;
    schema:email "info@brisket.ch" ;
