    schema:priceRange "<p>Bahnfahrt Engelberg – TITLIS (retour): CHF 102<br>Bahnfahrt Engelberg – TITLIS (retour) inkl. Horizon Deck: CHF 121</p><p>Skitageskarte: dynamische Preise, gemäss Webseite<br>Eintritt Aussichtsplattform Horizon Deck: CHF 19<br>Ice Flyer: CHF 12<br>&nbsp;</p>"@de,
        "<p>Rail trip Engelberg – TITLIS (round-trip): CHF 102<br>Rail trip Engelberg – TITLIS (round-trip) incl. Horizon Deck: CHF 121</p><p>Daily ski pass: dynamic pricing, as listed on the website<br>Admission to the Horizon Deck observation deck: CHF 19<br>Ice Flyer: CHF 12</p>"@en,
        "<p>Trajet en train Engelberg – TITLIS (aller-retour) : 102 CHF<br>Trajet en train Engelberg – TITLIS (aller-retour) avec Horizon Deck : 121 CHF</p><p>Forfait de ski journalier : tarifs dynamiques, selon le site web<br>Entrée à la plate-forme panoramique Horizon Deck : 19 CHF<br>Ice Flyer : 12 CHF</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Biglietto di andata e ritorno Engelberg – TITLIS: CHF 102<br>Biglietto di andata e ritorno Engelberg – TITLIS con Horizon Deck incluso: CHF 121</p><p>Skipass giornaliero: prezzi variabili, come indicato sul sito web<br>Ingresso alla piattaforma panoramica Horizon Deck: CHF 19<br>Ice Flyer: CHF 12</p>"@it ;
