    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Das &laquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&raquo; ist ein kleines, stilvolles Restaurant mit einer schicken Bar. Mittags und abends verw&ouml;hnt die K&uuml;che ihre G&auml;ste mit feinen Speisen zu fairen Preisen. Ob Fleischliebhaber, Vegetarier oder Gesundheitsbewusste, im &laquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&raquo; gibt es f&uuml;r jeden Geschmack das passende Gericht.<p>Wer lieber nachmittags einen Kaffee oder Tee geniessen oder abends bei einem ausgedehnten Ap&eacute;ro den Tag ausklingen lassen m&ouml;chte, der macht es sich an der Bar gem&uuml;tlich. Aber auch f&uuml;r private und gesch&auml;ftliche Anl&auml;sse ist das &laquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&raquo; eine sehr gute Wahl.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The &ldquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&rdquo; is a small, stylish restaurant with a chic bar. At lunchtime and in the evening, the kitchen staff spoil guests with delicious food at fair prices. Whether meat lovers, vegetarians, or the health-conscious, the &ldquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&rdquo; has something for every taste.<p>Those who prefer to enjoy a cup of coffee or tea in the afternoon or bring the day to a close with a relaxing drink should make themselves comfortable in the bar. However, the &ldquo;Sign eat &amp; drink&rdquo; is also a great choice for private and business events.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le Sign eat &amp; drink est un &eacute;l&eacute;gant petit restaurant avec un bar tr&egrave;s chic. Midi et soir la cuisine choie ses h&ocirc;tes avec de d&eacute;licieux plats &agrave; prix raisonnables. Les amateurs/trices de viande, les v&eacute;g&eacute;tarien(ne)s ou ceux/celles soucieux/ses de leur sant&eacute;, trouveront leur bonheur au &laquo;&nbsp;Sign eat &amp; drink&nbsp;&raquo;.<p>Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez boire un caf&eacute; ou un th&eacute; l&rsquo;apr&egrave;s-midi ou terminer votre journ&eacute;e avec un ap&eacute;ritif prolong&eacute;, vous pouvez vous installer confortablement au bar. Le &laquo;&nbsp;Sign eat &amp; drink&nbsp;&raquo; est &eacute;galement une tr&egrave;s bonne adresse pour les &eacute;v&egrave;nements priv&eacute;s ou professionnels.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il Sign eat &amp; drink &egrave; un piccolo, elegante ristorante con un raffinato bar. A pranzo e cena, la cucina vizia i suoi ospiti con piatti squisiti a prezzi onesti. Che siate amanti della carne, vegetariani e persone attente alla salute, al Sign eat &amp; drink ce n&rsquo;&egrave; per tutti i gusti.<p>Chi preferisce un caff&egrave; o un t&egrave; pomeridiano oppure chiudere la giornata con un lungo aperitivo pu&ograve; accomodarsi al bar. Il locale &egrave; un&rsquo;ottima scelta anche per eventi aziendali e privati.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Zentrum von Wallisellen und nur 5 Gehminuten vom Bahnhof befindet sich das kleine, stilvolle «Sign eat & drink»."@de,
        "The small, stylish restaurant, “Sign eat & drink”, is located in the centre of Wallisellen, just a 5-minute walk from the train station."@en,
        "Le petit mais très stylé « Sign eat & drink » est situé au centre de Wallisellen et à seulement 5 minutes de la gare."@fr,
        "Nel centro di Wallisellen, a soli 5 minuti a piedi dalla stazione, si trova il piccolo, raffinato Sign eat & drink."@it ;
    schema:email "info@sign.ch" ;
