    schema:priceRange "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>Eintritt</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Erwachsene</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Jugendliche (ab 12 Jahren)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (6 – 11)</th><td>CHF 8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Der Museumspass ist gültig</p>"@de,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>Entrance</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adults</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Young people (from 12 years)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Children (6 – 11)</th><td>CHF 8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The museum pass is valid&nbsp;</p>"@en,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>Entrée</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adultes</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Jeunes (à.p.d. 12 ans)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (6 – 11)</th><td>CHF 8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Possibilité d'utiliser le Passeport musées</p>"@fr,
