    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Das &laquo;Clouds&raquo; im 35. Stock des <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2013\" data-entity-uuid=\"b1942a50-4478-4cea-88fc-4fb19f2f6a56\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Prime Towers</a> hat nicht nur in Sachen Aussicht ein erstklassiges Angebot. Auch die Getr&auml;nke-Auswahl ist von h&ouml;chster Qualit&auml;t.<p>Auf der Karte finden sich viele besondere Cocktails, wovon einige mit dem hauseigenen und preisgekr&ouml;nten Gin zubereitet werden. An Gin-Tastings kommen Liebhaber:innen in den Genuss diverser Gin-Spezialit&auml;ten.</p><p>Im edlem und geschmackvollem Ambiente erfreut sich eine bunt gemischte Klientel an der Weitsicht ins Limmattal und &uuml;ber das urbane Z&uuml;rich-West. Besonders zur Zeit des Sonnenuntergangs ist die Bar darum nat&uuml;rlich besonders beliebt.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>&ldquo;Clouds&rdquo; on the 35th floor of the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2013\" data-entity-uuid=\"b1942a50-4478-4cea-88fc-4fb19f2f6a56\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Prime Tower</a> does not just offers a first-class view. The selection of drinks is also of the highest quality.<p>The menu features many special cocktails, some of which are made with the hotel&rsquo;s own award-winning gin. In addition, connoisseurs can enjoy different gin specialties at the various gin tasting events.</p><p>In an elegant and tasteful ambiance, a colorful mix of clientele enjoys the views of the Limmat Valley and the urban Z&uuml;rich-West quarter. It goes without saying that the bar is particularly popular at sunset.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Depuis le Clouds au 35e &eacute;tage de la <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2013\" data-entity-uuid=\"b1942a50-4478-4cea-88fc-4fb19f2f6a56\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Prime Tower</a>, vous b&eacute;n&eacute;fierez non seulement d&rsquo;un superbe panorama mais aussi de boissons d&rsquo;excellente qualit&eacute;.<p>La carte comprend de nombreux cocktails originaux dont certains pr&eacute;par&eacute;s avec un gin maison prim&eacute;. Les d&eacute;gustations r&eacute;jouiront les amateurs avec plusieurs sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s de gin.</p><p>Dans l&rsquo;ambiance &eacute;l&eacute;gante et chic de ce bar, un public cosmopolite peut appr&eacute;cier la vue panoramique sur la vall&eacute;e de la Limmat et le Z&uuml;rich-West urbain, surtout &agrave; l&rsquo;heure du coucher de soleil.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il Clouds, al 35&deg; piano della <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/2013\" data-entity-uuid=\"b1942a50-4478-4cea-88fc-4fb19f2f6a56\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Prime Tower</a>, non offre soltanto una vista strepitosa. Anche la selezione di bevande, infatti, &egrave; di altissima qualit&agrave;.<p>Sulla carta ci sono tanti cocktail particolari, alcuni dei quali vengono preparati con il premiato gin della casa. Grazie alle degustazioni, gli estimatori di questa bevanda possono assaggiare varie specialit&agrave; di gin.</p><p>In un&rsquo;atmosfera elegante e raffinata, la variopinta clientela si gode una splendida vista sulla Limmattal e sull&rsquo;urbano quartiere di Z&uuml;rich-West. Proprio per questa peculiarit&agrave;, il bar &egrave; particolarmente amato al tramonto.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Den Kopf in den Wolken, die Füsse mitten in Zürich-West – Zürichs höchste Bar lädt zu Cocktails vor der Partynacht"@de,
        "Your head in the clouds, your feet on the ground in the heart of Zürich-West – Zurich’s highest bar invites guests to enjoy a cocktail or two before a night on the town."@en,
        "Déguster des cocktails la tête dans les nuages et les pieds à Zürich-West avant une nuit de fête dans le plus haut bar de Zurich."@fr,
        "La testa tra le nuvole, i piedi ben piantati nel cuore di Zürich-West: il bar più alto di Zurigo invita a sorseggiare un cocktail prima di fare festa."@it ;
    schema:email "info@clouds.ch" ;
    schema:geo _:Ncd8312eb06cb43d2a24c7e535af40e55 ;
