    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p><strong>Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck</strong><br>Montag bis Freitag, 06.30 &ndash; 10.00 Uhr<br>Samstag und Sonntag, 06.30 &ndash; 11.30 Uhr<p><strong>Mittag</strong><br>Montag bis Freitag, 11.30 &ndash; 14.00 Uhr<br>Samstag und Sonntag, 12.00 &ndash; 14.00 Uhr</p><p><strong>Abend</strong><br>Montag bis Sonntag, 17.30 &ndash; 22.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p><strong>Breakfast</strong><br>Monday to Friday, 6.30am &ndash; 10.00am<br>Saturday and Sunday, 6.30am &ndash; 11.30am<p><strong>Lunch</strong><br>Monday to Friday, 11.30am &ndash; 2.00pm<br>Saturday and Sunday, 12.00pm - 2.00pm&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dinner</strong><br>Monday to Sunday, 5.30pm &ndash; 10.00pm</p></p>"@en,
        "<p><strong>Petit-d&eacute;jeuner</strong><br>Du lundi au vendredi, 6h30 &ndash; 10h<br>Samedi et dimanche, 6h30 &ndash; 11h30<p><strong>D&eacute;jeuner</strong><br>Du lundi au vendredi, 11h30 &ndash; 14h<br>Samedi et dimanche, 12h &ndash; 14h</p><p><strong>D&icirc;ner</strong><br>Du lundi au dimanche, 17h30 &ndash; 22h</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p><strong>Colazione</strong><br>Luned&igrave; a venerd&igrave;, 6.30 &ndash; 10.00<br>Sabato e domenica, 6.30 &ndash; 11.30<p><strong>Pranzo</strong><br>Luned&igrave; a venerd&igrave;, 11.30 &ndash; 14.00<br>Sabato e domenica, 12.00 &ndash; 14.00</p><p><strong>Cena</strong><br>Luned&igrave; a domenica, 17.30 &ndash; 22.00</p></p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Nur die besten Stücke kommen hier auf den Tisch – im Hotel Sheraton, mitten in «Züri West»."@de,
        "Only prime cuts of meat are served up here – in the Sheraton Hotel in the heart of Zürich- West."@en,
