    schema:priceRange "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Preis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Erwachsene</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Studierende/Jugendliche (12-16)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (6-11)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card-Besitzer:innen</th><td>25% Ermässigung</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Tickets sind unter <a href=\"https://eventfrog.ch/de/events.html?searchTerm=Sternwarte+Urania\">eventfrog.ch</a> erhältlich</p>"@de,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adults</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Young People (12-16)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Children (6-11)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card holders</th><td>25% discount</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Tickets are available on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://eventfrog.ch/de/events.html?searchTerm=Sternwarte+Urania\">eventfrog.ch</a></p>"@en,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Prix</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adultes</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Jeunes&nbsp;(12-16)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (6-11)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Visiteurs en possession d’une Zürich Card</th><td>25% de réduction</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Les billets sont disponibles sur&nbsp;<a href=\"https://eventfrog.ch/de/events.html?searchTerm=Sternwarte+Urania\">eventfrog.ch</a></p>"@fr,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Prezzi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adulti</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Giovani&nbsp;(12-16)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Bambini (6-11)</th><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><th>Visitatori in possesso di una Zürich Card</th><td>25% di sconto</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>I biglietti sono disponibili su <a href=\"https://eventfrog.ch/de/events.html?searchTerm=Sternwarte+Urania\">eventfrog.ch</a></p>"@it ;
