    schema:priceRange "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Ausstellung inkl. Sammlung</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Regulär</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Ermässigt</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card-Besitzer:innen</th><td>gratis*</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>*Freier Eintritt in die Sammlung. Sonderausstellungen sind kostenpflichtig.<br>Donnerstags von 18.00 –&nbsp;20.00 Uhr ist Legi-Abend: Student:innen und Lehrer:innen zahlen nur CHF 10 Eintritt.</p>"@de,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Exhibition including collection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Regular</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Concessions</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card holders</th><td>free*</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>*Free admission to the collection. Special exhibitions are chargeable.<br>Thursdays from 6pm to 8pm is Legi evening: Students and teachers pay only CHF 10 admission.&nbsp;</p>"@en,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Exposition, y compris la collection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Normal</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Réduit</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Visiteurs en possession d’une Zürich Card</th><td>gratuit*</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>*Entrée gratuite dans la collection. Les expositions spéciales sont payantes.<br>Les jeudis de 18h à 20h est la soirée Legi: étudiant•e•s et professeur•e•s ne paient que 10 CHF.&nbsp;</p>"@fr,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Mostra incl. collezione</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Regolare</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Ridotto</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Visitatori in possesso di una Zürich Card</th><td>gratuito*</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>*Ingresso gratuito alla collezione. Le mostre speciali sono a pagamento.<br>Sempre di giovedì è la serata “legi”: studenti e insegnanti pagano solo CHF 10 d’entrata.&nbsp;</p>"@it ;
    schema:telephone "+41 44 253 84 84" ;
    schema:url <https://www.kunsthaus.ch> .

