    schema:description "<p>Wer richtig leckeres Eis nach italienischer Tradition sucht, wird am Brupbacherplatz im Z&uuml;rcher Quartier Wiedikon f&uuml;ndig.<p>Die erstklassigen und frischen Eiscremes werden in traditioneller italienischer Gelateria-Manier produziert, in einem schnuckeligen Ladenlokal pr&auml;sentiert und mit einem &uuml;beraus herzlichen L&auml;cheln serviert. Die aus lokalen Bio-Produkten gezauberten Gelati zaubern jedem Gast ein L&auml;cheln auf die Lippen und ein St&uuml;ck Italianit&agrave; in die Herzen.</p><p>Weitere Filialen:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3855523,8.5171641,17z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bd76ec52053:0x4aaaa2da59e85d3b!8m2!3d47.3855523!4d8.5193528\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Frau Gerolds Garten<br>Geroldstrasse 23b<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3749426,8.5171177,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a2269f0f7cb:0x3f02a646d93eb813!8m2!3d47.3749426!4d8.5171177!16s%2Fg%2F11dy7gjbfj?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Brupbacherplatz<br>Weststrasse 196<br>8003 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Zollstrasse+117,+8005+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3814839,8.5302388,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a119cc9173b:0x8cd6ca057e69332!8m2!3d47.3814839!4d8.5302388!16s%2Fg%2F11c13hs2z6?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Zollhaus<br>Zollstrasse 117<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/R%C3%B6schibachstrasse+79,+8037+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3934361,8.52628,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a69407a0f4b:0xefa98fb315434946!8m2!3d47.3934361!4d8.5288549!16s%2Fg%2F11c5ng6kfz?entry=ttu\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>R&ouml;schibachplatz<br>R&ouml;schibachstrasse 79<br>8037 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Micas+Garten/@47.3935686,8.4756957,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bddfc133baf:0x1c7e673139386983!8m2!3d47.3935686!4d8.4756957!16s%2Fg%2F11q360y1sk?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>MICAS Garten<br>Badenerstrasse 790<br>8048 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Winzerhalde+12,+8049+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3998515,8.4932008,1105m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bb1d7968e7f:0x4d722461e001396!8m2!3d47.3998515!4d8.4932008?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Ape Piaggio Werdinsel<br>Winzerhalde 12<br>8049 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Anyone looking for really delicious ice cream made according to Italian tradition should head for Brupbacherplatz, in Zurich&rsquo;s Wiedikon quarter.<p>Top-quality, fresh ice cream is made the traditional Italian way, presented in a cute ice cream parlor, and always served with a huge smile. The gelati, which are created using local organic produce, put a smile on every customer&rsquo;s face and a little bit of Italy in their hearts.</p><p>Additional locations:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3855523,8.5171641,17z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bd76ec52053:0x4aaaa2da59e85d3b!8m2!3d47.3855523!4d8.5193528\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Frau Gerolds Garten<br>Geroldstrasse 23b<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3749426,8.5171177,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a2269f0f7cb:0x3f02a646d93eb813!8m2!3d47.3749426!4d8.5171177!16s%2Fg%2F11dy7gjbfj?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Brupbacherplatz<br>Weststrasse 196<br>8003 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Zollstrasse+117,+8005+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3814839,8.5302388,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a119cc9173b:0x8cd6ca057e69332!8m2!3d47.3814839!4d8.5302388!16s%2Fg%2F11c13hs2z6?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Zollhaus<br>Zollstrasse 117<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/R%C3%B6schibachstrasse+79,+8037+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3934361,8.52628,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a69407a0f4b:0xefa98fb315434946!8m2!3d47.3934361!4d8.5288549!16s%2Fg%2F11c5ng6kfz?entry=ttu\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>R&ouml;schibachplatz<br>R&ouml;schibachstrasse 79<br>8037 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Micas+Garten/@47.3935686,8.4756957,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bddfc133baf:0x1c7e673139386983!8m2!3d47.3935686!4d8.4756957!16s%2Fg%2F11q360y1sk?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>MICAS Garten<br>Badenerstrasse 790<br>8048 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Winzerhalde+12,+8049+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3998515,8.4932008,1105m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bb1d7968e7f:0x4d722461e001396!8m2!3d47.3998515!4d8.4932008?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Ape Piaggio Werdinsel<br>Winzerhalde 12<br>8049 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Les amateurs de d&eacute;licieuses glaces italiennes trouveront leur bonheur sur la place Brupbacher dans le quartier zurichois Wiedikon.<p>Ces cr&egrave;mes glac&eacute;es fra&icirc;ches et de premi&egrave;re qualit&eacute; sont fabriqu&eacute;es selon la tradition italienne, pr&eacute;sent&eacute;es dans un lieu charmant et servies avec am&eacute;nit&eacute;. Ces glaces cr&eacute;&eacute;es avec des produits bios locaux font na&icirc;tre un sourire sur les l&egrave;vres de tous les clients et leur met un peu d&rsquo;italianit&eacute; dans le c&oelig;ur.</p><p>Autre magasins :</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3855523,8.5171641,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bd76ec52053:0x4aaaa2da59e85d3b!8m2!3d47.3855523!4d8.5193528\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Frau Gerolds Garten<br>Geroldstrasse 23b<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3749426,8.5171177,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a2269f0f7cb:0x3f02a646d93eb813!8m2!3d47.3749426!4d8.5171177!16s%2Fg%2F11dy7gjbfj?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Brupbacherplatz<br>Weststrasse 196<br>8003 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Zollstrasse+117,+8005+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3814839,8.5302388,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a119cc9173b:0x8cd6ca057e69332!8m2!3d47.3814839!4d8.5302388!16s%2Fg%2F11c13hs2z6?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Zollhaus<br>Zollstrasse 117<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/R%C3%B6schibachstrasse+79,+8037+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3934361,8.52628,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a69407a0f4b:0xefa98fb315434946!8m2!3d47.3934361!4d8.5288549!16s%2Fg%2F11c5ng6kfz?entry=ttu\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>R&ouml;schibachplatz<br>R&ouml;schibachstrasse 79<br>8037 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Micas+Garten/@47.3935686,8.4756957,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bddfc133baf:0x1c7e673139386983!8m2!3d47.3935686!4d8.4756957!16s%2Fg%2F11q360y1sk?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>MICAS Garten<br>Badenerstrasse 790<br>8048 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Winzerhalde+12,+8049+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3998515,8.4932008,1105m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bb1d7968e7f:0x4d722461e001396!8m2!3d47.3998515!4d8.4932008?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Ape Piaggio Werdinsel<br>Winzerhalde 12<br>8049 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Chi cerca un delizioso gelato preparato secondo la tradizione italiana lo trova sulla Brupbacherplatz, nel quartiere zurighese di Wiedikon.<p>I gusti freschi e buonissimi vengono prodotti secondo la tradizione italiana, presentati in un grazioso locale e serviti con un sorriso davvero cordiale. Ottenuti con ingredienti bio del posto, i gelati portano il buonumore sui volti dei clienti e un pizzico di italianit&agrave; nei loro cuori.</p><p>Altre filiale:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3855523,8.5171641,17z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bd76ec52053:0x4aaaa2da59e85d3b!8m2!3d47.3855523!4d8.5193528\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Frau Gerolds Garten<br>Geroldstrasse 23b<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gelateria+di+Berna/@47.3749426,8.5171177,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a2269f0f7cb:0x3f02a646d93eb813!8m2!3d47.3749426!4d8.5171177!16s%2Fg%2F11dy7gjbfj?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Brupbacherplatz<br>Weststrasse 196<br>8003 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Zollstrasse+117,+8005+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3814839,8.5302388,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a119cc9173b:0x8cd6ca057e69332!8m2!3d47.3814839!4d8.5302388!16s%2Fg%2F11c13hs2z6?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Zollhaus<br>Zollstrasse 117<br>8005 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/R%C3%B6schibachstrasse+79,+8037+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3934361,8.52628,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900a69407a0f4b:0xefa98fb315434946!8m2!3d47.3934361!4d8.5288549!16s%2Fg%2F11c5ng6kfz?entry=ttu\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>R&ouml;schibachplatz<br>R&ouml;schibachstrasse 79<br>8037 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Micas+Garten/@47.3935686,8.4756957,15z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47900bddfc133baf:0x1c7e673139386983!8m2!3d47.3935686!4d8.4756957!16s%2Fg%2F11q360y1sk?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>MICAS Garten<br>Badenerstrasse 790<br>8048 Z&uuml;rich</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Winzerhalde+12,+8049+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.3998515,8.4932008,1105m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47900bb1d7968e7f:0x4d722461e001396!8m2!3d47.3998515!4d8.4932008?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\">Gelateria di Berna</a><br>Ape Piaggio Werdinsel<br>Winzerhalde 12<br>8049 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Sündig leckeres Eis nach bester italienischer Manier gibt es an erfreulich vielen Standorten in Zürich."@de,
        "Sinfully delicious ice cream made the traditional Italian way can be found at a pleasing number of locations throughout Zurich."@en,
        "Des glaces italiennes tellement délicieuses que c’en est un péché sont à déguster dans de nombreux endroits à Zurich."@fr,
        "A Zurigo si trovano molte sedi dove gustare gelati incredibilmente buoni, preparati secondo la ricetta italiana."@it ;
