    rdfs:label "Camping Euthal am Sihlsee"@de,
        "Euthal Campsite on Lake Sihl"@en,
        "Camping Euthal du lac de Sihl"@fr,
        "Campeggio Euthal in riva al Sihlsee"@it ;
    dct:subject <https://example.org/nami/data/category/86> ;
    geo:hasGeometry _:N615c3328d56b48ae90a8e711b813fc1c ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Der idyllische Camping- und Zeltplatz am grössten Stausee der Schweiz."@de,
        "The idyllic campsite is situated on the largest reservoir in Switzerland."@en,
        "Un camping idyllique au bord du plus grand lac de barrage de Suisse."@fr,
        "Un idilliaco campeggio in riva al lago artificiale più grande della Svizzera."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Camping Euthal am Sihlsee"@de,
        "Euthal Campsite on Lake Sihl"@en,
        "Camping Euthal du lac de Sihl"@fr,
        "Campeggio Euthal in riva al Sihlsee"@it ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Euthal SZ" ;
            schema:postalCode "8844" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Euthalerstrasse 10" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-05-06T15:52:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Der ruhige und idyllische Campingplatz Euthal liegt mit Grillplatz und Feuerstelle direkt am Ufer des <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/156598\" data-entity-uuid=\"88b60836-d9f9-43ba-849e-2ff9ef207792\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Sihlsees</a>, ganz in der N&auml;he vom ber&uuml;hmten <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1001223\" data-entity-uuid=\"5519bf9f-33d7-4aff-a137-e3df0de9668b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Klosterdorf Einsiedeln</a>.<p>Die Campinganlage l&auml;sst keine W&uuml;nsche offen: Direkt vom Camping aus k&ouml;nnen Besucher:innen ins Wasser springen, aufs Surfbrett steigen oder die voralpine Landschaft zu Fuss oder mit dem Mountainbike erkunden.&nbsp;</p><p>Der wundersch&ouml;ne Sihlsee befindet sich im Hochtal von Einsiedeln, er wird von der Sihl durchflossen und ist der gr&ouml;sste Stausee der Schweiz.</p><p><strong>Hinweis:</strong> Aktuell werden nur Saison- und Dauerstellpl&auml;tze vergeben.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The tranquil and idyllic Euthal campsite features a barbecue site and fire pit, and lies directly on the shore of <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/156598\" data-entity-uuid=\"88b60836-d9f9-43ba-849e-2ff9ef207792\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Lake Sihl</a>, very close to the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1001223\" data-entity-uuid=\"5519bf9f-33d7-4aff-a137-e3df0de9668b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">village of Einsiedeln</a> with its famous abbey.<p>There is something for everyone here: straight from the campsite, guests can plunge into the water, climb onto a surfboard, or explore the pre-Alpine landscape on foot or by mountain bike. Fishing enthusiasts can even obtain a fishing license directly in Euthal.</p><p>The beautiful Lake Sihl, through which the River Sihl flows, lies in the high valley of Einsiedeln and is the largest reservoir in Switzerland.</p><h3>Daily Camping</h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Adults</td><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><td>Children</td><td>CHF 6</td></tr><tr><td>Small tent</td><td>CHF 12</td></tr><tr><td>Medium tent</td><td>CHF 16</td></tr><tr><td>Large tent</td><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><td>Electricity per kWh (metered)</td><td>CHF 2</td></tr><tr><td>Visitor's tax per person</td><td>CHF 2.60 / 1.30</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le calme et idyllique camping Euthal avec ses espaces barbecue et feu de camp est directement situ&eacute; sur la rive du <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/156598\" data-entity-uuid=\"88b60836-d9f9-43ba-849e-2ff9ef207792\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">lac de Sihl</a>, tout pr&egrave;s du <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1001223\" data-entity-uuid=\"5519bf9f-33d7-4aff-a137-e3df0de9668b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">village d&rsquo;Einsiedeln</a> r&eacute;put&eacute; pour son abbaye.<p>Les &eacute;quipements du camping comblent tous les v&oelig;ux&nbsp;des visiteurs qui peuvent plonger, faire du surf ou d&eacute;couvrir le paysage pr&eacute;alpin &agrave; pied ou &agrave; VTT directement depuis le camping. Les p&ecirc;cheurs du dimanche comme les pros peuvent m&ecirc;me acqu&eacute;rir un permis de p&ecirc;che directement au camping Euthal.</p><p>Le superbe lac de Sihl, situ&eacute; dans la haute vall&eacute;e d&rsquo;Einsiedeln, est aliment&eacute; par la rivi&egrave;re Sihl et constitue le plus grand lac de barrage de Suisse.</p><h3>Camping de passage</h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Adultes</td><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><td>Enfants</td><td>CHF 6</td></tr><tr><td>Petite tente</td><td>CHF 12</td></tr><tr><td>Tente moyenne</td><td>CHF 16</td></tr><tr><td>Grande tente</td><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><td>Electricit&eacute; par kWh selon compteur</td><td>CHF 2</td></tr><tr><td>Taxe de s&eacute;jour par jour et par personne</td><td>CHF 2.60 / 1.30</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il tranquillo, idilliaco campeggio Euthal vanta un&rsquo;area per grigliate ed &egrave; adagiato in riva al <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/156598\" data-entity-uuid=\"88b60836-d9f9-43ba-849e-2ff9ef207792\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Sihlsee</a>, vicino alla famosissima <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1001223\" data-entity-uuid=\"5519bf9f-33d7-4aff-a137-e3df0de9668b\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">abbazia di Einsiedeln</a>.<p>La struttura soddisfa ogni esigenza: dal campeggio &egrave; possibile tuffarsi in acqua, salire sulla tavola da surf o esplorare il paesaggio prealpino a piedi o in mountain-bike. Pescatori amatoriali e sportivi possono richiedere persino la licenza direttamente a Euthal.</p><p>Il meraviglioso Sihlsee si trova nell&rsquo;alta valle di Einsiedeln, viene attraversato dal fiume Sihl ed &egrave; il pi&ugrave; grande lago artificiale della Svizzera.</p><h3>Prezzi giornalieri</h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Adulti</td><td>CHF 10</td></tr><tr><td>Bambini</td><td>CHF 6</td></tr><tr><td>Tenda piccola</td><td>CHF 12</td></tr><tr><td>Tenda media</td><td>CHF 16</td></tr><tr><td>Tenda grande</td><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><td>Corrente per kWh in bas al contatore</td><td>CHF 2</td></tr><tr><td>Tassa di soggiorno&nbsp;a persona e al giorno</td><td>CHF 2.60 / 1.30</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Dieser idyllische Campingplatz liegt direkt am Sihlsee, ganz in der Nähe von Einsiedeln."@de,
        "This idyllic campsite lies directly on the shore of Lake Sihl, very close to Einsiedeln."@en,
        "Ce camping idyllique se trouve juste au bord du lac de Sihl, tout près d’Einsiedeln."@fr,
        "Questo idilliaco campeggio si trova sulle sponde del lago Sihlsee, vicinissimo ad Einsiedeln."@it ;
