        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>In Z&uuml;rich gibt es drei Arthouse Kinos, die zwischen Bellevue und Central &uuml;ber die Innenstadt verteilt sind und sich so bequem erreichen lassen. Jedes der Kinos ist an einem zentralen Ort im Quartier gelegen und bietet deshalb die Gelegenheit, sich im Kinosessel eine Weile vom kommerziellen Treiben der Stadt zu erholen.<p>Das aktuelle Kinoprogramm ist auf der Arthouse-Website einsehbar. Die Kinos dienen j&auml;hrlich als Austragungsort zahlreicher Filmpremieren, Filmreihen und Festivals, darunter auch das renommierte Zurich Film Festival.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Weitere Standorte:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/le-paris\">Arthouse Le Paris</a>, Gottfried-Keller-Strasse 7, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/movie\">Arthouse Movie 1+2</a>, N&auml;gelihof 4, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/piccadilly\">Arthouse Piccadilly 1+2</a>, M&uuml;hlebachstrasse 2, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@de,
        "<p>Dotted between Bellevue and Central, Zurich has three Arthouse cinemas in the inner city that are easily reached. Each of the cinemas is in a central location, offering the chance to sit back and relax far away from the commercial activities of the city.<p>The current movie program can be viewed on the Arthouse website. The movie theaters host numerous movie premieres, series and festivals every year, including the renowned Zurich Film Festival.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Further locations:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/le-paris\">Arthouse Le Paris</a>, Gottfried-Keller-Strasse 7, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/movie\">Arthouse Movie 1+2</a>, N&auml;gelihof 4, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/piccadilly\">Arthouse Piccadilly 1+2</a>, M&uuml;hlebachstrasse 2, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le centre-ville de Zurich compte trois cin&eacute;mas arthouse, r&eacute;partis dans la ville entre Bellevue et Central. Situ&eacute;s au centre de diff&eacute;rents quartiers, ils sont tr&egrave;s accessibles et permettent ainsi de se reposer facilement dans un fauteuil commode, loin de l'agitation de la ville.<p>Le programme actuel des cin&eacute;mas peut &ecirc;tre consult&eacute; sur le site web arthouse. Les cin&eacute;mas accueillent chaque ann&eacute;e de nombreuses premi&egrave;res et s&eacute;ries cin&eacute;matographiques ainsi que des festivals, dont le c&eacute;l&egrave;bre Zurich Film Festival.</p><p><br><strong>Autres sites:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/le-paris\">Arthouse Le Paris</a>, Gottfried-Keller-Strasse 7, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/movie\">Arthouse Movie 1+2</a>, N&auml;gelihof 4, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/piccadilly\">Arthouse Piccadilly 1+2</a>, M&uuml;hlebachstrasse 2, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@fr,
        "<p>A Zurigo esistono tre cinema Arthouse, sparsi per tutto il centro tra Bellevue e Central e quindi facilmente raggiungibili. Ciascuno dei cinema &egrave; situato in un punto nevralgico del rispettivo quartiere e offre la possibilit&agrave; di riprendersi dal viavai commerciale comodamente seduti nelle sue poltrone.<p>La programmazione attuale pu&ograve; essere consultata sul sito Arthouse. Ogni anno, i cinema ospitano numerose anteprime cinematografiche, serie e festival, tra cui il famoso Zurich Film Festival.</p><p><br><strong>Altre sedi</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/le-paris\">Arthouse Le Paris</a>, Gottfried-Keller-Strasse 7, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/movie\">Arthouse Movie 1+2</a>, N&auml;gelihof 4, 8001 Z&uuml;rich</li><li><a href=\"https://arthouse.ch/locations/piccadilly\">Arthouse Piccadilly 1+2</a>, M&uuml;hlebachstrasse 2, 8008 Z&uuml;rich</li></ul></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Die Arthouse Kinos Zürich zeigen Independent Film-Hits aus aller Welt. Aktuelle Filmfestival-Highlights kommen hier in der Originalversion auf die Leinwand."@de,
        "Arthouse Cinemas Zurich show independent films from all over the world. Original versions of current film festival highlights hit the screen here."@en,
        "Les cinémas arthouse Zurich proposent des films actuels du cinéma indépendant du monde entier. Ces films à succès, souvent primés aux festivals, sont projetés en version originale."@fr,
        "Arthouse Cinemas Zurich show independent hit films from all over the world. Original versions of current film festival highlights hit the screen here."@it ;
