    schema:priceRange "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>Eintritt</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Erwachsene</th><td>CHF 34</td></tr><tr><th>Lernende, Studierende, AHV/IV</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (6 – 15)</th><td>CHF 21</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (0 – 5)</th><td>gratis</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppen (ab 10 Erwachsene)</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Für Schulklassen gelten Spezialkonditionen, die auf der <a href=\"https://www.technorama.ch/de/besuchen/preise\">Technorama Webseite</a> eingesehen werden können.</p></div>"@de,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>Entrance</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adults</th><td>CHF 34</td></tr><tr><th>Students, Trainees, AHV/ IV</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Children (6 – 15)</th><td>CHF 21</td></tr><tr><th>Children (0 – 5)</th><td>free</td></tr><tr><th>Groups (of 10 or more persons)</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Special conditions apply to school classes, which can be viewed on the <a href=\"https://www.technorama.ch/en/visit/opening-hours-and-prices\">Technorama website</a>.</p>"@en,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>Entrée</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adultes</th><td>CHF 34</td></tr><tr><th>Apprentis, étudiants, AVS/AI</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (6 – 15)</th><td>CHF 21</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (0 – 5)</th><td>gratuit</td></tr><tr><th>Grupes à partir de 10 adultes</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Des conditions spéciales s'appliquent aux classes scolaires. Elles peuvent être consultées sur le <a href=\"https://www.technorama.ch/fr/visiter/heures-douverture-et-tarifs\">site web du Technorama</a>.</p></div>"@fr,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"table\"><thead><tr><th>Ingresso</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adulti</th><td>CHF 34</td></tr><tr><th>Allievi, studenti, AVS/AI</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr><tr><th>Bambini (6 – 15)</th><td>CHF 21</td></tr><tr><th>Bambini (0 – 5)</th><td>gratuito</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppi a partire da 10 persone</th><td>CHF 31</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Per le scolaresche valgono condizioni speciali, consultabili sul <a href=\"https://www.technorama.ch/it/visitare/orari-di-apertura-e-prezzi\">sito web di Technorama</a>.</p></div>"@it ;
