    schema:dateModified "2026-02-10T17:52:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Dieses Theaterhaus hat sich in eine schweizweit einmalige Plattform f&uuml;r Kleinkunst entwickelt, die Comedy, Satire, Kabarett, Poetry-Slam, Improtheater und Musik ins Zentrum stellt. Neben&nbsp;etablierten K&uuml;nstler:innen entdeckt und f&ouml;rdert das Theater auch noch unbekanntere Acts. &nbsp;<p>Neben dem Theatersaal beherbergt das Casinotheater diverse Event-R&auml;umlichkeiten sowie das Restaurant Fredi inklusive Bar. Durch das vielf&auml;ltige Konzept eignet sich das Kulturhaus ideal f&uuml;r Anl&auml;sse aller Art.</p><p>Das Casinotheater Winterthur blickt auf eine &uuml;ber 150-j&auml;hrige Geschichte zur&uuml;ck und ist eine wichtige kulturelle Institution in der Stadt Winterthur n&ouml;rdlich von Z&uuml;rich.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>This theater has evolved into a platform for cabaret and variety shows that is one of a kind in Switzerland, focusing on comedy, satire, cabaret, poetry slam, improv theater, and music. Besides well-established artists, the theater also discovers and promotes lesser -known acts.<p>In addition to the auditorium, the Casinotheater houses various event rooms, as well as the Fredi restaurant and bar. Thanks to its diverse concept, this cultural establishment is the ideal venue for events of all kinds.</p><p>The Casinotheater Winterthur looks back on an over 150 year-old history and is an important cultural institution in the city of Winterthur, north of Zurich.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Cette maison de th&eacute;&acirc;tre est devenue une plate-forme unique en Suisse pour les&nbsp;arts de la sc&egrave;ne, mettant l&rsquo;accent sur la com&eacute;die, la satire, le cabaret, le slam po&eacute;sie, le th&eacute;&acirc;tre d&rsquo;improvisation et la musique. Outre les artistes &eacute;tablis, le th&eacute;&acirc;tre d&eacute;couvre et encourage &eacute;galement des artistes encore moins connus.<p>Outre la salle de th&eacute;&acirc;tre, le Casinotheater abrite divers espaces &eacute;v&eacute;nementiels ainsi que le restaurant Fredi et son bar. Gr&acirc;ce &agrave; son concept vari&eacute;, le centre culturel est id&eacute;al pour des &eacute;v&eacute;nements de toutes sortes.</p><p>Riche de plus de 150 ans d&rsquo;histoire, le Casinotheater Winterthur est une institution culturelle importante de la ville de Winterthour situ&eacute; au nord de Zurich.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Questo teatro &egrave; diventato una piattaforma per cabaret unica in tutta la Svizzera. Una piattaforma dove comicit&agrave;, satira, cabaret, poetry-slam, improvvisazione e musica sono i protagonisti indiscussi. Oltre a ospitare artisti affermati, scopre e promuove anche spettacoli ancora sconosciuti.&nbsp;<p>In aggiunta al teatro, il Casinotheater conta diverse sale per eventi e il ristorante Fredi con il suo bar. Il concept versatile rende questo istituto culturale ideale per eventi di ogni genere.</p><p>Il Casinotheater Winterthur ha alle spalle oltre 150 anni di storia ed &egrave; una realt&agrave; culturale importante dell&rsquo;omonima cittadina a nord di Zurigo.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Casinotheater in Winterthur ist die Plattform für Comedy, Satire, Kabarett, Poetry-Slam, Impro-Theater und Musik."@de,
        "The Casinotheater in Winterthur is a platform for comedy, satire, cabaret, poetry slam, improv theater, and music."@en,
        "Le Casinotheater Winterthur est une plateforme pour la comédie, la satire, le cabaret, le slam poésie, le théâtre d’improvisation et la musique."@fr,
        "Il Casinotheater Winterthur è la piattaforma per comicità, satira, cabaret, poetry-slam, improvvisazione teatrale e musica."@it ;
