    schema:priceRange "<table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><strong>4 Stunden&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Tageskarten&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Erwachsene (ab 16 Jahren)</strong></td><td>CHF 46.00</td><td>CHF 51.00</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kinder (6-15)</strong></td><td>CHF 37.00</td><td>CHF 40.50</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kleinkinder (3-5)</strong></td><td>CHF 16.00</td><td>CHF 16.00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>CHF 6 ist der Aufpreis für Wellness / Fitnessbereich.</p><p>Details unter&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.alpamare.ch\">www.alpamare.ch</a></p>"@de,
        "<table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><strong>4-hour-stay:&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Weekend/Holidays</strong></td><td><strong>Day ticket:&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adults (from 16 years old)</strong></td><td>CHF 46.00</td><td>CHF 47.50</td><td>CHF 56.00</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Children (6-15)</strong></td><td>CHF 37.00</td><td>CHF 38.50</td><td>CHF 45.50</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Infants (3-5)</strong></td><td>CHF 16.00</td><td>CHF 16.00</td><td>CHF 16.00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>CHF 6 is the extra charge for wellness / fitness area.</p><p>For details, refer to&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.alpamare.ch\">www.alpamare.ch</a></p>"@en,
