    namiont:textTeaser "In der Bahnhofstrasse findet man alles, was das Shopping-Herz begehrt: Mode, Kunst und Zürcher Spezialitäten"@de,
        "Zurich's shopping avenue: Bahnhofstrasse offers a mix of haute couture, Swiss watches, jewellery, and stylish boutiques."@en,
        "Articles de mode, art et spécialités zurichoises - rien ne manque à la Bahnhofstrasse"@fr,
        "Nella Bahnhofstrasse si trova tutto ciò che si possa desiderare: moda, arte e specialità zurighesi"@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Bahnhofstrasse Zürich"@de,
        "Bahnhofstrasse"@en,
        "Bahnhofstrasse"@fr,
        "Bahnhofstrasse"@it ;
    namiont:zurichCard false ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
