        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Nach den beiden Restaurants &laquo;The Bite&raquo; und &laquo;Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar&raquo; haben die Liebhaber der amerikanischen K&uuml;che ein weiteres Lokal er&ouml;ffnet: Im &laquo;Yard Bird&raquo; gibt es die besten Southern Fried Chicken diesseits des Ozeans. F&uuml;r diese s&uuml;ndige Leckerei beziehen die Macher das Fleisch aus der Schweiz, tauchen es in Buttermilch, panieren es mit leckeren Hauskreationen, bevor es doppelt frittiert und dann genossen wird. Dazu gibt es frische Salate, knackige Pommes Frites oder Guacamole.&nbsp;<p>Alle Gerichte sind von original S&uuml;dstaatenrezepten inspiriert und werden dann modern interpretiert.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>After the two restaurants, The Bite and Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, the avid fans of American cuisine have opened another restaurant. The Yard Bird serves the best Southern Fried Chicken this side of the pond. For this sinfully tasty delicacy, the meat is sourced in Switzerland, dipped in a buttermilk batter, and tossed in an aromatic homemade spice mix, before it is double-fried and then served. The chicken is accompanied by a fresh salad, crispy French fries, or guacamole.<p>All the dishes are inspired by original Southern State recipes and interpreted with a modern twist.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Aux deux restaurants The Bite et Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, les amateurs de cuisine am&eacute;ricaine en ont ajout&eacute; un autre &ndash; le Yardbird qui propose les meilleurs poulets frits &agrave; la mode du sud de ce c&ocirc;t&eacute; de l&rsquo;oc&eacute;an. Une viande suisse est &agrave; l&rsquo;origine de ce coupable d&eacute;lice plong&eacute; dans du babeurre, pan&eacute; avec de d&eacute;licieuses pr&eacute;parations et frit deux fois avant de s&rsquo;en r&eacute;galer. En accompagnement sont propos&eacute;s salades fra&icirc;ches, frites croustillantes ou guacamole.<p>Tous les plats sont inspir&eacute;s de recettes originales des &Eacute;tats du sud et revisit&eacute;s.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Dopo i due ristoranti The Bite e Brisket Southern BBQ &amp; Bar, gli appassionati di cucina americana hanno aperto un nuovo locale: allo Yardbird si serve il miglior Southern Fried Chicken da questa parte dell&rsquo;oceano. Per la peccaminosa prelibatezza, i titolari comprano la carne in Svizzera, per poi marinarla nel latticello, impanarla con deliziose creazioni della casa, friggerla due volte e, infine, gustarla. Come contorno, si pu&ograve; scegliere tra insalate fresche, croccanti patatine fritte o guacamole.&nbsp;<p>Tutti i piatti sono ispirati a ricette originali degli stati del sud, reinterpretate in chiave moderna.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Traditionsgericht aus den amerikanischen Südstaaten gibt es nun auch in Wiedikon."@de,
        "The traditional dish from the Southern States of the USA can now be found in the Wiedikon quarter."@en,
        "Le plat traditionnel des Américains du sud des États-Unis est aussi servi à Wiedikon."@fr,
        "Il tradizionale piatto degli stati americani del sud si può gustare anche a Wiedikon."@it ;
    schema:email "info@yardbird.ch" ;
    schema:geo _:Nb488f7c57b4143eab4e7b10128f66117 ;
