    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Wer gerne zeichnet, bastelt, werkelt und kreativ ist, der findet im &laquo;Fabrikat&raquo; im Z&uuml;rcher Langstrassen-Quartier den Himmel auf Erden. Das aufwendig gestaltete Interieur soll aussehen, als sei es aus einem Jules Verne Roman gesp&uuml;lt worden. Passend dazu findet man Artikel, die im Design so daherkommen, als h&auml;tten sie bereits unsere Grosseltern benutzt.<p>Unter &laquo;Working Goods&raquo; versteht das Team hinter &laquo;Fabrikat&raquo; hochwertige Stifte, Pinsel, Farben, Papiere und Werkzeuge, die m&ouml;glichst lange halten und die die zeitgen&ouml;ssischen St&auml;dter weg vom Handy und ran an das Bastelpult locken.</p><p>Ein weiterer Standort befindet sich an der <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Oberdorfstrasse+34,+8001+Z%C3%BCrich/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x479aa0abb3fb48fd:0xd82e557c2108a668?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjhzuaVhZzmAhWhURUIHZWiAH8Q8gEwAHoECAsQAQ\">Oberdorfstrasse 34</a>.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Anyone who likes drawing, doing craftwork or simply using their hands to make things will be in heaven at Fabrikat, located in Zurich&rsquo;s Langstrasse quarter. The elaborately designed interior looks as if it has been taken straight from a Jules Verne novel. In keeping with the surroundings, visitors will find articles that resemble tools from yesteryear.<p>The Fabrikat team understand &ldquo;working goods&rdquo; to mean top-quality pens, paintbrushes, paints, paper and utensils that last for as long as possible and lure modern-day city dwellers away from their cell phones and back to the workbench.</p><p>Another store is located in <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Oberdorfstrasse+34,+8001+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.369525,8.5424815,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x479aa0abb3fb48fd:0xd82e557c2108a668!8m2!3d47.369525!4d8.5446702\">Oberdorfstrasse 34</a>.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Si vous aimez dessiner, bricoler, bidouiller et si vous &ecirc;tes cr&eacute;atif, vous trouverez le paradis sur terre au &laquo;&nbsp;Fabrikat&nbsp;&raquo;, dans le quartier zurichois de Langstrasse. Le luxueux int&eacute;rieur doit donner l&rsquo;impression qu&rsquo;il sort d&rsquo;un roman de Jules Verne. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement trouver des produits dont le design est semblable &agrave; celui que nos grands-parents utilisaient.<p>Pour l&rsquo;&eacute;quipe du &laquo;&nbsp;Fabrikat&nbsp;&raquo;, les &laquo;&nbsp;Working Goods&nbsp;&raquo;&nbsp;sont des crayons, pinceaux, peintures, papiers et instruments durables de haute qualit&eacute; qui font oublier aux citadins leurs t&eacute;l&eacute;phones portables et les incitent &agrave; bricoler.</p><p>Un autre magasin est situ&eacute; &agrave; l'<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Oberdorfstrasse+34,+8001+Z%C3%BCrich/@47.369525,8.5424815,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x479aa0abb3fb48fd:0xd82e557c2108a668!8m2!3d47.369525!4d8.5446702\">Oberstrasse 34</a>.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Chi ama disegnare, fare bricolage ed essere creativo trova pane per i suoi denti al Fabriquat, nel quartiere zurighese della Langstrasse. Oltremodo elaborati, gli interni sembrano appena usciti da un romanzo di Jules Verne. Niente di meglio, quindi, di articoli che potrebbero essere appartenuti ai nostri nonni.<p>Con l'espressione \"Working Goods\", il team del Fabrikat intende matite, pennelli, colori, carta e utensili di alta qualit&agrave; e duraturi, che allontanino i cittadini di oggi dal cellulare per avvicinarli alla creativit&agrave;.</p><p>Un'altra filiale si trova al seguente indirizzo:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Oberdorfstrasse+34,+8001+Z%C3%BCrich/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x479aa0abb3fb48fd:0xd82e557c2108a668?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjhzuaVhZzmAhWhURUIHZWiAH8Q8gEwAHoECAsQAQ\">Oberdorfstrasse 34</a>.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Fabrikat finden Bastler, Künstler und Handwerker die perfekten Utensilien zum Kreativsein."@de,
        "At Fabrikat, handicraft enthusiasts, artist and craftspeople will find the perfect utensils to express their creativity."@en,
        "Au Fabrikat bricoleurs, artistes et artisans trouvent des ustensiles parfaits pour leur créativité."@fr,
        "Al Fabrikat, amanti del fai da te, artisti e artigiani trovano gli utensili perfetti per la loro creatività."@it ;
