        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Hoch &uuml;ber der Rosenstadt Rapperswil, schon von weitem sichtbar, thront das imposante mittelalterliche Schloss mit ihren H&ouml;fen und G&auml;rten. Es ist ein besonderer Ort, an dem man die hektische Welt ausserhalb der dicken Schlossmauern schnell vergisst und in welchem auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau diniert werden kann. &nbsp;<p>In den Sommermonaten l&auml;dt der gedeckte Schlosshof dazu ein, laue Sommern&auml;chte in einzigartiger Atmosph&auml;re zu verbringen. Die acht verschiedenen R&auml;umlichkeiten eignen sich hervorragend f&uuml;r Gesch&auml;ftsanl&auml;sse, Hochzeiten, Teamevents und Ap&eacute;ros aller Art. Mit Professionalit&auml;t und Leidenschaft k&uuml;mmert sich der Exklusiv-Caterer, die Schloss Rapperswil Gastro GmbH, um alle W&uuml;nsche rund um den Anlass.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name des Raumes</th><th>Theater</th><th>Seminar</th><th>Block / U-Form</th><th>Bankett</th><th>Cocktail</th><th>Fl&auml;che in m2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Lindenh&uuml;gel (Sch&ouml;nwetter)</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><th>Kr&auml;utergarten (Sch&ouml;nwetter)</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>40</td><td>60</td><td>273</td></tr><tr><th>Schlosshof (Mai-Sep gedeckt)</th><td>300</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>250</td><td>180</td><td>300</td><td>546</td></tr><tr><th>Burghalle</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>100</td><td>95</td></tr><tr><th>Grosser Rittersaal</th><td>200</td><td>120</td><td>200</td><td>180</td><td>200</td><td>251</td></tr><tr><th>Gaststube</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>45</td><td>30</td><td>50</td><td>67</td></tr><tr><th>Grafenstube</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>12</td><td>12</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><th>Kleiner Rittersaal</th><td>60</td><td>40</td><td>70</td><td>60</td><td>70</td><td>77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>High above the rose town of Rapperswil, visible from afar, stands the imposing medieval castle with its courtyards and gardens. It is a special place where you can quickly forget the hectic world outside the thick castle walls and enjoy dining at the highest level.<p>In the summer months, the covered castle courtyard invites you to spend balmy summer nights in a unique atmosphere. The eight different rooms are ideal for business events, weddings, team events and aperitifs of all kinds. The exclusive caterer, Schloss Rapperswil Gastro GmbH, takes care of all your event needs with professionalism and passion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name of the Room</th><th>Theatre</th><th>Seminar</th><th>Block /&nbsp;<br>U-Shape</th><th>Banquet</th><th>Cocktail</th><th>Area in m2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Lindenh&uuml;gel&nbsp;<br>(fair weather)</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><th>Kr&auml;utergarten&nbsp;<br>(fair weather)</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>40</td><td>60</td><td>273</td></tr><tr><th>Schlosshof&nbsp;<br>(covered from May to September)</th><td>300</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>250</td><td>180</td><td>300</td><td>546</td></tr><tr><th>Burghalle</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>100</td><td>95</td></tr><tr><th>Grosser Rittersaal</th><td>200</td><td>120</td><td>200</td><td>180</td><td>200</td><td>251</td></tr><tr><th>Gaststube</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>45</td><td>30</td><td>50</td><td>67</td></tr><tr><th>Grafenstube</th><td>&nbsp;</td><td>12</td><td>12</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><th>Kleiner Rittersaal</th><td>60</td><td>40</td><td>70</td><td>60</td><td>70</td><td>77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@en ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Schloss Rapperswil ist das Wahrzeichen der Stadt und eine einzigartige Location für exklusive Business-Events und festliche Anlässe. In den historischen Räumlichkeiten lässt es sich im grossen Rahmen mit bis zu 250 Gästen stilvoll feiern und tagen."@de,
        "Rapperswil Castle is the town's landmark and a unique location for exclusive business events and festive occasions. Its historic rooms provide a stylish setting for large-scale celebrations and meetings for up to 250 guests."@en ;
