        "<p>The seasonal opening hours of the railways and leisure facilities can be found on the <a href=\"https://www.sattel-hochstuckli.ch/en/live/live.html\">website</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@en,
        "<p>Les horaires d'ouverture saisonniers des remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques et des installations de loisirs sont disponibles sur le <a href=\"https://www.sattel-hochstuckli.ch/en/live/live.html\">site web</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Gli orari stagionali di apertura delle funivie e delle strutture ricreative sono disponibili sul <a href=\"https://www.sattel-hochstuckli.ch/en/live/live.html\">sito web</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Rasanten Rodelspass erleben Gäste im Berggebiet Sattel-Hochstuckli auf einer 3.5 km langen Piste."@de,
        "Guests can enjoy high-speed toboggan fun on a 3.5 km long run in the Sattel-Hochstuckli region."@en,
        "Longue de 3,5 km, la piste de luge de la région Sattel-Hochstuckli procure un plaisir à toute allure."@fr,
        "Divertimento in slittino garantito nel comprensorio di Sattel-Hochstuckli con una pista da 3,5 km."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Sattel-Hochstuckli"@de,
        "Sattel-Hochstuckli"@en,
        "Sattel-Hochstuckli"@fr,
        "Sattel-Hochstuckli"@it ;
