    schema:dateModified "2025-11-26T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>1995 gegr&uuml;ndet, z&auml;hlt EMA House heute zu Z&uuml;richs f&uuml;hrenden Anbietern f&uuml;r hochwertige Hotelsuiten und Serviced Apartments. Bei uns wohnen Sie an renommierten Adressen und an den Toplagen der Stadt. Alle unsere Liegenschaften, Suiten und Apartments wurden mit sorgf&auml;ltig ausgew&auml;hlten Materialien ausgestattet und strahlen vollendete Ausgewogenheit und Harmonie aus.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Anyone looking for a smart alternative to conventional hotels is at the right address here, whatever their reason for visiting the city: EMA House offers top-quality hotel suites and serviced apartments in some of Zurich&rsquo;s prime locations. The spacious suites are furnished with exclusive materials and choice fittings and come with a full, first-class hotel service. Guests planning a longer stay can opt for the tastefully furnished EMA House Serviced Apartments, where guests enjoy the privacy of home-away-from-home living with all the necessary amenities and customized services.</p>"@en,
        "<p>Si vous recherchez une alternative intelligente aux h&ocirc;tels conventionnels, vous &ecirc;tes au bon endroit. EMA House propose des suites d&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel et appartements haut de gamme dans des lieux privil&eacute;gi&eacute;s de Zurich. Peu importe la raison de votre s&eacute;jour. Les spacieuses suites sont &eacute;quip&eacute;es de mat&eacute;riaux exclusifs et de meubles soigneusement s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;s. Le remarquable service de l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel comblera tous vos d&eacute;sirs. En cas de s&eacute;jour prolong&eacute;s, on recommande les appartements EMA House meubl&eacute;s avec go&ucirc;t pour profiter d&rsquo;une sph&egrave;re priv&eacute;e comme chez soi, de toutes les commodit&eacute;s et de services sur mesure.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Chi cerca un&rsquo;alternativa intelligente ai classici hotel la trova qui: EMA House propone suite alberghiere e appartamenti serviti nei punti pi&ugrave; belli di Zurigo. Non importa quale sia il motivo del soggiorno: le spaziose suite sono arredate con materiali esclusivi e mobili selezionati e il servizio alberghiero di altissimo livello soddisfa qualsiasi esigenza. Ideali per soggiorni prolungati sono gli EMA House Serviced Apartments, arredati con gran gusto, dove gli ospiti trovano la privacy di una casa privata e la comodit&agrave; di servizi su misura.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "An Zürichs begehrtesten Wohnlagen befinden sich die erstklassigen Hotelsuiten und serviced Apartments des EMA House Hotel Suites."@de,
        "EMA House’s top-quality hotel suites and serviced apartments are located in Zurich’s most attractive residential areas."@en,
        "Les très prisées suites et appartements de l’EMA House Hotel Suites se situent dans des lieux privilégiés de Zurich."@fr,
        "Le straordinarie suite e gli appartamenti serviti di EMA House Hotel Suites si trovano in una delle zone residenziali più ambite di Zurigo."@it ;
