    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Mai &ndash; September:<br> Donnerstag bis Freitag, 11.00 &ndash; 21.00 Uhr<br> Samstag, 11.00 &ndash; 17.00 Uhr<p><br> Oktober &ndash; April:<br> Donnerstag bis Freitag, 11.00 &ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br> Samstag, 11.00 &ndash; 17.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>May &ndash; September:<br> Thursday &ndash; Friday, 11am&nbsp;&ndash; 9pm<br> Saturday, 11am &ndash; 5pm<p><br> October &ndash; April:<br> Thursday &ndash; Friday, 11&nbsp;&ndash; 7pm<br> Saturday, 11am &ndash; 5pm</p></p>"@en,
