        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Im &laquo;Tea&amp;Room Teekult&raquo; werden die 100 Teesorten stilgerecht und typisch f&uuml;r die jeweiligen Herkunftsl&auml;nder serviert und genossen. Dazu gibt es zum Tee passende hausgemachte K&ouml;stlichkeiten.<p>Im Laden stehen &uuml;ber 200 auserlesene Teesorten zur Auswahl. Exquisites Teezubeh&ouml;r und Teegeschirr, originelle Geschenkartikel und Teesets plus einige M&ouml;bel aus China runden das vielseitige Angebot ab.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The 100 tea varieties on offer at the Tea&amp;Room Teekult are served and enjoyed in style and in a manner that is typical for the respective countries of origin. There are also homemade delicacies to accompany the tea.<p>In the in-house store, visitors can choose from more than 200 specially selected tea blends. Also on sale are exquisite tea accessories and tableware, tea sets, and original gift ideas, as well as various items of furniture from China.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le &laquo;&nbsp;Tea&amp;Room Teekult&nbsp;&raquo; propose &agrave; la d&eacute;gustation 100 th&eacute;s diff&eacute;rents, servis dans le style et la tradition du pays d&rsquo;origine. Des douceurs maison accompagnent les th&eacute;s.<p>La boutique propose plus de 200 vari&eacute;t&eacute;s de th&eacute; s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;es. Accessoires raffin&eacute;es, services &agrave; th&eacute;, cadeaux originaux, kits &agrave; th&eacute; et quelques meubles de Chine compl&egrave;tent l&rsquo;offre.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Al Tea&amp;Room Teekult, le 100 variet&agrave; di t&egrave; vengono servite e gustate secondo lo stile e la tradizione dei paesi d&rsquo;origine. E la cerimonia viene accompagnata da prelibatezze fatte in casa.<p>Il negozio propone pi&ugrave; di 200 t&egrave; selezionati. Raffinati accessori, tazze e teiere, articoli regalo originali, set&nbsp; e alcuni mobili dalla Cina completano l&rsquo;offerta.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Teegenuss in all seinen Variationen wird im «Tea&Room Teekult» im Herzen von Winterthur grossgeschrieben."@de,
        "The Tea&Room Teekult in the heart of Winterthur sets great store by enabling its guests to enjoy tea in all its variations."@en,
        "Toutes les variétés de thé sont à l’honneur au « Tea&Room Teekult » au cœur de Winterthour"@fr,
        "Diffondere il piacere del tè in ogni sua variazione è l’obiettivo del Tea&Room Teekult, nel cuore di Winterthur."@it ;
