    namiont:placeType namiont:Outdoors ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Surfen mitten in Zürich! Dank der konstanten Welle im Herzen von Zürich-West ist das Realität."@de,
        "Surfing in the middle of Zurich? This is possible thanks to the endless wave facility in the heart of the Zürich-West quarter."@en,
        "Faire du surf au cœur de Zurich grâce à la vague constante de Zurich-Ouest !"@fr,
        "Fare surf in centro a Zurigo? Grazie alla wave pool nel cuore di Zürich-West, si può!"@it ;
