        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Wer Lust auf gesunde, frische vietnamesische K&uuml;che hat, der findet im &laquo;Saigon&raquo; sein Gl&uuml;ck. Frische Kr&auml;uter, kr&auml;ftige Suppen, scharfe Currys, knackige Salate, frische Sommerrollen und so viel mehr. Die Weisheit im &laquo;Saigon&raquo; lautet: Life&rsquo;s too short to eat a tasteless soup. Und sie haben recht. Der Familienbetrieb z&auml;hlt mittlerweile drei Restaurants in der Stadt Z&uuml;rich &ndash; das &laquo;Sai Gon&raquo;, &laquo;Petit Saigon&raquo; und &laquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/3488\" data-entity-uuid=\"8a70dad2-5197-449a-8d19-a9325b9f4c54\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Chez Nhan Deli</a>&raquo;.<p>Ob vegetarisch, Fleisch oder Fisch, zum Business-Lunch oder ausgedehnten Abendessen, im &laquo;Saigon&raquo; wird alles frisch zubereitet, jeden Tag aufs Neue und genauso wie es schon die Grossm&uuml;tter und Urgrossm&uuml;tter zuhause in Saigon gelernt haben.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Anyone who fancies fresh and healthy Vietnamese cuisine should head for the Saigon. Here they can find hearty soups, spicy curries, crispy salads, tasty summer rolls, fresh herbs, and much more besides.The saying at the Saigon is: &ldquo;Life is too short to eat a tasteless soup&rdquo;. And how right they are! The family business now has three restaurants in the city of Zurich &ndash; Saigon, Petit Saigon, and <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/3488\" data-entity-uuid=\"8a70dad2-5197-449a-8d19-a9325b9f4c54\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Chez Nhan Deli</a> .<p>Whether vegetarian, meat, or fish, for a business lunch or a leisurely evening meal, at the Saigon everything is freshly prepared every day and exactly as their grandmothers and great-grandmothers did in past times back home in Saigon.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Si vous avez envie d&rsquo;une cuisine vietnamienne saine et fra&icirc;che, vous trouverez votre bonheur au Saigon&nbsp;: herbes fines fra&icirc;ches, soupes savoureuses, caris &eacute;pic&eacute;s, salades croquantes, rouleaux de printemps frais et bien plus encore. Dans sa sagesse le Saigon estime&nbsp;que la vie est trop courte pour ing&eacute;rer une soupe sans go&ucirc;t. Et ils ont raison. L&rsquo;entreprise familiale compte aujourd&rsquo;hui trois restaurants &agrave; Zurich &ndash; le &laquo;&nbsp;Saigon&nbsp;&raquo;, le &laquo;&nbsp;Petit Saigon&nbsp;&raquo; et le &laquo;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/3488\" data-entity-uuid=\"8a70dad2-5197-449a-8d19-a9325b9f4c54\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Chez Nhan Deli</a>&nbsp;&raquo;.<p>Plat v&eacute;g&eacute;tarien, viande ou poisson, pour un d&eacute;jeuner d&rsquo;affaires ou un d&icirc;ner prolong&eacute;, au Saigon tous les plats sont frais tous les jours, exactement comme l&rsquo;avaient appris les grands-m&egrave;res et les arri&egrave;re-grands-m&egrave;res chez elles &agrave; Saigon.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Chi ha voglia di cucina vietnamita sana e fresca la trova al Saigon, con erbe aromatiche, zuppe saporite, curry piccanti, insalate, involtini estate e tanto altro ancora. Il saggio motto del Saigon &egrave;: &ldquo;Life&rsquo;s too short to eat a tasteless soup.&rdquo; Ed &egrave; vero! L&rsquo;azienda a conduzione familiare conta ormai tre ristoranti nella citt&agrave; di Zurigo: il Saigon, il Petit Saigon e lo <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/3488\" data-entity-uuid=\"8a70dad2-5197-449a-8d19-a9325b9f4c54\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Chez Nhan Deli</a>.<p>Che si tratti di pietanze vegetariane, carne o pesce, di un pranzo di lavoro o di una cena, al Saigon ogni creazione nasce da ingredienti freschi, giorno per giorno, proprio come facevano gi&agrave; le nonne e le bisnonne a casa a Saigon.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im «Saigon» unternehmen die Gäste mitten in Zürich eine kulinarische Reise durch Vietnam."@de,
        "At the Saigon, guests embark on a culinary journey through Vietnam in the heart of Zurich."@en,
        "Le Saigon vous embarque pour un voyage culinaire à travers le Vietnam en plein cœur de Zurich."@fr,
        "Gli ospiti del Saigon intraprendono un viaggio culinario in Vietnam nel cuore di Zurigo."@it ;
