        "A branch of Zurich’s tradition-steeped confectionery, Sprüngli, is located close to the Opera House."@en,
        "Une succursale de la traditionnelle Confiserie Sprüngli se trouve près de l’opéra de Zurich."@fr,
        "Una filiale della tradizionale Confiserie Sprüngli di Zurigo si trova vicino al Teatro dell’Opera."@it ;
