    namiont:textTeaser "Im historischen Riegelhaus unweit des Bahnhofs Rüschlikon begeistern kreativ-moderne Gerichte."@de,
        "Creatively modern dishes are served in this historic half-timbered house, near Rüschlikon Station."@en,
        "Cette maison à colombages près de la gare de Rüschlikon propose des plats créatifs et modernes."@fr,
        "In una casa a traliccio, vicino alla stazione di Rüschlikon, si servono piatti moderni e creativi."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Die Rose"@de,
        "Die Rose"@en,
