    schema:dateModified "2026-02-10T17:52:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<h3>Das Werk:<p>Ebenso wie das <a href=\"/de/node/227368\">Werk Towers</a> am Escher-Wyss-Platz ist auch die Figur Anne-Sophie im Rahmen des Kunstfestivals Art and the City entstanden. Vor dem 25hours Hotel Z&uuml;rich-West steht die &uuml;ber 5 Meter hohe Chromstahlplastik. Diese &uuml;berlebensgrosse Kopie einer ehemaligen Musikstudentin repr&auml;sentiert die Jugend ihrer Generation, steht aber auch f&uuml;r die Jugend des Quartiers Z&uuml;rich-West.</p><h3>Besonderes:</h3><p>W&auml;hrend dem Kunstfestival Art and the City stand urspr&uuml;nglich &laquo;Vanessa&raquo; auf dem Steinfelsplatz in Z&uuml;rich-West. Diese wurde zu einer Art Maskottchen f&uuml;r das Festival. Da dieses Kunstwerk nach dreimonatiger Leihgabe aber wieder zur&uuml;ck an den Besitzer ging, begann der K&uuml;nstler Alex Hanimann umgehend mit einer zweiten, permanenten, Figur.</p><h3>Standort:</h3><p>Vor dem 25hours Hotel in Z&uuml;rich-West verk&ouml;rpert &laquo;Anne-Sophie&raquo; die Jugend des Quartiers und ihrer Generation.</p><h3>Der Sch&ouml;pfer:</h3><p>Alex Hanimann (*1955) ist ein Schweizer K&uuml;nstler und Professor f&uuml;r Visuelle Kommunikation an der Z&uuml;rcher Hochschule der K&uuml;nste. Sein T&auml;tigkeitsbereich umfasst Zeichnungen, Malerei, Lettrismus, Druckgrafiken und Objektkunst.</p></h3>"@de,
        "<h3>The Work<p>Just like the artwork, <a href=\"/en/node/227368\">&ldquo;Towers&rdquo;</a>, at Escher-Wyss-Platz, the figure of &ldquo;Anne-Sophie&rdquo; was created within the framework of the art festival, &ldquo;Art and the City&rdquo;. The over 5-meter (16.4ft) tall chrome steel sculpture stands in front of the 25hours hotel Zurich-West. This larger-than-life figure was based on a real person who was a music student at the time and represents the youth of her generation and of the Z&uuml;rich-West quarter.</p><h3>Special Remarks</h3><p>During the &ldquo;Art and the City&rdquo; art festival, &ldquo;Vanessa&rdquo; originally stood on Steinfelsplatz in Z&uuml;rich-West. This figure became a kind of mascot for the festival. However, when this artwork was returned to its owner after the thee-month loan period, the artist, Alex Hanimann, immediately set about creating a second, permanent figure.</p><h3>Location</h3><p>&ldquo;Anne-Sophie&rdquo; stands in front of the 25hours hotel in Z&uuml;rich-West and embodies the youth of both her generation and the quarter.</p><h3>The Creator</h3><p>Alex Hanimann (born in 1955) is a Swiss artist and Professor of Visual Communication at Zurich University of the Arts. His field of activity focuses on drawings, paintings, Lettrism, graphic prints, and object art.</p></h3>"@en,
        "<h3>L&rsquo;&oelig;uvre&nbsp;:<p>Tout comme l&rsquo;&oelig;uvre<a href=\"/fr/node/227368\"> Towers</a> situ&eacute;e place Escher-Wyss, la sculpture Anne-Sophie est n&eacute;e dans le cadre du festival Art and the City. La sculpture en acier chrom&eacute; de plus de 5 m&egrave;tres de haut se dresse devant l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel 25hours &agrave; Zurich-Ouest. Cette immense repr&eacute;sentation d&rsquo;une ancienne &eacute;tudiante en musique repr&eacute;sente la jeunesse de sa g&eacute;n&eacute;ration et celle du quartier Zurich-Ouest.</p><h3>Particularit&eacute;s&nbsp;:</h3><p>Pendant le festival Art and the City, une autre sculpture &eacute;rig&eacute;e sur la Steinfelsplatz &agrave; Zurich-Ouest est devenue la mascotte du festival&nbsp;: &laquo;&nbsp;Vanessa&nbsp;&raquo;. Apr&egrave;s avoir &eacute;t&eacute; mise &agrave; disposition de la ville pendant trois mois, cette &oelig;uvre devait &ecirc;tre rendue &agrave; son propri&eacute;taire. L&rsquo;artiste Alex Hanimann a donc commenc&eacute; imm&eacute;diatement une deuxi&egrave;me sculpture qui restera en place.</p><h3>Emplacement&nbsp;:</h3><p>Devant l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel 25hours &agrave; Zurich-Ouest, &laquo;&nbsp;Anne-Sophie&nbsp;&raquo; symbolise la jeunesse du quartier et de sa g&eacute;n&eacute;ration.</p><h3>Le cr&eacute;ateur&nbsp;:</h3><p>Alex Hanimann (*1955) est un artiste suisse et professeur de communication visuelle &agrave; la Haute &eacute;cole des arts de Zurich. Dessins, peinture, lettrisme, impression graphique et art objet emplissent sa sph&egrave;red&rsquo;activit&eacute;s.</p></h3>"@fr,
        "<h3>L&rsquo;opera<p>Proprio come l&rsquo;opera <a href=\"/it/node/227368\">Towers</a> sulla Escher-Wyss-Platz, anche Anne-Sophie &egrave; nata nell&rsquo;ambito del festival Art and the City. La scultura in acciaio cromato si trova davanti al 25hours Hotel Z&uuml;rich-West ed &egrave; alta oltre 5 metri. Questa copia sovradimensionata di una ex studentessa di musica rappresenta la giovent&ugrave; della sua generazione, ma anche quella del quartiere Z&uuml;rich-West.</p><h3>Particolarit&agrave;</h3><p>Durante il festival Art and the City, fu &ldquo;Vanessa&rdquo; a trovare posto per prima sulla Steinfelsplatz di Z&uuml;rich-West, diventando una sorta di mascotte dell&rsquo;evento. Dato che, dopo un prestito di tre mesi, la scultura torn&ograve; al proprietario, l&rsquo;artista Alex Hanimann inizi&ograve; a realizzarne subito una seconda, permanente.</p><h3>Luogo</h3><p>Davanti al 25hours Hotel Z&uuml;rich-West, &ldquo;Anne-Sophie&rdquo; simboleggia la giovent&ugrave; del quartiere e della sua generazione.</p><h3>L&rsquo;autore</h3><p>Alex Hanimann (*1955) &egrave; un artista svizzero e professore di comunicazione visiva all&rsquo;Istituto Superiore di Arte di Zurigo. Si occupa di disegni, pittura, Lettrismo, riproduzioni a stampa e arte oggettuale.</p></h3>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Vor dem 25hours Hotel in Zürich-West glänzt und spiegelt die Chromstahlplastik Anne-Sophie von Künstler Alex Hanimann."@de,
        "From its position in front of the 25hours hotel in Zürich-West, the chrome steel sculpture by artist Alex Hanimann shines and reflects its surroundings."@en,
        "Devant l’hôtel 25hours à Zurich-Ouest brille et miroite la sculpture en acier chromé Anne-Sophie de l’artiste Alex Hanimann."@fr,
        "Davanti al 25hours Hotel Zürich-West, la scultura di acciaio cromato Anne-Sophie dell’artista Alex Hanimann luccica e rispecchia immagini."@it ;
    schema:geo _:N941cf7aa7e8447d0bfe93c5edcdaab61 ;
