    schema:description "<p>Das Restaurant differente im Herzen von Z&uuml;rich verwendet f&uuml;r seine Gerichte nur qualitativ hochstehende, saisonale und regionale Produkte. Damit zaubert das professionelle Team mediterrane Gerichte und Schweizer Spezialit&auml;ten.<p>Sehr beliebt sind ausserdem die weit bekannten Tatarkreationen des Hauses.</p><p>Im &laquo;Differente&raquo; wird grosser Wert auf eine perfekte Bedienung gelegt, welche die hohen Servicek&uuml;nste beherrscht: Flambieren, Filetieren und Tranchieren am Tisch machen das Essen zu einem unvergesslichen Erlebnis.&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The differente restaurant in the heart of Zurich uses only high-quality, seasonal and local produce &ndash; which the professional kitchen team then transform into delicious Mediterranean dishes and Swiss specialties.<p>In addition, its steak tartare creations are very popular and renowned throughout the city.</p><p>At the differente, great importance is attached to providing perfect service; the food is flamb&eacute;ed, filleted and carved at the table, thus making every meal a memorable occasion.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le restaurant &laquo;&nbsp;Differente&nbsp;&raquo; au c&oelig;ur de Zurich utilise uniquement des produits r&eacute;gionaux et saisonniers de la plus grande qualit&eacute;. L&rsquo;&eacute;quipe professionnelle les transforme en plats m&eacute;diterran&eacute;ens et sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s traditionnelles suisses.<p>De plus, les cr&eacute;ations de tartare de la maison sont tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;es.</p><p>Au &laquo;&nbsp;Differente&nbsp;&raquo;, on mise sur un service impeccable et un personnel qui ma&icirc;trise le grand art du service&nbsp;: les serveurs flambent, d&eacute;coupent et tranchent &agrave; table &ndash; une exp&eacute;rience inoubliable pour les clients.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Per i suoi piatti, il ristorante Differente, nel cuore di Zurigo, utilizza solo prodotti regionali e stagionali di altissima qualit&agrave;. In questo modo, il professionale team prepara favolose creazioni mediterranee e specialit&agrave; svizzere.<p>Anche le tartare della casa sono molto amate.</p><p>Al Differente si d&agrave; grande importanza ad un servizio impeccabile: fiammeggiare, affettare e tagliare al tavolo trasformano il pasto in un&rsquo;esperienza indimenticabile.&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Restaurant & Bar Differente des Hotels Krone Unterstrass werden Gäste mit Schweizer Spezialitäten und mediterranen Gerichten verwöhnt."@de,
        "At the Differente restaurant & bar, housed in the Hotel Krone Unterstrass, guests are treated to delicious Swiss specialties and Mediterranean dishes."@en,
        "Au restaurant-bar « Differente » de l’hôtel Krone Unterstrass, les clients savourent spécialités suisses et plats méditerranéens."@fr,
        "Al ristorante e bar Differente dell’Hotel Krone Unterstrass, gli ospiti vengono viziati con specialità svizzere e piatti mediterranei."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotel-krone.ch" ;
