    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Im Restaurant Trinity wird die &laquo;heilige Dreifaltigkeit&raquo; des Barbecues zelebriert. Allerdings sind damit nicht wie in den USA Spareribs, Pulled Pork und Beef Brisket gemeint, sondern wurden f&uuml;r Z&uuml;rich neu konzipiert:<p>Hier stehen das originale Wiener Schnitzel, das Schweizer Cordon Bleu nach Walliser Art sowie als Allesk&ouml;nner diverse Burger-Kreationen im Fokus.</p><p>Selbstverst&auml;ndlich gibt es alle diese Grill-Spezialit&auml;ten auch in vegetarischen oder veganen Varianten.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The Trinity restaurant celebrates the &ldquo;holy trinity&rdquo; of barbecue. However, this does not mean spareribs, pulled pork, and beef brisket as in the USA, but has been reinterpreted for Zurich: here, the supreme disciplines are the original Wiener schnitzel, the Swiss cordon bleu Valais-style and &ndash; as an absolute all-rounder &ndash; the burger in a variety of creations.<p>Of course, all these grill specialties are also available as vegetarian or vegan variants.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Au restaurant Trinity, on c&eacute;l&egrave;bre la &laquo;&nbsp;sainte trinit&eacute;&nbsp;&raquo; du barbecue am&eacute;ricain. Toutefois, il ne s&rsquo;agit pas, comme aux &Eacute;tats-Unis, de spareribs, pulled pork et beef brisket. Zurich interpr&egrave;te la sainte trinit&eacute; &agrave; sa fa&ccedil;on&nbsp;:<p>L&rsquo;accent est mis sur l&rsquo;escalope viennoise originale, le cordon bleu suisse &agrave; la valaisanne ainsi que sur diverses cr&eacute;ations de burgers.</p><p>Bien entendu, toutes ces sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s de BBQ sont &eacute;galement disponibles dans des variantes v&eacute;g&eacute;tariennes ou v&eacute;g&eacute;taliennes.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Al ristorante Trinity si celebra la &ldquo;sacra trinit&agrave;&rdquo; delle grigliate. Tuttavia, a differenza degli Stati Uniti, con questa espressione non si intendono Spareribs, Pulled Pork e Beef Brisket, bens&igrave; specialit&agrave; rivisitate per Zurigo, come la cotoletta alla viennese originale, il cordon bleu svizzero alla vallesana e diversi hamburger.<p>Va da s&eacute; che tutte queste prelibatezze vengono servite anche in versione vegetariana o vegana.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Wer BBQ, Burger und Wiener Schnitzel liebt, besucht das Restaurant Trinity im Hotel Glärnischhof by Trinity."@de,
        "Those who love BBQ, burgers, and schnitzel Viennese-style, should visit the Trinity Restaurant at the Hotel Glärnischhof by Trinity."@en,
        "Si vous aimez les grillades, les burgers et les escalopes viennoises, rendez-vous au restaurant Trinity de l'hôtel Glärnischhof by Trinity."@fr,
        "Chi ama BBQ, hamburger e cotolette alla viennese non può perdersi il ristorante Trinity all’Hotel Glärnischhof by Trinity."@it ;
    schema:email "info@hotelglaernischhof.ch" ;
