    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Die saisonalen &Ouml;ffnungszeiten der Bahnen und Freizeiteinrichtungen k&ouml;nnen der <a href=\"https://www.atzmaennig.ch/de/winter/oeffnungszeiten-anlagen/\">Website</a> entnommen werden.</p>"@de,
        "<p>The seasonal opening hours of the railways and leisure facilities can be found on the <a href=\"https://www.atzmaennig.ch/en/winter/opening-hours-facilities/\">website</a>.</p>"@en,
        "<p>Les horaires d'ouverture saisonniers des remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques et des installations de loisirs sont disponibles sur le <a href=\"https://www.atzmaennig.ch/en/winter/opening-hours-facilities/\">site web</a>.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Gli orari stagionali di apertura delle funivie e delle strutture ricreative sono disponibili sul <a href=\"https://www.atzmaennig.ch/en/winter/opening-hours-facilities/\">sito web</a>.</p>"@it ;
