    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Liebhaber von indischem Essen sollten in Z&uuml;rich unbedingt das Restaurant Vulkan aufsuchen. Manche nennen das Lokal sogar &laquo;Kleines Indien mitten in Z&uuml;rich&raquo;. Nahe dem Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich gelegen, werden hier t&auml;glich frische indische Spezialit&auml;ten zubereitet.<p>Eine grosse Auswahl an Tandoori-Speisen, die im authentischen Tandoor-Ofen aus Ton zubereitet werden, diverse Currys, etwa das Chicken Tikka Masala, aber auch Lammgerichte, Fladenbrote mit verschiedenen Chutneys sowie Suppen und Lassis sind die Spezialit&auml;ten des Hauses.</p><p>Die Einrichtung und Atmosph&auml;re entf&uuml;hren Besucher nach Indien: Deko-Elemente, etwa viele Elefanten und ein Modell des Taj Mahal sowie viele frische Blumen und kleine Gl&uuml;cksbringer schm&uuml;cken das Lokal.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Fans of Indian cuisine should be sure to pay a visit to the Restaurant Vulkan. Many people even refer to the locale as &ldquo;Little India in the middle of Zurich&rdquo;. Situated near Zurich Main Station, it serves Indian specialties freshly prepared every day.<p>The specialties of the house are a wide choice of tandoori dishes, which are prepared in an authentic tandoor oven made from clay, various curries including Chicken Tikka Masala, lamb dishes, and pitta breads with different chutneys, as well as soups and lassis.</p><p>The furnishings and ambiance transport guests to India, for the restaurant is adorned with deco elements including numerous elephants and a model of the Taj Mahal, as well as many fresh flowers and small lucky charms.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Les amateurs de cuisine indienne doivent absolument se rendre au restaurant Vulkan de Zurich. Certains l&rsquo;appellent m&ecirc;me&nbsp;&laquo;&nbsp;La petite Inde du c&oelig;ur de Zurich&nbsp;&raquo;. Il propose des sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s indiennes quotidiennement et fra&icirc;chement pr&eacute;par&eacute;es, tout pr&egrave;s de la Zurich gare centrale.<p>Parmi les sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s maison, un large choix de plats tandoori pr&eacute;par&eacute;s dans un four tandoor de terre glaise, comme les diff&eacute;rents currys, poulets tikka massala, plats d&rsquo;agneau, pains pita et chutneys vari&eacute;s ainsi que soupes et lassis.</p><p>L&rsquo;am&eacute;nagement et l&rsquo;atmosph&egrave;re transportent les visiteurs en Inde&nbsp;: le restaurant se pare d&rsquo;&eacute;l&eacute;ments d&eacute;coratifs comme les &eacute;l&eacute;phants, une maquette du Taj Mahal, de multiples fleurs et petits porte-bonheurs.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Gli amanti della cucina indiana non possono perdersi il ristorante Vulkan di Zurigo. Alcuni chiamano il locale la &ldquo;piccola India nel cuore di Zurigo&rdquo;. Vicino alla stazione centrale, il locale propone tutti i giorni specialit&agrave; indiane fresche.<p>Una grande selezione di pietanze tandoori, preparate in un autentico forno tandoor di argilla, diversi curry, pollo tikka masala, piatti a base di agnello, schiacciate con vari chutney, zuppe e lassi sono tra le specialit&agrave; della casa.</p><p>Arredamento e atmosfera catapultano gli ospiti in India: il locale, infatti, &egrave; decorato da numerosi elefanti, una riproduzione del Taj Mahal, tanti fiori freschi e piccoli portafortuna.&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Nur fünf Minuten vom Hauptbahnhof Zürich entfernt steht eines der ältesten indischen Restaurants von Zürich."@de,
        "Just five minutes from Zurich Main Station is the oldest Indian restaurant in Zurich."@en,
        "À seulement cinq minutes de la Zurich gare centrale se trouve l’un des plus anciens restaurants indiens de Zurich."@fr,
        "A soli cinque minuti dalla stazione centrale di Zurigo, si trova uno dei ristoranti indiani più antichi della città."@it ;
    schema:email "info@restaurant-vulkan.ch" ;
