    schema:priceRange "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>pro Person</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Erwachsene</th><td>CHF 26</td></tr><tr><th><strong>Student</strong>:<strong>innen&nbsp;</strong></th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (7–15)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Kinder (0–6)</th><td>Gratis</td></tr><tr><th>Menschen mit Behinderungen</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card-Besitzer:innen</th><td>Gratis</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppen (Erwachsene)*</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppen &nbsp;(Kinder)*</th><td>CHF 13</td></tr><tr><th>Saisonkarte**</th><td>CHF 77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>*Ab 10 Personen</p><p>** Die Dauerkarte berechtigt Sie ein Jahr lang zum unbegrenzten Zugang zum FIFA-Museum. Weitere Vorteile und Informationen <a href=\"https://fifamuseum.com/de/dein-besuch/plane-deinen-besuch/tickets/the-season-ticket-perfect-gift\">hier</a>.</p></div>"@de,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>per person</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adults</th><td>CHF 26</td></tr><tr><th>Students</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Children (7–15 years)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Children (0–6 years)</th><td>Free</td></tr><tr><th>Disabled</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Zürich Card holders</th><td>Free</td></tr><tr><th>Groups (children)*</th><td>CHF 13</td></tr><tr><th>Groups (adults)*</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Season Card**</th><td>CHF 77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>*From 10 persons</p><p>**the season card entitles you to unlimited access to the FIFA Museum for one year. Further benefits and information <a href=\"https://fifamuseum.com/en/visit/plan-your-visit/tickets/the-season-ticket-perfect-gift\">here</a>.</p></div>"@en,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>par personne</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adultes</th><td>CHF 26</td></tr><tr><th>Étudiants&nbsp;</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (7 – 15)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Enfants (0 – 6)</th><td>Gratuit</td></tr><tr><th>Personnes handicapées</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Visiteurs en possession d’une Zürich Card</th><td>Gratuit</td></tr><tr><th>Groupes (adultes)*</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Groupes (enfants)*</th><td>CHF 13</td></tr><tr><th>Carte de saison**</th><td>CHF 77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>*A partir de 10 personnes</p><p>**La carte de saison vous donne droit à un accès illimité au Musée FIFA pendant un an. Plus d'avantages et d'informations <a href=\"https://fifamuseum.com/en/visit/plan-your-visit/tickets/the-season-ticket-perfect-gift\">ici</a>.</p></div>"@fr,
        "<div class=\"table-container\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>a persona</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Adulti</th><td>CHF 26</td></tr><tr><th>Studenti&nbsp;</th><td>CHF 20</td></tr><tr><th>Bambini (7 – 15)</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Bambini (0 – 6)</th><td>Gratuito</td></tr><tr><th>Persone con disabilità</th><td>CHF 15</td></tr><tr><th>Visitatori in possesso di una Zürich Card</th><td>Gratuito</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppi (adulti)*</th><td>CHF 24</td></tr><tr><th>Gruppi (bambini)*</th><td>CHF 13</td></tr><tr><th>Abbonamento stagionale**</th><td>CHF 77</td></tr></tbody></table><p>*A partire da 10 persone</p><p>**L'abbonamento dà diritto all'accesso illimitato al Museo FIFA per un anno. Ulteriori vantaggi e informazioni <a href=\"https://fifamuseum.com/en/visit/plan-your-visit/tickets/the-season-ticket-perfect-gift\">qui</a>.</p></div>"@it ;
