    schema:dateModified "2025-04-15T14:17:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Unter dem Namen &laquo;Kinematographen-Theater Seefeld&raquo; liefen hier einst Stummfilme. Seit den 50er-Jahren stand das Geb&auml;ude danach lange Zeit leer, bevor es zum heutigen Multikonzept mit Restaurant und Bar umfunktioniert wurde. Und so geniessen G&auml;ste im ehemaligen Lichtspielsaal des Kinos Spezialit&auml;ten aus aller Welt.<p>Der sechs Meter hohe Saal wurde mit viel Sinn f&uuml;r Stil und Mut zur Eigenst&auml;ndigkeit umgebaut. Vom Restaurant blicken die G&auml;ste in die K&uuml;che, wo authentische Gerichte aus aller Welt zubereitet werden.</p><p>F&uuml;r den passenden Tropfen Wein geht es in die begehbare Weinschatzkammer. Und sobald es die Temperaturen erlauben, k&ouml;nnen die G&auml;ste im romantischen Hinterhofgarten speisen.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>In bygone days, silent movies were screened at what was known as the &ldquo;Seefeld cinematographic theater&rdquo;. From the 1950s, the building stood empty for many years before it was converted into the present-day multi-concept restaurant and bar. Nowadays, guests can enjoy culinary specialties from all over the world in the former movie auditorium.<p>The 6 meter (20 ft) high room was converted for its new purpose with a keen sense of style and much courage. From the restaurant, guests have a view into the kitchen, where authentic dishes from all over the world are prepared.</p><p>The right wine is fetched from the walk-in wine treasure chamber. And as soon as the temperatures allow, guests can dine in the romantic garden in the rear courtyard.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Autrefois, on projetait ici des films muets sous le nom &laquo;&nbsp;Kinematographen-Theater Seefeld&nbsp;&raquo; (th&eacute;&acirc;tre des cin&eacute;matographes). Depuis les ann&eacute;es 1950, le b&acirc;timent est rest&eacute; vide pendant longtemps avant d'&ecirc;tre transform&eacute; en restaurant et bar &agrave; concepts multiples. Aujourd&rsquo;hui, on savoure des sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s du monde entier dans l&rsquo;ancienne salle de cin&eacute;ma.<p>La salle de six m&egrave;tres de haut a &eacute;t&eacute; reconstruite avec beaucoup de style et d&rsquo;audace. Depuis le restaurant, les clients peuvent voir la cuisine, o&ugrave; sont pr&eacute;par&eacute;s des plats authentiques du monde entier.</p><p>Pour trouver le vin ad&eacute;quat, on peut se rendre dans la chambre du tr&eacute;sor viticole. Et d&egrave;s que la temp&eacute;rature le permet, les clients peuvent d&icirc;ner dans le jardin romantique de l'arri&egrave;re-cour.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Con il nome di &ldquo;Kinematographen-Theater Seefeld&rdquo;, un tempo, qui si proiettavano film muti. Dagli anni Cinquanta, l&rsquo;edificio &egrave; rimasto a lungo vuoto, prima di essere convertito al concept attuale: un multisala con ristorante e bar. Oggi, gli ospiti dell&rsquo;ex cinematografo gustano specialit&agrave; di tutto il mondo.<p>Alta sei metri, la sala &egrave; stata trasformata con tantissimo gusto e coraggio per la singolarit&agrave;. Dal ristorante, si pu&ograve; osservare la cucina, dove vengono preparati manicaretti di tutto il mondo.</p><p>Al vino adatto pensa la cantina aperta, dalla quale i clienti possono scegliere la propria bottiglia. Appena le temperature lo consentono, &egrave; possibile mangiare nel romantico giardino sul retro.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Essen im ehemaligen Kino? Das spektakuläre Restaurant Razzia macht’s im wunderschönen Quartier Seefeld möglich."@de,
        "How about dinner in a former movie theater? This is possible at the spectacular Razzia restaurant in the beautiful Seefeld quarter."@en,
        "Au spectaculaire restaurant Razzia situé dans le magnifique quartier Seefeld, les clients mangent dans un ancien cinéma."@fr,
        "Mangiare in un ex cinema? Allo spettacolare ristorante Razzia, nello splendido quartiere di Seefeld, è possibile."@it ;
    schema:email "welcome@razzia-zuerich.ch" ;
