        "70 km (43.5 miles) from Zurich"@en,
        "Six ski lifts"@en,
        "Two snow sports region"@en,
        "20 km de pistes"@fr,
        "Deux domaines skiables"@fr,
        "Six remontées mécaniques"@fr,
        "à 70 km de Zurich"@fr,
        "2 comprensori sciistici"@it,
        "20 chilometri di discese"@it,
