        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Das <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1318\" data-entity-uuid=\"5f16fd68-1d15-48a2-a95a-e0c268a225a4\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Hotel Widder</a> wurde sehr sorgf&auml;ltig in acht nebeneinanderstehende, denkmalgesch&uuml;tzte H&auml;user aus dem Mittelalter gebaut. Das Herz dieses &laquo;Leading Hotel of the World&raquo; ist die legend&auml;re Widder Bar.<p>Zum Rhythmus von Live Jazz geniessen hier sowohl Hotelg&auml;ste als auch stilbewusste Z&uuml;rcher:innen bew&auml;hrte Cocktail-Klassiker und unkompliziertes Essen auf hohem Niveau. Das macht die Widder Bar zu einem beliebten Lokal f&uuml;r Ap&eacute;ros oder Drinks in guter Gesellschaft.</p><p>Der Abschluss des Abends bildet oft der obligate Blick in die &laquo;Library of Spirits&raquo;, welche mit mehr als 1&rsquo;000 verschiedenen Flaschen auftrumpft.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1318\" data-entity-uuid=\"5f16fd68-1d15-48a2-a95a-e0c268a225a4\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Widder Hotel</a> has been lovingly created from eight adjoining, listed buildings dating from medieval times. At the heart of this &ldquo;Leading Hotel of the World&rdquo; is the legendary Widder Bar.<p>To the rhythms of live jazz, both hotel guests and style-conscious locals enjoy tried-and-tested cocktail classics and outstanding, frill-free cuisine. As a result, the Widder Bar is a popular place for ap&eacute;ros or drinks in good company.</p><p>The evening is often brought to a close by an obligatory look into the Library of Spirits, which boasts over 1,000 different bottles.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1318\" data-entity-uuid=\"5f16fd68-1d15-48a2-a95a-e0c268a225a4\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Widder</a> a &eacute;t&eacute; soigneusement int&eacute;gr&eacute; dans huit b&acirc;timents du Moyen Age juxtapos&eacute;s et class&eacute;s monuments historiques. Le c&oelig;ur social de ce &laquo;&nbsp;Leading Hotel of the World&nbsp;&raquo; est le l&eacute;gendaire Widder Bar.<p>H&ocirc;tes et Zurichois courtois appr&eacute;cient ici les cocktails classiques et les plats simples haut de gamme en &eacute;coutant du jazz en direct. Aussi le bar Widder est-il un lieu appr&eacute;ci&eacute; pour prendre un ap&eacute;ritif, ou un cocktail en bonne compagnie.</p><p>En fin de soir&eacute;e, il est devenu presque obligatoire d&rsquo;admirer la &laquo;&nbsp;Library of Spirits&nbsp;&raquo; contenant plus de 1&nbsp;000 alcools diff&eacute;rents.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p><a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/node/1318\" data-entity-uuid=\"5f16fd68-1d15-48a2-a95a-e0c268a225a4\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">L&rsquo;Hotel Widder</a> &egrave; stato allestito con estrema cura all&rsquo;interno di otto edifici medievali adiacenti sottoposti a tutela. Il cuore sociale di questo &ldquo;Leading Hotel of the World&rdquo; &egrave; il leggendario Widder Bar.<p>Al ritmo di musica jazz dal vivo, gli ospiti dell&rsquo;hotel e gli zurighesi attenti allo stile gustano cocktail classici ormai affermati e piatti semplici, ma di altissimo livello. Tutto questo fa del Widder Bar un locale molto amato per aperitivi o drink in buona compagnia.</p><p>Le serate si concludono spesso con uno sguardo alla &ldquo;Library of Spirits&rdquo;, che si vanta di conservare pi&ugrave; di 1.000 bottiglie diverse.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Die gelungene Neuinterpretation der legendären Zürcher Widder Bar überzeugt mit stilvollem Interieur und hoher Qualität."@de,
        "The successful reinterpretation of Zurich’s legendary Widder Bar impresses with its stylish interior and high quality."@en,
        "Cette réinterprétation réussie du légendaire bar Widder séduit par son intérieur élégant et sa haute qualité."@fr,
        "La riuscita reinterpretazione del leggendario Widder Bar di Zurigo, con interni stilosi e qualità elevata."@it ;
    schema:geo _:N818f7ad365c042a6a0b03c60c419d880 ;
