        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-02-10T17:52:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>In einem typischen Industriegeb&auml;ude aus den 1900er-Jahren, das heute denkmalgesch&uuml;tzt ist, finden Liebhaber zeitgen&ouml;ssischer Kunst die Galerie Eva Presenhuber. In volumin&ouml;sen R&auml;umen sind beeindruckende Exponate zu sehen.<p>Heute z&auml;hlt Eva Presenhuber zu den einflussreichsten Galeristinnen ihrer Generation. Ihr Portefeuille ist exquisit. Von Douglas Aitken und Emmanuelle Antille &uuml;ber Urs Fischer, Douglas Gordon und Richard Prince bis zu Oscar Tuazon und Franz West.</p><p>Ihre Karriere ist beeindruckend: Nach ihrem Z&uuml;rcher Debut als Kuratorin in der Galerie Walcheturm legt Eva Presenhuber 2004 mit ihrer eigenen Galerie einen fulminanten Start hin. Bereits im ersten Jahr war Presenhuber an der Art Basel Miami dabei. Im Jahr darauf folgen Auftritte an der Frieze London, der Armory Show New York und der Art Basel.</p><p>Ein weiterer Standort in Z&uuml;rich ist an der&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galerie+Eva+Presenhuber,+Waldmannstrasse/@47.368599,8.5467058,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x768e6ac78780e484!8m2!3d47.3685723!4d8.5466461\">Waldmannstrasse 6</a>&nbsp;zu finden.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Contemporary art enthusiasts can find the Galerie Eva Presenhuber in a typical industrial building dating from the 1900s, which today is under a preservation order. Here impressive exhibits can be viewed in enormous open spaces.<p>Nowadays, Eva Presenhuber is considered one of the most influential gallery owners of her generation. Her portfolio is exquisite &ndash; ranging from Douglas Aitken and Emmanuelle Antille, to Urs Fischer, Douglas Gordon and Richard Prince, through to Oscar Tuazon and Franz West.</p><p>Eva Presenhuber&rsquo;s career is an impressive one: after her Zurich debut as curator of the Walcheturm gallery, the launch of her own gallery in 2004 proved to be an immediate success. Already in her first year, Presenhuber took part in Art Basel Miami, and the following year she was present at the Frieze London, the Armory Show New York and Art Basel.</p><p>A second branch can be found at <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galerie+Eva+Presenhuber,+Waldmannstrasse/@47.368599,8.5467058,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x768e6ac78780e484?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjxpq_15bH3AhVKhv0HHXTVAvUQ_BJ6BAhEEAU\">Waldmannstrasse 6</a> in Zurich.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Abrit&eacute;e par un b&acirc;timent industriel typique des ann&eacute;es 1900 aujourd&rsquo;hui class&eacute; monument historique, la galerie Eva Presenhuber ravit les amateurs d&rsquo;art contemporain. Dans des salles de taille remarquable, on peut admirer des &oelig;uvres impressionnantes.<p>Eva Presenhuber est aujourd&rsquo;hui une des galeristes les plus influentes de sa g&eacute;n&eacute;ration. Elle dispose d&rsquo;un excellent portfolio dans lequel figurent Douglas Aitken et Emmanuelle Antille, Urs Fischer, Douglas Gordon et Richard Prince, Oscar Tuazon ou encore Franz West.</p><p>Sa carri&egrave;re fulgurante est impressionnante&nbsp;: suite &agrave; son d&eacute;but zurichois en tant que commissaire de la galerie Walcheturm, elle fonde sa propre galerie en 2004, qui conna&icirc;t un d&eacute;marrage brillant. D&egrave;s sa premi&egrave;re ann&eacute;e, Presenhuber est invit&eacute;e &agrave; l&rsquo;Art Basel Miami. L&rsquo;ann&eacute;e suivante, elle appara&icirc;t &agrave; la Frieze &agrave; Londres, &agrave; l&rsquo;Armory Show &agrave; New York et &agrave; l&rsquo;Art Basel.</p><p>Une deuxi&egrave;me filiale zurichoise est situ&eacute;e dans la <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galerie+Eva+Presenhuber,+Waldmannstrasse/@47.368599,8.5467058,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x768e6ac78780e484!8m2!3d47.3685723!4d8.5466461\">Waldmannstrasse 6</a>.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>In un tipico edificio industriale del Novecento, oggi sottoposto a tutela architettonica, gli appassionati di arte contemporanea trovano la galleria Eva Presenhuber, dove ampi locali ospitano opere d&rsquo;arte impressionanti.<p>Oggi, Eva Presenhuber &egrave; annoverata tra le galleriste pi&ugrave; influenti della propria generazione. Il suo portfolio &egrave; incredibile e spazia da Douglas Aitken ed Emmanuelle Antille a Oscar Tuazon e Franz West, passando da Urs Fischer, Douglas Gordon e Richard Prince.</p><p>La sua carriera &egrave; notevole: dopo il debutto zurighese come curatrice della galleria Walcheturm, nel 2004, Eva Presenhuber inaugura brillantemente la propria galleria, esponendo alla Art Basel Miami gi&agrave; il primo anno. L&rsquo;anno dopo, seguono partecipazioni alla Frieze London, all&rsquo;Armory Show New York e alla Art Basel.</p><p>Una seconda sede di trova alla <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galerie+Eva+Presenhuber,+Waldmannstrasse/@47.368599,8.5467058,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x768e6ac78780e484?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjxpq_15bH3AhVKhv0HHXTVAvUQ_BJ6BAhEEAU\">Waldmannstrasse 6</a> di Zurigo.</p></p>"@it ;
