    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Hong Kong, London, New York, Los Angeles, Somerset, St. Moritz &ndash; als globale Spitzenreiter sind Hauser &amp; Wirth &uuml;berall in der Welt zuhause. Doch auch diese Big Players haben klein angefangen. Im zarten Alter von sieben Jahren kopierte Iwan Wirth Skulpturen von Giacometti und verkaufte sie f&uuml;r 75 Franken. Seine erste Galerie er&ouml;ffnete er als Sechzehnj&auml;hriger, bevor er gemeinsam mit Manuela Wirth und Ursula Hauser (seiner Frau und seiner Schwiegermutter) 1992 die Galerie Hauser &amp; Wirth in Z&uuml;rich gr&uuml;ndete.<p>Seither hat das Haus eine unvergleichliche Expansionsgeschichte hingelegt. Die K&uuml;nstlerliste der Galerie liest sich wie die Sammlungsaufstellung grosser Museen. Neben Nachl&auml;ssen von Eva Hesse, Lee Lozano, Louise Bourgeois, Mike Kelley oder Maria Lassnig vertreten Hauser &amp; Wirth K&uuml;nstlerInnen wie Pippilotti Rist, Paul McCarthy oder Martin Creed.</p><h5>Weiterer Standort:</h5><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hauser+%26+Wirth+R%C3%A4mistrasse/@47.3679862,8.546703,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x8b7a6e6dbd633fad!8m2!3d47.3679862!4d8.546703\">R&auml;mistrasse 16</a><br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Hong Kong, London, New York, Los Angeles, Somerset, St. Moritz &ndash; as a globally leading art gallery, Hauser &amp; Wirth is at home all over the world. However, even this big player started off small. At the tender age of seven, Iwan Wirth copied sculptures by Giacometti and sold them for CHF 75. He opened his first gallery at the age of 16, before founding the Hauser &amp; Wirth gallery in Zurich in 1992 together with his wife, Manuela Wirth, and his mother-in-law, Ursula Hauser.<p>Since then, the gallery has undergone enormous expansion. Its list of artists reads like an overview of collections at major museums. Besides managing the estates of Eva Hesse, Lee Lozano, Louise Bourgeois, Mike Kelley, and Maria Lassnig, Hauser &amp; Wirth represent artists such as Pippilotti Rist, Paul McCarthy, and Martin Creed.</p><h5>Second branch:</h5><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hauser+%26+Wirth+R%C3%A4mistrasse/@47.3679862,8.546703,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x8b7a6e6dbd633fad!8m2!3d47.3679862!4d8.546703\">R&auml;mistrasse 16</a><br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Hong Kong, Londres, New York, Los Angeles, Somerset, St Moritz&nbsp;: les leaders mondiaux Hauser &amp; Wirth sont pr&eacute;sents partout dans le monde. Mais ces acteurs majeurs ont &eacute;galement commenc&eacute; petit&nbsp;: &agrave; l&rsquo;&acirc;ge de sept ans, Iwan Wirth copiait les sculptures de Giacometti et les vendait pour 75 francs suisses. A seize ans, il a ouvert sa premi&egrave;re galerie. En 1992, il a fond&eacute; la galerie Hauser &amp; Wirth &agrave; Zurich, avec Manuela Wirth et Ursula Hauser (son &eacute;pouse et sa belle-m&egrave;re).<p>Depuis ce temps-l&agrave;, la maison a connu une expansion incomparable. La liste de ses artistes se lit comme le relev&eacute; des collections de grands mus&eacute;es. Outre les successions d&rsquo;Eva Hesse, Lee Lozano, Louise Bourgeois, Mike Kelley ou Maria Lassnig, Hauser &amp; Wirth repr&eacute;sentent des artistes comme Pippilotti Rist, Paul McCarthy ou Martin Creed.&nbsp;</p><h5>Deuxi&egrave;me filiale :</h5><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hauser+%26+Wirth+R%C3%A4mistrasse/@47.3679862,8.546703,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x8b7a6e6dbd633fad!8m2!3d47.3679862!4d8.546703\">R&auml;mistrasse 16</a><br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Hong Kong, Londra, New York, Los Angeles, Somerset, St. Moritz: in veste di leader globali, Hauser &amp; Wirth sono di casa in ogni parte del mondo. Eppure, anche questi big player hanno iniziato in piccolo. Alla tenera et&agrave; di sette anni, Iwan Wirth copiava sculture di Giacometti e le vendeva a 75 franchi. A sedici anni, apr&igrave; la sua prima galleria, poi, nel 1992, insieme a Manuela Wirth e Ursula Hauser (moglie e suocera), fond&ograve; la galleria Hauser &amp; Wirth a Zurigo.<p>Da allora, la casa si &egrave; espansa in maniera impareggiabile. La lista degli artisti della galleria non ha niente da invidiare all&rsquo;elenco delle collezioni dei grandi musei. Oltre a opere postume di Eva Hesse, Lee Lozano, Louise Bourgeois, Mike Kelley o Maria Lassnig, Hauser &amp; Wirth rappresentano anche artisti del calibro di Pippilotti Rist, Paul McCarthy o Martin Creed.</p><h5>Seconda sede:</h5><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hauser+%26+Wirth+R%C3%A4mistrasse/@47.3679862,8.546703,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x8b7a6e6dbd633fad!8m2!3d47.3679862!4d8.546703\">R&auml;mistrasse 16</a><br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Power-Ehepaar des internationalen Kunst-Zirkus unterhält auch eine Galerie im Löwenbräu-Areal."@de,
        "The influential couple from the international art scene run a gallery on the site of the former Löwenbräu brewery."@en,
