        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>So unscheinbar der Take Away erscheinen mag, so sensationell ist das Essen, das man hier zum Mitnehmen bestellen kann.<p>Beim sch&ouml;nsten chinesischen Garten ausserhalb Chinas gibt es f&uuml;r Besucher, Passanten und Badeg&auml;ste chinesisches Essen zum Mitnehmen.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>As inconspicuous as the takeout may appear, the food that can be ordered here to take out is sensational.<p>By the most beautiful Chinese garden outside China, visitors, passers-by, and bathers can order mouthwatering Chinese food to take out.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Bien que tr&egrave;s discret, ce restaurant Take Away propose de sensationnels plats &agrave; emporter.<p>Le plus beau jardin chinois hors de Chine propose aux visiteurs, passants et baigneurs des plats chinois &agrave; emporter.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Per quanto possa essere modesto, il take-away prepara piatti da asporto strepitosi.<p>Nel pi&ugrave; bel giardino cinese al di fuori della Cina, visitatori, passanti e bagnanti trovano anche cibo cinese da asporto.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "In der Mauer, die den wunderschönen Chinagarten umrahmt, befindet sich der Chinagarten Take Away."@de,
        "Set in the wall surrounding the beautiful Chinese Garden is the Chinagarten Take Away."@en,
        "Entre les murs entourant un magnifique jardin chinois se trouve le Chinagarten Take Away."@fr,
        "Tra le mura che circondano il meraviglioso giardino cinese, si trova il Chinagarten Take Away."@it ;
