    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p><strong>Garten Restaurant:</strong><br> Bei sch&ouml;nem Wetter t&auml;glich ab 11.30 Uhr<p><strong>Sunday Brunch:</strong><br> Jeden Sonntag von 10.00 bis 14.00 Uhr, danach Garten-Karte</p><p><strong>Samigo Parties:</strong><br> Samstag &amp; Sonntag ab 17.00 Uhr,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-parties\">zum Programm</a></p><p><strong>Samigo Sport Club:</strong><br> T&auml;glich,&nbsp; <a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-sports-club\">zur Klassen&uuml;bersicht&nbsp;</a></p></p>"@de,
        "<p><strong>Garden restaurant:</strong><br> In fine weather, daily from 11.30 am<p><strong>Sunday brunch:</strong><br> &nbsp;Sunday, 10.00am &ndash; 2pm</p><p><strong>Samigo parties:</strong><br> Saturday &amp; Sunday, from 5pm<br><a href=\"//samigo.ch/de/samigo-parties/\">see Program</a>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Samigo sport club:</strong><br> daily,&nbsp; course overview <a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-sports-club/\">here</a></p></p>"@en,
        "<p><strong>Jardin&nbsp;:</strong><br> Par beau temps, tous les jours &agrave; partir de 11h30<p><strong>Brunch :</strong><br> Dimanche, 10h &ndash; 14h</p><p><strong>Samigo parties :</strong><br> Samedi &amp; dimanche, &agrave; partir de 17h<br><a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-parties\">voir le programme</a>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Samigo sport club :</strong><br> tous les jours, <a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-sports-club\">voir la liste des classes&nbsp;</a></p></p>"@fr,
        "<p><strong>Giardino:</strong><br> In caso di bel tempo, tutti i giorni dalle 11.30<p><strong>Brunch:&nbsp;</strong><br> Domenica,&nbsp;10.00 &ndash; 14.00</p><p><strong>Samigo Parties:</strong><br> Sabato e domenica dalle 17.00, <a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-parties/\">al programma&nbsp;</a></p><p><strong>Samigo Sport Club:</strong><br> tutti i giorni, <a href=\"https://samigo.ch/de/samigo-sports-club/\">panoramica dei corsi</a></p></p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Dieses einzigartige Lokal am See kombiniert leckeres Essen mit Shows, Partys und Sport."@de,
        "This unique venue on the lake combines delicious food with shows, parties, and sports."@en,
        "Ce restaurant unique au bord du lac combine plats délicieux, spectacles, festivités et sports."@fr,
        "Questo straordinario locale sul lago fonde cibo delizioso, spettacoli, feste e sport."@it ;
