    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Im Restaurant Kitchen &amp; Bar des F&uuml;nf-Sterne-Hotels <a href=\"/de/node/1166\">La R&eacute;serve Eden au Lac</a> erinnert alles an die prachtvolle Zeit edler Yachtclubs:<p>Gem&uuml;tliche Naturledersofas und bequeme St&uuml;hle schmiegen sich an einladende Tische, bunte Glasfenster er&ouml;ffnen den Blick auf den Z&uuml;richsee und aus der offenen K&uuml;che duftet es nach Gew&uuml;rzen und Kr&auml;utern.</p><p>Auf der Karte des Eden The Kitchen &amp; The Bar stehen Makkaroni mit Tr&uuml;ffel ebenso Lachs mit Teriyaki-Yuzu-Marinade oder das originale Z&uuml;rcher Geschn&auml;tzelte.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>In the Eden Kitchen &amp; Bar restaurant at the five-star hotel, <a href=\"/en/node/1166\">La R&eacute;serve Eden au Lac</a>, everything recalls the glorious era of sophisticated yacht clubs.<p>Cozy, natural leather sofas and comfortable chairs nestle around inviting tables, stained-glass windows open onto a breathtaking view of Lake Zurich, and the wonderful aroma of spices and herbs emanate from the open kitchen.</p><p>The menu at the Eden The Kitchen &amp; The Bar includes dishes such as macaroni with truffles, salmon with a yuzu teriyaki marinade, or the original Z&uuml;rcher Geschn&auml;tzeltes.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Tout rappelle le temps de la splendeur des &eacute;l&eacute;gants yacht-clubs au restaurant Kitchen &amp; Bar de l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel 5 &eacute;toiles <a href=\"/fr/node/1166\">La R&eacute;serve Eden au Lac</a>.<p>Les confortables chaises et sofas en cuir naturel entourent les tr&egrave;s accueillantes tables, les baies vitr&eacute;es color&eacute;es donnent sur le lac de Zurich et la cuisine ouverte d&eacute;gage de fabuleux ar&ocirc;mes d&rsquo;&eacute;pices et de fines herbes.</p><p>&Agrave; la carte de l&rsquo;Eden The Kitchen &amp; The Bar : macaroni aux truffes, saumon en marinade teriyaki-yuzu ou l&rsquo;original &eacute;minc&eacute; de veau zurichois.&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Al ristorante Kitchen &amp; Bar dell&rsquo;hotel a cinque stelle <a href=\"/it/node/1166\">La R&eacute;serve Eden au Lac</a>, tutto ricorda la sontuosa epoca degli eleganti yacht club:<p>confortevoli poltrone in pelle naturale e comode sedie circondano tavoli invitanti, finestre colorate regalano scorci del Lago di Zurigo e dalla cucina si diffonde il profumo di spezie ed erbe aromatiche.</p><p>Sul menu dell&rsquo;Eden Kitchen &amp; Bar si trovano maccheroni al tartufo, salmone marinato in salsa teriyaki-yuzu o il classico spezzatino alla zurighese.&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Eine grosse und offene Küche, farbige Glasfenster und Naturledersofas laden zum Stelldichein am See."@de,
        "A large open kitchen, stained-glass windows, and natural leather sofas invite guests to a rendezvous by the lake."@en,
        "Grande cuisine ouverte, baies vitrées colorées et sofas en cuir naturel vous attendent au bord du lac."@fr,
        "Una grande cucina aperta, ampie finestre colorate e poltrone in pelle naturale invitano ad accomodarsi in riva al lago."@it ;
