    schema:dateModified "2026-02-24T14:53:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Im ibis Budget Airport profitieren die G&auml;ste von einem preiswerten Hotel an bester Lage. Die modernen, hellen und klimatisierten Zimmer verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber Gratis WLAN und Flachbildschirm TV. F&uuml;r den guten Schlaf sorgen die komfortablen Sweet Bed by ibis budget Betten.<p>Die N&auml;he zum Flughafen, die verkehrsg&uuml;nstige Lage nahe der Autobahnausfahrt und die gute Anbindung an &ouml;ffentliche Verkehrsmittel sorgen f&uuml;r eine bequeme An- und Abfahrt. Zudem empf&auml;ngt die 24-Stunden Rezeption die G&auml;ste zu jeder Tag- und Nachtzeit.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>At ibis Budget Airport, guests benefit from an inexpensive hotel in a prime location. The modern, bright, and air-conditioned rooms are equipped with free Wi-Fi and a flat-screen TV. The comfortable &ldquo;Sweet Bed by ibis budget&rdquo; beds ensure a good night&rsquo;s sleep.<p>Its proximity to the airport, convenient location near the highway exit, and excellent public transportation connections ensure easy arrival and departure. In addition, the 24-hour reception welcomes guests at any time of the day or night.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Tr&egrave;s bien situ&eacute;, l&rsquo;Ibis Budget Airport pratique des prix mod&eacute;r&eacute;s. Les chambres modernes, lumineuses et climatis&eacute;es disposent du Wifi gratuit et d&rsquo;un TV &agrave; &eacute;cran plat. Les tr&egrave;s confortables lits Sweet Bed by ibis budget garantissent un bon sommeil.<p>Sa proximit&eacute; avec l&rsquo;a&eacute;roport, son acc&egrave;s ais&eacute; pr&egrave;s de la sortie d&rsquo;autoroute et les tr&egrave;s bonnes correspondances dans les transports en commun facilitent les d&eacute;parts et les arriv&eacute;es. La r&eacute;ception ouverte 24h/24 accueille les h&ocirc;tes &agrave; toute heure.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>All&rsquo;Ibis Budget Airport, gli ospiti approfittano di un hotel economico in posizione privilegiata. Moderne, luminose e climatizzate, le camere sono dotate di Wi-Fi gratuito e TV a schermo piatto. Un sonno ristoratore &egrave; garantito dai comodi letti Sweet Bed by Ibis Budget.<p>Raggiungere l&rsquo;hotel &egrave; facile, grazie alla vicinanza all&rsquo;aeroporto, alla posizione nei pressi dell&rsquo;uscita autostradale e agli ottimi collegamenti con i mezzi pubblici. Senza contare che la reception aperta 24 h accoglie gli ospiti a qualsiasi ora del giorno e della notte.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Am Flughafen Zürich, ideal für Geschäftsreisende und Urlauber, befindet sich das Ibis Budget Airport."@de,
        "Ibis Budget Airport is located at Zurich Airport, which makes it an ideal choice for business travelers and vacationers."@en,
        "L’Ibis Budget Airport de l’aéroport de Zurich est idéal pour les hommes et femmes d’affaires et les vacanciers."@fr,
        "All’aeroporto di Zurigo, si trova l’hotel Ibis Budget Airport, ideale per chi viaggia per affari o per turisti."@it ;
