    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p><strong>Februar bis November</strong><br> Montag bis Freitag, 09.30&nbsp;&ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br> Samstag, 09.00 &ndash; 18.30 Uhr<p><strong>Dezember bis Januar</strong><br> Montag bis Freitag, 09.30&nbsp;&ndash; 20.00 Uhr<br> Samstag, 09.00 &ndash; 19.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p><strong>February to November</strong><br> Monday to Friday, 9.30am &ndash; 7.00pm<br> Saturday, 9.00am &ndash; 6.30pm<p><strong>December to January</strong><br> Monday to Friday, 9.30am &ndash; 8.00pm<br> Saturday, 9.00am &ndash; 7.00pm</p></p>"@en,
        "<p><strong>F&eacute;vrier &agrave; novembre</strong><br> Du lundi au vendredi, 9.30h &ndash; 19h<br> Samedi, 9.00h&nbsp;&ndash; 18h30<p><strong>D&eacute;cembre &agrave; janvier</strong><br> Du lundi au vendredi, 9.30h &ndash; 20h<br> Samedi, 9h &ndash; 19h</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p><strong>Da febbraio a novembre</strong><br> Da luned&igrave; a venerd&igrave;, 09.30&nbsp;&ndash; 19.00<br> Sabato, 9.00&nbsp;&ndash; 18.30<p><strong>Da dicembre a gennaio</strong><br> Da luned&igrave; a venerd&igrave;, 09.30 &ndash; 20.00<br> Sabato, 9.00 &ndash; 19.00</p></p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Auf drei Etagen finden Sie praktisch alles was ein Sportler braucht."@de,
        "On three levels you will find just about anything a sportsman or woman could want."@en,
        "Trois étages dédiés au sport sous toutes ses formes, qui feront le bonheur des amateurs."@fr,
        "Su tre piani trovi tutto ciò che serve ad un vero sportivo, tra cui i marchi principali di scarpe, articoli sportivi e abbigliamento per uomo, donna e bambini."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Och Sport"@de,
