    namiont:textTeaser "Im multikulturellen Viertel Zürichs ist die ganze Welt zu Hause."@de,
        "All the world is at home in Zürich’s multicultural quarter, and at the traditional fresh food market, there are probably more nationalities represented than at any other market in Zürich."@en,
        "Le monde entier semble avoir trouvé un chez soi dans le quartier multiculturel de Zurich."@fr,
        "Al tradizionale mercato alimentare si radunano tante nazionalità come in nessun altro mercatino zurighese."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Markt am Helvetiaplatz"@de,
