        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-02-11T11:40:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Zwei Mountainbike-Trails bietet der Z&uuml;rcher Uetliberg: den Biketrail Triemli (auch &laquo;Antennentrail&raquo; genannt) und den Biketrail H&ouml;ckler.<h3>1. Biketrail Triemli (&laquo;Antennentrail&raquo;)</h3><p>Dieser Singletrail ist der gr&ouml;ssere der beiden und beginnt direkt unterhalb der Sendeantenne beim Grillplatz auf dem Uetliberg. Das Ziel befindet sich oberhalb der Bahnstation SZU Triemli.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Kurzinfo</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>H&ouml;hendifferenz</td><td>350m</td></tr><tr><td>Streckenl&auml;nge</td><td>3.5km</td></tr><tr><td>Pfadbreite</td><td>30&ndash;60 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Fahrtzeit</td><td>ca. 11 Minuten runter,<br> ca. 30 Minuten rauf</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>2. Biketrail H&ouml;ckler</h3><p>Der H&ouml;ckler Singletrail ist zwar kurz, teilweise aber sehr steil. Er l&auml;sst sich gut als Streckenabschnitt bei gr&ouml;sseren Touren integrieren.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Kurzinfo</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>H&ouml;hendifferenz</td><td>100m</td></tr><tr><td>Streckenl&auml;nge</td><td>500m</td></tr><tr><td>Pfadbreite</td><td>30&ndash;60cm</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@de,
        "<p>There are two mountain bike trails on Zurich&rsquo;s Uetliberg: the Triemli Bike Trail (also known as the Antenna Trail) and the H&ouml;ckler Bike Trail.<h3>1. Triemli Bike Trail (\"Antenna Trail\")</h3><p>This single trail is the longer of the two and starts directly under the transmitter antenna next to the barbecue area on the Uetliberg. The finish is just above the SZU Triemli train station.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Overview</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Altitude difference</td><td>350m (1,150ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Trail length</td><td>3.5km (2.2 miles)</td></tr><tr><td>Trail width</td><td>30&ndash;60 cm (1&#8210;2ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Biking time</td><td>approx. 11 minutes down,<br> approx. 30 minutes up</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>2. H&ouml;ckler Bike Trail</h3><p>The H&ouml;ckler single trail is short, but at times very steep. It can be easily integrated into longer tours.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Overview</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Altitude difference</td><td>100m (330ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Trail length</td><td>500m (1,640ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Trail width</td><td>30&ndash;60cm (1&#8210;2ft)</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en,
        "<p>Deux pistes VTT passent par l&rsquo;Uetliberg : le &laquo;&nbsp;Biketrail Triemli&nbsp;&raquo; (aussi appel&eacute; &laquo;&nbsp;Antennentrail&nbsp;&raquo;, piste des antennes) et le &laquo;&nbsp;Biketrail H&ouml;ckler&nbsp;&raquo;.<h3>1. Biketrail Triemli (&laquo; Antennentrail &raquo;)</h3><p>Ce parcours est le plus grand des deux&nbsp;; il commence juste en-dessous de l&rsquo;antenne d&rsquo;&eacute;mission situ&eacute;e pr&egrave;s de l&rsquo;emplacement barbecue de l&rsquo;Uetliberg. La piste se termine au-dessus de l&rsquo;arr&ecirc;t ferroviaire SZU Triemli.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Informations</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>D&eacute;nivel&eacute;</td><td>350m</td></tr><tr><td>Distance&nbsp;</td><td>3.5km</td></tr><tr><td>Largeur de la piste</td><td>30&ndash;60 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;du parcours</td><td>env. 11 en aval,<br> env. 30 en amont</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>2. Biketrail H&ouml;ckler</h3><p>Cette piste est courte, mais il y a des parties tr&egrave;s raides. Elle peut &ecirc;tre une &eacute;tape sur un tour plus long.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Informations&nbsp;</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>D&eacute;nivel&eacute;&nbsp;</td><td>100m</td></tr><tr><td>Distance&nbsp;</td><td>500m</td></tr><tr><td>Largeur de la piste</td><td>30&ndash;60cm</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@fr,
        "<p>L&rsquo;Uetliberg propone due itinerari per moutain bike: il Biketrail Triemli (chiamato anche &ldquo;Antennentrail&rdquo;, ovvero &ldquo;Tracciato dell&rsquo;antenna&rdquo;) e il Biketrail H&ouml;ckler.<h3>1. Biketrail Triemli (\"Antennentrail\")</h3><p>Questo &egrave; il pi&ugrave; grande dei due e inizia direttamente sotto il ripetitore che si trova sull&rsquo;area per grigliate dell&rsquo;Uetliberg. Il traguardo si trova sopra la stazione a monte SZU Triemli.</p><table><thead><tr><th>In sintesi</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dislivello</td><td>350m</td></tr><tr><td>Lunghezza del tracciato</td><td>3.5km</td></tr><tr><td>Larghezza del tracciato</td><td>30&ndash;60 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Tempo di percorrenza</td><td>in discesa ca. 11 minutes,<br> in salita ca. 30 minutes</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>2. Biketrail H&ouml;ckler</h3><p>L&rsquo;itinerario H&ouml;ckler Singletrail &egrave; breve, ma a tratti molto ripido. &Egrave; ideale da combinare con tour pi&ugrave; lunghi.</p><table><thead><tr><th>In sintesi</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dislivello</td><td>100m</td></tr><tr><td>Lunghezza del tracciato</td><td>500m</td></tr><tr><td>Larghezza del tracciato</td><td>30&ndash;60cm</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Der Uetliberg ist der Hausberg der Stadt Zürich. Mountainbiker:innen müssen also nicht weit reisen, um sich auf den Bike-Trails zu vergnügen."@de,
        "The Uetliberg is the local “mountain” of the city of Zurich. Thus mountain bikers do not have to travel far to have fun on some official bike trails."@en,
        "L’Uetliberg étant le sommet de la ville de Zurich, les vététistes ne doivent pas  aller loin pour  se régaler sur ses pistes VTT."@fr,
        "L’Uetliberg è il monte di Zurigo. Gli amanti della mountain bike non devono quindi andare lontano per divertirsi su due ruote."@it ;
