    schema:dateModified "2026-02-11T11:40:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Der Biketrail am Adlisberg f&uuml;hrt zuerst &uuml;ber einen eher flach abfallenden Abschnitt in Richtung des Dolder Grand Hotels und zur&uuml;ck zum Restaurant Degenried. Weiter unten wird der Track zunehmend steiler und technisch anspruchsvoller. Der Trail endet oberhalb des Elefantenbachs beim St&ouml;ckentobelweg.<table><thead><tr><th>Kurzinfo</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bergauf</td><td>27 H&ouml;henmeter</td></tr><tr><td>Bergab</td><td>178 H&ouml;henmeter</td></tr><tr><td>Streckenl&auml;nge</td><td>2.4km</td></tr><tr><td>Startpunkt</td><td>Adlisberg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B022'10.5%22N+8%C2%B035'17.9%22E/@47.3695786,8.5861083,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Endpunkt</td><td>St&ouml;ckentobelweg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B021'53.4%22N+8%C2%B034'35.8%22E/@47.3648416,8.5744133,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@de,
        "<p>The mountain bike trail on the Adlisberg initially leads over a gently sloping section down towards the Dolder Grand Hotel and back to the Restaurant Degenried. Further down, the track becomes increasingly steep and technically more demanding. The trail ends above the Elefantenbach stream by St&ouml;ckentobelweg.<table><thead><tr><th>Overview</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Uphill</td><td>27 vertical meters (89 vertical feet)</td></tr><tr><td>Downhill</td><td>178 vertical meters (584 vertical feet)</td></tr><tr><td>Trail length</td><td>2.4km (1.5 miles)</td></tr><tr><td>Start</td><td>Adlisberg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B022'10.5%22N+8%C2%B035'17.9%22E/@47.3695786,8.5861083,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Finish</td><td>St&ouml;ckentobelweg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B021'53.4%22N+8%C2%B034'35.8%22E/@47.3648416,8.5744133,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en,
        "<p>La premi&egrave;re partie de la piste cyclable &agrave; Adlisberg est plut&ocirc;t plate et vous am&egrave;ne en direction de l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Dolder Grand, puis vers le restaurant Degenried. Plus vous avancez, plus la piste devient raide et demande de la technique. Le point final se trouve au-dessus du ruisseau Elefantenbach pr&egrave;s du St&ouml;ckentobelweg.<table><thead><tr><th>Informations</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>En amont</td><td>27 m&egrave;tres d&rsquo;altitude</td></tr><tr><td>En aval</td><td>178 m&egrave;tres d&rsquo;altitude</td></tr><tr><td>Distance</td><td>2.4km</td></tr><tr><td>D&eacute;part</td><td>Adlisberg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B022'10.5%22N+8%C2%B035'17.9%22E/@47.3695786,8.5861083,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Fin</td><td>St&ouml;ckentobelweg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B021'53.4%22N+8%C2%B034'35.8%22E/@47.3648416,8.5744133,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il Biketrail Adlisberg comincia con un pezzo appena in discesa, che si dirige verso il The Dolder Grand e torna poi al ristorante Degenried. Pi&ugrave; in basso, l&rsquo;itinerario diventa sempre pi&ugrave; ripido e tecnicamente impegnativo. Il tracciato termina sopra l&rsquo;Elefantenbach, nei pressi del sentiero St&ouml;ckentobelweg.<table><thead><tr><th>In sintesi</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Salita</td><td>27 metri di dislivello</td></tr><tr><td>Discesa</td><td>178 metri di dislivello</td></tr><tr><td>Lunghezza del tracciato</td><td>2.4km</td></tr><tr><td>Partenza</td><td>Adlisberg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B022'10.5%22N+8%C2%B035'17.9%22E/@47.3695786,8.5861083,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Arrivo</td><td>sentiero St&ouml;ckentobelweg <a href=\"https://www.google.ch/maps/place/47%C2%B021'53.4%22N+8%C2%B034'35.8%22E/@47.3648416,8.5744133,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0?hl=en\">(Google Maps)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Der Biketrail am Adlisberg hat es in sich: Was mit einer flachen Abfahrt beginnt, endet in einem anspruchsvollen Track."@de,
        "The Bike Trail on the Adlisberg has plenty to offer: what starts with a gentle descent ends with a challenging track."@en,
        "La piste cyclable à Adlisberg est un vrai défi : elle commence par une descente douce, mais finit par une pente sévère."@fr,
        "L’itinerario per mountain bike dell’Adlisberg è una vera avventura: ciò che inizia in pianura finisce con una tratta oltremodo impegnativa."@it ;
    schema:geo _:Nc17a5cc77cd14db99fc3f063c0c2e56b ;
    schema:identifier "40495" ;
    schema:image [ a schema:ImageObject ;
