    schema:dateModified "2025-12-10T15:34:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Die 197 modernen und grossz&uuml;gigen Zimmer und Suiten des Sheraton Hotel im angesagten Stadtteil Z&uuml;rich-West sind warm, hell und behaglich eingerichtet. Im Restaurant <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/de/node/15919\">Route Twenty-Six</a>&nbsp;erleben G&auml;ste den wahren Steakgeschmack&nbsp;und im <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/de/node/15923\">Caf&eacute; &amp; Bar Nuovo</a> werden italienische Leckerbissen und bester&nbsp;Kaffee serviert.<p>Als Seminarhotel im urbanen Kreis 5 bietet das Sheraton acht topmoderne Veranstaltungsr&auml;ume f&uuml;r Meetings aller Art. Und in der Sheraton Club Lounge im 10. Stock hilft nicht nur der Ausblick bei der &Ouml;ffnung neuer Perspektiven, sondern auch die gem&uuml;tlichen Sitzecken und freundlichen Arbeitspl&auml;tze.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>The 197 modern and spacious rooms and suites at the Sheraton Zurich Hotel in the hip Z&uuml;rich-West quarter are warm, bright, and comfortably furnished. At the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/15919\">&ldquo;Route Twenty-Six&rdquo;</a> steakhouse,&nbsp;guests&nbsp;can savor the genuine steak flavor, while Italian delicacies and great coffee are served at the <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/15923\">Nuovo caf&eacute; &amp; bar</a>.<p>As a seminar hotel in the urban Kreis 5 district, the Sheraton offers eight state-of-the-art event rooms for meetings of all kinds. And in the Sheraton Club Lounge on the 10th floor, not only the view but also the cozy seating areas and attractive workplaces help to open up new perspectives.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Les 197 chambres et suites tendance et spacieuses de l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Sheraton du quartier branch&eacute; de Z&uuml;rich-West sont chaleureuses, lumineuses et luxueusement am&eacute;nag&eacute;es. Le restaurant <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/fr/node/15919\">Route Twenty-Six</a> &nbsp;offre le go&ucirc;t authentique du steak et le <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/fr/node/15923\">Caf&eacute; &amp; Bar Nuovo</a> sert de d&eacute;licieux plats italiens et le meilleur caf&eacute;.<p>L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel pour s&eacute;minaires Sheraton du 5e arr. dispose de huit salles &eacute;v&eacute;nementielles ultramodernes pour tous types de r&eacute;unions. La vue extraordinaire depuis le 10e &eacute;tage du Sheraton Club Lounge ouvre de nouvelles perspectives tout comme les tr&egrave;s accueillants coins salon et espaces de travail.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Moderne e ampie, le 197 camere e suite dello Sheraton Hotel, nel popolare quartiere di Z&uuml;rich-West, sono accoglienti, luminose e confortevoli. Al ristorante<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/it/node/15919\"> Route Twenty-Six</a>, gli ospiti possono assaporare il genuino gusto della bistecca, mentre al <a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/it/node/15923\">Caf&eacute; &amp; Bar Nuovo</a> si servono prelibatezze italiane e ottimo caff&egrave;.<p>Essendo un hotel per seminari nell&rsquo;urbano Kreis 5, lo Sheraton propone otto sale riunioni modernissime per meeting di ogni genere. Nella Sheraton Club Lounge, al 10&deg; piano, non &egrave; solo la vista che aiuta ad aprire nuovi orizzonti, ma anche le comode sedute e le accoglienti postazioni di lavoro.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im jungen Stadtteil Zürich-West befindet sich das Sheraton Zürich umgeben von internationalen Unternehmen, angesagten Bars und Restaurants sowie zahlreichen Galerien und Museen."@de,
        "The Sheraton Zurich is located in the up-and-coming quarter of Zürich-West, surrounded by international companies, on-trend bars and restaurants, and numerous galleries and museums."@en,
        "Le Sheraton Zurich situé dans le jeune quartier de Zürich-West est entouré d’entreprises internationales, de bars et de restaurants branchés ainsi que de nombreux musées et galeries."@fr,
        "Nel giovane quartiere di Zürich-West si trova lo Sheraton Zürich, circondato da aziende internazionali, bar e ristoranti alla moda e numerosi musei e gallerie."@it ;
