    schema:description "<p>Sattel-Hochstuckli pr&auml;sentiert sich im Winter als familienfreundliches Skigebiet, weil es zentral gelegen, preiswert und &uuml;berschaubar ist. Mit zahlreichen blauen und einigen roten Pisten ist es auch f&uuml;r Skianf&auml;nger:innen sehr gut geeignet. Mehrere Skilifte erschliessen das Wintersportgel&auml;nde in einer traumhaften Bergwelt.<br>Die j&uuml;ngsten G&auml;ste k&ouml;nnen sich auf der Piste zwischen Comicfiguren vergn&uuml;gen und lernen auf den Kinderliften das ABC des Skifahrens. Die Eltern k&ouml;nnen live dabei sein und ihre Liebsten beim Ski- oder Snowboard fahren begleiten.&nbsp;<table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Anreisezeit vom Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich</strong></td><td>87&nbsp;Minuten mit dem Zug<br>40 Minuten mit dem Auto</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gr&ouml;sse</strong></td><td>7 Pisten-Km</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Anlagen</strong></td><td>2 Lifte<br>2 Pisten<br>2 Rodel-Piste<br>2 Freeride-Pisten<br>Rondos Anf&auml;nger- und Kinderland</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Besonderheiten</strong></td><td>Die Fussg&auml;nger:innen-H&auml;ngebr&uuml;cke &laquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/de/node/2919\">Skywalk</a>&raquo;<br>Drehgondelbahn &laquo;Stuckli Rondo&raquo;</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@de,
        "<p>Hochstuckli is winter&rsquo;s ideal friendly family ski area, because it is centrally located, reasonably priced and small enough to keep track of everyone. With numerous blue and a few red ski runs it is perfectly suited for beginners as well. Several ski lifts serve an ideal winter sports area in a perfect mountain world.&nbsp;<p>The youngest guests can have a good time among the comic figures and learn the basics of skiing on the children&rsquo;s lifts. The parents can join them and accompany their youngsters as they ski or snowboard.&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Travel time from Zurich Main Train Station</strong></td><td>87&nbsp;minutes by public transport<br>41 minutes by car</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Size</strong></td><td>7km (4.5&nbsp;miles) of pistes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installations</strong></td><td>2 mountain transport facilities<br>2 ski pistes<br>2 toboggan run<br>2 freeride slopes<br>Rondo's beginner and children's slope</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special features</strong></td><td>Foot suspension bridge, &ldquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/en/node/2919\">Skywalk</a>&rdquo;, 374m (1,227ft) long and 58m (190ft) above the ground, also open in winter<br>Stuckli Rondo revolving gondola</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La station de ski familiale de Sattel-Hochstuckli, en situation centrale, propose un domaine skiable de dimensions raisonnables et aux prix abordables. On y trouve de nombreuses pistes bleues et quelques rouges, ce qui convient &nbsp;parfaitement aux d&eacute;butants. Plusieurs remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques donnent acc&egrave;s &agrave; ce domaine aux paysages montagneux idylliques.&nbsp;<p>Les plus petits peuvent s'amuser sur les pistes parmi des personnages de bande dessin&eacute;e et apprendre les bases du ski sur les t&eacute;l&eacute;skis qui leur sont r&eacute;serv&eacute;s. Les parents peuvent les accompagner dans leurs tentatives de pratique du ski et du snowboard.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Temps de voyage depuis la gare centrale de Zurich</strong></td><td>1h27&nbsp;en transports en commun<br>41 minutes en voiture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimension</strong></td><td>7 km de pistes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installations</strong></td><td>2 remont&eacute;es m&eacute;caniques<br>2 pistes de ski<br>2 piste de luge<br>2 piste per il freeride<br>Rondos parcour pour d&eacute;butant-e-s et enfants</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Particularit&eacute;</strong></td><td>Le pont suspendu pour pi&eacute;tons &laquo;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/fr/node/2919\">Skywalk</a>&nbsp;&raquo;<br>T&eacute;l&eacute;cabines tournantes &laquo;&nbsp;Stuckli Rondo&nbsp;&raquo;</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>In inverno, Sattel-Hochstuckli si presenta come un carosello a misura di famiglie, grazie alla posizione centrale, ai prezzi vantaggiosi e alle dimensioni contenute. Con numerose piste blu e alcune rosse, &egrave; adatto anche a chi &egrave; alle prime armi. Diversi skilift consentono di esplorare il comprensorio e i suoi paesaggi incantevoli.<p>I pi&ugrave; piccoli possono divertirsi in pista tra i personaggi dei fumetti e imparare l'ABC dello sci sugli impianti di risalita per bambini. I genitori, invece, possono accompagnare i figli mentre sciano o praticano snowboard.&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Tempo di tragitto dalla Stazione Centrale di Zurigo</strong></td><td>87&nbsp;minuti con i trasporti pubblici<br>41 minuti di macchina</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensione</strong></td><td>7 km di piste</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Impianti</strong></td><td>2 skilift<br>2 piste da sci<br>2 pista per slittini<br>2 pistes de freeride<br>Area per principianti e bambini del Rondo</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Particolarit&agrave;</strong></td><td>Il ponte pedonale sospeso &ldquo;<a href=\"https://www.zuerich.com/it/node/2919\">Skywalk</a>&rdquo;<br>Funivia girevole &ldquo;Stuckli Rondo&rdquo;</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Skifahren & Snowboarden: In nur 41 Minuten erreicht man mit Auto von Zürich aus das Familien-Skigebiet Sattel-Hochstuckli."@de,
        "Skiing & Snowboarding: You get to the family-friendly Sattel-Hochstuckli skiing region in just 41 minutes by car from Zurich."@en,
        "Ski et snowboard : Depuis Zurich, 41 minutes à peine sont nécessaires pour rejoindre la station de ski familiale de Sattel-Hochstuckli."@fr,
        "Sci e snowboard : Da Zurigo, il comprensorio sciistico per famiglie di Sattel-Hochstuckli si raggiunge in soli 41 minuti di macchina."@it ;
