    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p><strong>RRRevolve Fair Fashion</strong><br> Niederdorfstrasse 17<br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich&nbsp;<br> Montag bis Freitag: 11.00 Uhr &ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br> Samstag: 11.00 Uhr &ndash; 18.00 Uhr<p><strong>RRRevolve Fair Fashion &amp; Eco Design Store</strong><br> Zollstrasse 117<br> 8005 Z&uuml;rich<br> Montag bis Freitag: 11.00 Uhr &ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br> Samstag: 11.00 Uhr &ndash; 18.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p><strong>RRRevolve Fair Fashion</strong><br> Niederdorfstrasse 17<br> 8001 Z&uuml;rich<br> Monday &ndash; Friday, 11am &ndash; 7pm<br> Saturday, 11am &ndash; 6pm<p><strong>RRRevolve Fair Fashion &amp; Eco Design Store</strong><br> Zollstrasse 117<br> 8005 Z&uuml;rich<br> Monday &ndash; Friday, 11am &ndash; 7pm<br> Saturday, 11am &ndash; 6pm</p></p>"@en,
