        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>RRREVOLVE steht f&uuml;r nachhaltig und fair produzierte Alternativen f&uuml;r den Alltag. In drei sorgf&auml;ltig kuratierten L&auml;den (zwei davon in Z&uuml;rich) finden Modebewusste Sneakers, Jeans, Kleider, Pullover und Jacken von Marken wie Veja, Armedangels, Colorful Standard, Nikin, Sandwvist, Qwstion und vielen mehr.<p>Seit 2010 sucht RRREVOLVE Produkte, die dabei helfen, Abfall zu vermeiden, Umweltverschmutzung zu vermindern, Energie zu sparen, faire L&ouml;hne zu f&ouml;rdern und soziale Unternehmen zu unterst&uuml;tzen. Wer bei RRREVOLVE einkauft, ist ein Teil der Bewegung, der unsere Welt in die richtige Richtung lenkt.</p><p>Als One-Man-Show begonnen, ist RRREVOLVE mit dem Flagship-Store an der Zollstrasse im jungen Quartier um den Hauptbahnhof Z&uuml;rich heute bereits Kult in Z&uuml;rich.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>RRREVOLVE stands for sustainably and fairly produced alternatives for everyday life. In three carefully curated stores (two of them in Zurich), fashion lovers can find sneakers, jeans, dresses, sweaters, and jackets from such brands as Veja, Armedangels, Colorful Standard, Nikin, Sandwvist, Qwstion, and many more.<p>Since 2010, RRREVOLVE has been seeking out products that help to prevent waste, reduce pollution, save energy, promote fair wages, and support social enterprises. Those who shop at RRREVOLVE are part of the movement to steer our world in the right direction.</p><p>Started as a one-person show, RRREVOLVE has already achieved cult status with its flagship store on Zollstrasse, situated in the up-and-coming neighborhood around Zurich Main Station.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>RRREVOLVE est synonyme d&rsquo;alternatives de production durable et &eacute;quitable pour le quotidien. Dans trois magasins (dont deux &agrave; Zurich) aux articles soigneusement s&eacute;lectionn&eacute;s, les personnes sensibles &agrave; la mode trouvent des baskets, des jeans, des robes, des pulls et des vestes de marques telles que Veja, Armedangels, Colorful Standard, Nikin, Sandwvist, Qwstion et bien d&rsquo;autres.<p>Depuis 2010, RRREVOLVE recherche des produits qui aident &agrave; &eacute;viter les d&eacute;chets, &agrave; r&eacute;duire la pollution, &agrave; &eacute;conomiser l&rsquo;&eacute;nergie, &agrave; favoriser des salaires &eacute;quitables et &agrave; soutenir des entreprises sociales. Acheter chez RRREVOLVE, c&rsquo;est faire partie du mouvement qui fait avancer notre monde dans la bonne direction.</p><p>Ayant commenc&eacute; comme one-man-show, RRREVOLVE est aujourd&rsquo;hui un magasin culte &agrave; Zurich. Sa boutique phare se trouve &agrave; la Zollstrasse, dans le nouveau quartier autour de la gare centrale de Zurich.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>RRREVOLVE &egrave; sinonimo di alternative sostenibili ed equosolidali per tutti i giorni. All&rsquo;interno di tre negozi incredibilmente curati, di cui due a Zurigo, gli appassionati di moda trovano sneakers, jeans, vestiti, maglioni e giacche di marche quali Veja, Armedangels, Colorful Standard, Nikin, Sandwvist, Qwstion e tante altre.<p>Dal 2010, RRREVOLVE cerca prodotti che aiutino a evitare rifiuti e a ridurre l&rsquo;inquinamento, a risparmiare energia, a promuovere stipendi equi e a sostenere imprese sociali. Chi acquista da RRREVOLVE &egrave; parte del movimento che orienta il nostro pianeta nella direzione giusta.</p><p>Iniziato come one-man-show con il suo flagship store nella Zollstrasse, nel giovane quartiere che abbraccia la Stazione Centrale di Zurigo, oggi RRREVOLVE &egrave; culto.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Den Laden für faire Mode, nachhaltige Produkte und Eco Design gibt’s in Zürich gleich zwei Mal."@de,
        "The store for fair fashion, sustainable products, and eco design can be found not once, but twice in Zurich."@en,
        "La boutique de mode équitable, produits durables et design écologique a deux succursales à Zurich."@fr,
        "Il negozio di moda equosolidale, prodotti sostenibili e design ecologico ha ben due filiali a Zurigo."@it ;
    schema:email "info@rrrevolve.ch" ;
