    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Sportbereich:<p>Montag bis Freitag, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00 Uhr<br> Samstag, 10.00&nbsp;&ndash; 19.00 Uhr<br> Sonntag, 10.00 &ndash; 19.00 Uhr</p><p>Genussbereich:</p><p>Montag bis Mittwoch, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00 Uhr<br> Donnerstag bis Samstag, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00 Uhr<br> Sonntag, 11.30 &ndash; 20.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Sports area:<p>Monday &minus; Friday, 11.30am &ndash; 10pm<br> Saturday, 10am &ndash; 7pm<br> Sunday, 10am &minus; 7pm</p><p>Pleasure area:</p><p>Monday &minus; Wednesday, 11.30am &ndash; 10pm<br> Thursday to Saturday, 11.30am &ndash; 10pm<br> Sunday, 11.30am &ndash; 8pm</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Domaine sportif :<p>Du lundi au vendredi, 11h30 &ndash; 22h<br> Samedi, 10h &ndash; 19h<br> Dimanche, 10h &ndash; 19h</p><p>Zone de restauration&nbsp;:</p><p>Du lundi au mercredi, 11h30 &ndash; 22h<br> Du jeudi au samedi, 11h30 &ndash;&nbsp;22h<br> Dimanche, 11h30 &ndash; 20h&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Area sportiva:<p>da luned&igrave; a venerd&igrave;, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00<br> sabato, 10.00 &ndash; 19.00<br> domenica, 10.00 &ndash; 19.00</p><p>Area gastronomica:</p><p>da luned&igrave; a mercoled&igrave;, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00<br> gioved&igrave; a sabato, 11.30 &ndash; 22.00<br> domenica, 11.30 &ndash; 20.00</p></p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Eine der grössten Zwischennutzungen der Schweiz begeistert sportliche wie hungrige Besucher in Zug."@de,
        "One of Switzerland’s largest temporary concepts enthralls both sporty and hungry visitors in Zug."@en,
        "L’une des utilisations intermédiares majeures de Suisse séduit sportifs/ives comme affamé(e)s à Zoug."@fr,
        "Uno dei riusi temporanei più grandi della Svizzera entusiasma gli sportivi e gli affamati di Zugo."@it ;
