    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Aus einer alten S&auml;gerei ist mit viel Herzblut die heimelige &laquo;sagibeiz&raquo; entstanden.&nbsp; Heute bietet die alte Spinnerei am Walensee einzigartige R&auml;umlichkeiten f&uuml;r Feiern, Tagungen oder Seminare.<p>Die Location ist ideal f&uuml;r Privat- und Firmenanl&auml;sse mit bis zu 800 Personen geeignet. Gruppen bis 250 Personen finden in den Eventlokalit&auml;ten sagist&uuml;bli, sagisteg/seeg&uuml;etli mit dazugeh&ouml;rigem Aussenbereich und Holzlager/Schienenterrasse eine ideale Location f&uuml;r Hochzeiten, Geburtstage, Firmenfeiern und vieles mehr.&nbsp;</p><p>Die R&auml;umlichkeiten sind modern ausgestattet und das Haus verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber hochwertige Musik- und Lichtanlagen. Das hauseigene Lofthotel bietet seinen G&auml;sten komfortable Zimmer, teilweise mit Seesicht.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Saalname</th><th>Konferenz /<br>Theater</th><th>Seminar</th><th>U-Form /<br>Block</th><th>Bankett</th><th>Empfang /<br>Cocktail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Sagibeiz</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>150</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>St&uuml;bli</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>16</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Gondeli</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>8</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Sagisteg</th><td>150</td><td>60</td><td>60</td><td>110</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>Seeg&uuml;etli (kann mit Sagisteg zusammengelegt werden)</th><td>100</td><td>60</td><td>60</td><td>130</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>Plattform am See f&uuml;r Zeremonien</th><td>120</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Seeg&uuml;etli aussen f&uuml;r Zeremonien</th><td>80</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Eventhalle</th><td>400</td><td>150</td><td>100</td><td>250</td><td>400</td></tr><tr><th>Diverse Seminarr&auml;ume</th><td>10 &ndash; 60</td><td>10 &ndash; 40</td><td>10 &ndash; 30</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@de,
        "<p>With a lot of heart and soul, an old sawmill has been transformed into the cozy \"sagibeiz\". &nbsp;Today, the old spinning mill on Lake Walen offers unique premises for celebrations, conferences and seminars.<p>The location is ideal for private and corporate events for up to 800 people. Groups of up to 250 people will find an ideal venue for weddings, birthdays, company celebrations and much more in the areas \"sagist&uuml;bli\", \"sagisteg\", \"seeg&uuml;etli\" with associated outdoor area and \"holzlager\" (wood store)/\"schienenterrasse\" (rail terrace).</p><p>The event spaces are equipped with modern facilities and high-quality music and lighting systems. The in-house Lofthotel offers its guests comfortable rooms, some with lake views.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Room name</th><th>Conference /<br>Theater</th><th>Classroom</th><th>U-shape /<br>Block</th><th>Banquet</th><th>Reception /<br>Cocktail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Sagibeiz</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>150</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>St&uuml;bli</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>16</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Gondeli</th><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>8</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Sagisteg</th><td>150</td><td>60</td><td>60</td><td>110</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>Seeg&uuml;etli (can be combined with Sagisteg)</th><td>100</td><td>60</td><td>60</td><td>130</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>Platform by the lake for ceremonies</th><td>120</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Seeg&uuml;etli for outdoor ceremonies</th><td>80</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><th>Event hall</th><td>400</td><td>150</td><td>100</td><td>250</td><td>400</td></tr><tr><th>Various meeting rooms</th><td>10 &ndash; 60</td><td>10 &ndash; 40</td><td>10 &ndash; 30</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr></tbody></table></p>"@en ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Die alte Spinnerei direkt am Walensee verleiht Tagungen, Meetings und Feiern eine spektakuläre Kulisse."@de,
        "The old spinning mill directly on Lake Walen provides a spectacular backdrop for conferences, meetings, and celebrations."@en ;
