    namiont:textTeaser "Hier ist Teamarbeit gefragt: Gruppen, Freunde und Vereine meistern im Team diverse Missionen."@de,
        "Teamwork is required here: groups, friends, and clubs tackle various missions together as a team."@en,
        "Ici les groupes, amis et associations s’acquittent des missions essentiellement en équipe."@fr,
        "Qui si deve collaborare: team, amici e associazioni affrontano varie missioni in gruppo."@it ;
