            schema:name "Free high speed internet connection" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-11-10T11:10:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>An bester Lage steht das erste Pop-up-Hotel Z&uuml;richs. Direkt am Ufer der Limmat und unmittelbar an der Tramstation Rudolf-Brun-Br&uuml;cke&nbsp;gelegen, begr&uuml;sst das Hotel Krone G&auml;ste in 28 individuell gestalteten Zimmern.<p>Das bald 500-j&auml;hrige Haus wurde bereits fr&uuml;her als Hotel genutzt und erlebt nun &ndash; nach einer kompletten Auffrischung&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;bis Ende Oktober 2024&nbsp;ein Revival.</p><p>Duschen und Toiletten befinden sich auf der Etage und werden von den G&auml;sten geteilt. Ohne TV, Minibar und Klimaanlage eignet sich diese Unterkunft f&uuml;r G&auml;ste, die m&ouml;glichst zentral &uuml;bernachten m&ouml;chten, dabei aber auf das Budget achten.</p><p>Mit unz&auml;hligen Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s und Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten in Laufdistanz ist das Pop-up-Hotel Krone ideal f&uuml;r spannende St&auml;dtetrips.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Zurich&rsquo;s first pop-up hotel lies in a prime location. Standing directly on the banks of the River Limmat and next to the &ldquo;Rudolf-Brun-Br&uuml;cke&rdquo; tram stop, the Krone offers its guests 28 individually designed rooms.<p>The building &ndash; which will shortly celebrate its 500th anniversary &ndash;, was previously used as a hotel and having undergone complete renovation is now experiencing a revival until at least the end of October 2024.</p><p>Shared showers and toilets can be found on each floor. Without TV, minibar, and air conditioning, this accommodation is suitable for guests who want to stay in an as central a location as possible but still keep an eye on their budget.</p><p>With countless restaurants, caf&eacute;s, and places of interest within walking distance, the&nbsp;Pop Up Hotel Krone Zurich is ideal for exciting city breaks.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>L&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel Krone, premier h&ocirc;tel pop-up de Zurich, est tr&egrave;s bien situ&eacute; au bord de la Limmat et non loin de l&rsquo;arr&ecirc;t de tram Rudolf-Brun-Br&uuml;cke. Il accueille ses h&ocirc;tes dans 28 chambres personnalis&eacute;es.<p>Ce b&acirc;timent qui aura bient&ocirc;t 500 ans et servait d&eacute;j&agrave; autrefois d&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel conna&icirc;t, apr&egrave;s avoir &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;nov&eacute;, une v&eacute;ritable renaissance qui durera au minimum jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; fin octobre 2024.</p><p>Les douches et toilettes &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;tage sont communes. Ne poss&eacute;dant ni t&eacute;l&eacute;vision ni minibar ni syst&egrave;me de climatisation, cet h&ocirc;tel est id&eacute;al pour ceux et celles qui, bien que disposant d&rsquo;un budget limit&eacute;, d&eacute;sirent s&eacute;journer en ville.</p><p>Gr&acirc;ce &agrave; la proximit&eacute; de nombreux restaurants, caf&eacute;s et sites touristiques accessibles &agrave; pied, l&rsquo;h&ocirc;tel pop-up Krone est id&eacute;al pour de passionnants s&eacute;jours en ville.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Il primo hotel pop-up di Zurigo si trova in posizione ideale. Adagiato sulle sponde della Limmat e vicinissimo alla fermata del tram Rudolf-Brun-Br&uuml;cke, l&rsquo;Hotel Krone accoglie i suoi ospiti con 28 camere individuali.<p>L&rsquo;edificio, che tra poco compir&agrave; 500 anni, era gi&agrave; stato usato in passato come albergo. Ora, dopo una ristrutturazione totale, vivr&agrave; un revival almeno fino alla fine di ottobre 2024.</p><p>Docce e bagni si trovano al piano e vengono condivisi dai clienti. Sprovvisto di TV, minibar e aria condizionata, questo alloggio &egrave; adatto a chi vuole stare in posizione centrale senza spendere troppo.</p><p>Innumerevoli ristoranti, caff&egrave; e attrazioni sono raggiungibili a piedi e fanno dell&rsquo;hotel pop-up Krone il luogo ideale per city trip indimenticabili.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Zürichs erstes Pop-up-Hotel steht an zentralster Lage zwischen Altstadt und Hauptbahnhof."@de,
        "Zurich’s first pop-up hotel lies in a central location between the Old Town and the Main Station."@en,
        "Le premier hôtel pop-up de Zurich est très bien situé entre la vieille ville et la gare centrale."@fr,
        "Il primo hotel pop-up di Zurigo si trova in posizione centralissima, fra la città vecchia e la Stazione Centrale."@it ;
