    schema:dateModified "2025-11-26T04:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<p>Gem&uuml;tliches Hotel mit pers&ouml;nlicher Atmosph&auml;re. Renovierte 1-3 Bett-Zimmer auch mit Dusche, WC, TV, Telefon. Sehr ruhige Lage in der City, 10 Gehminuten vom Zentrum, sehr gute Tram- und Busverbindungen in alle Richtungen. Preise inklusive Taxen. Geb&uuml;hrenfreies WLAN.</p>"@de,
        "<p>Urban explorers can find the Saint Georges Hotel just a few minutes&rsquo; walk from the central tram stop, &ldquo;Stauffacher&rdquo;. Situated near the leafy Hallwylplatz, it is the perfect starting point for exploring the city. In this popular urban quarter, boutiques stand shoulder to shoulder with designer stores, numerous restaurants, and bars.<p>The Saint Georges Hotel has 4 room categories with 1&#8210;3 beds. It is therefore suitable not only for friends and families, but also for business travelers. All rooms are equipped with Wi-Fi, TV, and telephone and are bright and comfortably furnished. In the morning, guests can fortify themselves at the breakfast buffet before setting off to discover Zurich.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Petit h&ocirc;tel confortable. Chambres r&eacute;nov&eacute;es &agrave; 1-3 lits. Aussi avec douche, WC, TV, t&eacute;l&eacute;phone. Bien situ&eacute; dans un endroit tranquille, pr&egrave;s du centre-ville (10 minutes &agrave; pieds). Correspondences excellentes et rapides de transports publics. Les taxes sont inclus. WLAN gratuit.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Confortevole e con atmosfera familiare. Camere singole e doppie rinnovate, anche con doccia, WC, TV, telefono. Posizione centrale. Zona tranquilla della citt&agrave;. Collegamenti eccellenti dei trasporti pubblici. Taxes incluso. WLAN gratuito.</p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Mitten im beliebten Kreis 4 steht das Saint Georges Hotel am lauschigen Hallwylplatz."@de,
        "The Saint Georges Hotel is located in the heart of the popular Kreis 4 district, near the leafy Hallwylplatz."@en,
        "L’hôtel Saint Georges de la charmante place Hallwyplatz est situé au cœur du très prisé  4e arrondissement."@fr,
        "Nel cuore del popolare Kreis 4, sulla tranquilla Hallwylplaatz, si trova l’Hotel Saint Georges."@it ;
