    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Seit 1937 steht Heinicke f&uuml;r gute Schweizer Uhren &ndash; an bester Lage, direkt am Limmatquai, zu F&uuml;ssen des historischen Grossm&uuml;nsters. Besucher:innen erwarten eine erlesene Auswahl renommierter Marken wie Longines, Rado, Mido, Hamilton, Tissot, Certina, Edox, Claude Meylan und Timeless. Hier vereinen sich modernes Design und h&ouml;chste Pr&auml;zision zu zeitlosen Schmuckst&uuml;cken.<p>Das erfahrene Team bietet Ihnen pers&ouml;nliche Beratung, Batteriewechsel und Reparaturen, damit Ihre Uhr nicht nur stilvoll aussieht, sondern auch zuverl&auml;ssig bleibt &ndash; all das in einem charmanten, stilvoll eingerichteten Laden, der zum Verweilen und Entdecken einl&auml;dt.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Since 1937 Heinicke is synonymous with good Swiss watches &ndash; in prime location on Limmatquai with the Grossm&uuml;nster church just a stone&rsquo;s throw away. Clients and visitors enjoy an exquisite range of prestigious brands such as Longines, Rado, Mido, Hamilton, Tissot, Certina, Timeless, Edox and Claude Meylan &ndash; these timeless pieces of jewelry combine modern design with the high-precision art of watchmaking.<p>To ensure that your watch doesn&rsquo;t only look stylish, but also remains on time at every moment, the experienced staff is here to give professional advice, do battery change and repairs. All of this in a charming and stylish store that invites you to take your time and discover.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Depuis 1937, Heinicke est synonyme de montres suisses de qualit&eacute;. Le magasin jouit d&rsquo;une excellente situation sur le Limmatquai, au pied de l&rsquo;historique Grossm&uuml;nster. On y d&eacute;couvre une s&eacute;lection de marques renomm&eacute;es telles que Longines, Rado, Mido, Hamilton, Tissot, Certina, Edox, Claude Meylan et Timeless. Ici, l&rsquo;alliance de design moderne et de pr&eacute;cision maximale donne naissance &agrave; des bijoux intemporels.<p>Dans la boutique charmante et &eacute;l&eacute;gante qui vous invite &agrave; fl&acirc;ner et &agrave; d&eacute;couvrir, l&rsquo;&eacute;quipe exp&eacute;riment&eacute;e vous offre conseils personnalis&eacute;s, changement de pile et r&eacute;parations, afin que votre montre soit non seulement &eacute;l&eacute;gante, mais aussi fiable.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Dal 1937, Heinicke &egrave; sinonimo di orologi svizzeri di qualit&agrave; in posizione ottimale, direttamente sul Limmatquai, ai piedi della storica chiesa di Grossm&uuml;nster. Ad attendere i visitatori c&rsquo;&egrave; un&rsquo;accurata selezione di marche famose come Longines, Rado, Mido, Hamilton, Tissot, Certina, Edox, Claude Meylan e Timeless. Qui, design moderno e massima precisione si fondono per creare gioielli intramontabili.<p>L&rsquo;esperto team offre consulenze individuali, sostituzione delle pile e riparazioni, affinch&eacute; gli orologi non siano solo eleganti, ma anche affidabili. Il tutto in un negozio suggestivo e arredato con gusto, che invita a rallentare e scoprire.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Edle Markenuhren am Limmatquai seit 1937"@de,
        "Renowned Swiss watch brands on Limmatquai since 1937"@en,
        "Montres de marque élégantes sur le quai de la Limmat depuis 1937"@fr,
        "Raffinati orologi di marca sul Limmatquai dal 1937"@it ;
