        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Endlich hat auch Z&uuml;rich einen Ableger der bekannten Igniv-Restaurants von Spitzenkoch Andreas Caminada: Igniv bedeutet auf R&auml;toromanisch &laquo;Nest&raquo;. Und so ist das Restaurant im Herzen des Niederdorfs ein Gourmet-Nest f&uuml;r Gourmet-V&ouml;gel aus aller Welt.<p>In den Igniv-Restaurants teilen die G&auml;ste die kulinarischen Kreationen aus der Spitzenk&uuml;che: Dieses Fine-Dining-Sharing-Konzept ist jeweils dem Standort individuell angepasst, enth&auml;lt aber auch sogenannte Signature Dishes von Caminada.</p><p>Das Innendesign richtet sich nach der Vorgeschichte des Hauses und verweist mit viel Stoff und schweren Vorh&auml;ngen an die Zeit als Theater und Variet&eacute;.</p><p>Abweichend zu allen bisherigen Igniv-Standorten besitzt die Dependance in Z&uuml;rich eine Bar. Hier geniessen G&auml;ste eigens f&uuml;r das Igniv kreierte Drinks.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Finally Zurich is home to an offshoot of the famous Igniv restaurants by elite chef Andreas Caminada. Igniv means &ldquo;nest&rdquo; in Romansch &#8210; and thus the restaurant in the heart of the Niederdorf quarter is a gourmet nest for food-loving birds from all over the world.<p>At the Igniv restaurants, guests share the culinary creations that make their way from the kitchen onto the table. This fine dining sharing concept is individually adapted to each location, but it always includes Caminada&rsquo;s signature dishes.</p><p>The interior design, with its abundance of fabric and heavy drapes, reflects the history of the building, which once housed a theater and vaudeville shows.</p><p>In contrast to all the other Igniv locations, the Zurich restaurant has a bar. Here guests can enjoy drinks that have been specially created for the Igniv.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Zurich compte enfin un des c&eacute;l&egrave;bres restaurants Igniv du grand chef Andreas Caminada.&nbsp;&laquo;&nbsp;Igniv&nbsp;&raquo; signifie &laquo;&nbsp;nid&nbsp;&raquo; en rh&eacute;to-roman. En effet, le restaurant au c&oelig;ur du Niederdorf est un nid gastronomique pour les oiseaux gourmets du monde entier.<p>Dans les restaurants Igniv, les clients partagent les cr&eacute;ations culinaires de la grande cuisine. Ce concept de partage de repas raffin&eacute;s est adapt&eacute; individuellement &agrave; chaque lieu, mais comprend &eacute;galement des plats dits &laquo;&nbsp;signature&nbsp;dishes &raquo; de Caminada.</p><p>La d&eacute;coration int&eacute;rieure est bas&eacute;e sur l&rsquo;histoire de la maison&nbsp;: avec beaucoup de tissus et de rideaux lourds, elle fait r&eacute;f&eacute;rence &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;poque o&ugrave; la maison abritait un th&eacute;&acirc;tre de vari&eacute;t&eacute;.</p><p>Contrairement &agrave; toutes les autres succursales d&rsquo;Igniv, celle de Zurich dispose d&rsquo;un bar. Les clients y d&eacute;gustent des boissons sp&eacute;cialement cr&eacute;&eacute;es pour l&rsquo;Igniv.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Finalmente anche Zurigo pu&ograve; vantare una filiale dei famosi ristoranti Igniv dello chef Andreas Caminada. In Ladino, Igniv significa &ldquo;nido&rdquo;. Il ristorante nel cuore del Niederdorf &egrave; quindi un nido gourmet per buongustai di tutto il mondo.<p>Nei ristoranti Igniv, gli ospiti condividono le creazioni culinarie preparate dalla straordinaria cucina: questo concept che combina fine dining e sharing viene adattato alla relativa filiale, ma non mancano i cosiddetti &ldquo;signature dish&rdquo; di Caminada.</p><p>Gli interni rispettano la storia dell&rsquo;edificio: con tante stoffe e tende pesanti, ricordano i tempi in cui era un teatro e variet&agrave;.</p><p>A differenza di tutte le altre filiali Igniv, quella di Zurigo vanta un bar, nel quale gli ospiti sorseggiano drink appositamente creati per il locale.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Fine-Dining und Sharing-Konzept in einem: Das bietet das Spitzenrestaurant Igniv von Andreas Caminada."@de,
        "Fine dining and sharing concept all in one: that is what is on offer at the top restaurant, Igniv by Andreas Caminada."@en,
        "Repas raffinés et partage, deux concepts en un : c’est ce que propose le prestigieux restaurant Igniv d’Andreas Caminada."@fr,
        "Fine dining e condivisione in uno: è ciò che offre il blasonato ristorante Igniv di Andreas Caminada."@it ;
    schema:geo _:N8283cc9c133644558eeb33b07d3e959e ;
    schema:identifier "556181" ;
