        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Das angesagte Magazin Monocle von Tyler Br&ucirc;l&eacute; kennen Medienschaffende, Designer und Gesch&auml;ftsleute weltweit. In Z&uuml;rich aber steht das Flagship Caf&eacute; des internationalen Brands.<p>An der Dufourstrasse in unmittelbarer N&auml;he zum Z&uuml;richsee verstr&ouml;mt das Caf&eacute; weltoffenen Flair. Und w&auml;hrend in den Redaktionsr&auml;umen nebenan fleissig geschrieben wird und Radiosendungen aufgezeichnet werden, geniessen G&auml;ste auf der Terrasse einen Kaffee sowie diverse Snacks. Darunter butterzarte Croissants von Seri Backhandwerk oder herzhafte Sandwiches und japanische Patisserie.</p><p>Im Shop st&ouml;bern Liebhaber/-innen sch&ouml;ner Produkte durch das ausgesuchte Sortiment an Zeitschriften, B&uuml;chern, Schreibutensilien und eleganter Kleidung.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Tyler Br&ucirc;l&eacute;&rsquo;s trendy magazine, Monocle, is known among media professionals, designers, and business people worldwide. However, the flagship caf&eacute; run by this international brand can be found in Zurich.<p>Located on Dufourstrasse, in the immediate vicinity of Lake Zurich, the caf&eacute; exudes a cosmopolitan ambiance. While the magazine editors are busy writing and recording radio shows next door, guests enjoy a coffee and various snacks on the terrace. These include buttery croissants from Seri Backhandwerk, tasty sandwiches and japanese desserts.</p><p>In the store, people who love beautiful things can browse through the range of selected magazines, books, writing utensils, and elegant clothing.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Le tr&egrave;s branch&eacute; magazine Monocle de Tyler Br&ucirc;l&eacute; est bien connu des m&eacute;dias, designers et femmes et hommes d&rsquo;affaires du monde entier. Zurich abrite un caf&eacute; de cette marque internationale.<p>Situ&eacute; dans la rue Dufourstrasse &agrave; proximit&eacute; imm&eacute;diate du lac de Zurich, ce caf&eacute; poss&egrave;de un charme cosmopolite. Alors que dans les locaux de la r&eacute;daction d&rsquo;&agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; on se d&eacute;die assid&ucirc;ment &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;criture et &agrave; l&rsquo;enregistrement d&rsquo;&eacute;missions radio, les clients peuvent appr&eacute;cier leur caf&eacute; et diff&eacute;rents encas sur la terrasse, mais aussi les croissants moelleux de la boulangerie Seri, des d&eacute;licieux sandwichs&nbsp;ou de patisserie japonaise.</p><p>La boutique propose un superbe assortiment de magazines, livres, instruments d&rsquo;&eacute;criture et v&ecirc;tements &eacute;l&eacute;gants.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>La popolare rivista Monocle, edita da Tyler Br&ucirc;l&eacute;, &egrave; conosciuta in tutto il mondo da media maker, designer e uomini d&rsquo;affari. A Zurigo si trova uno dei caff&egrave; del brand internazionale.<p>Nella Dufourstrasse, vicinissimo al Lago di Zurigo, il caff&egrave; diffonde un&rsquo;atmosfera internazionale. E, mentre nei locali della redazione adiacente si scrive senza sosta e si registrano trasmissioni radio, gli ospiti sulla terrazza gustano un caff&egrave; e diversi snack, tra cui i sofficissimi croissant di Seri Backhandwerk, sandwich e pasticcini giapponesi.</p><p>Nel negozio, gli amanti delle cose belle curiosano tra riviste, libri, utensili da scrittura e abbigliamento elegante.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Das Café des Print-Magazins Monocle verströmt im Zürcher Seefeld internationales Flair."@de,
        "The café run by the magazine, Monocle, exudes an international ambiance in Zurich’s Seefeld quarter."@en,
        "Le café Monocle du Seefeld zurichois, dégage une atmosphère internationale."@fr,
        "Il caffè della rivista Monocle diffonde atmosfera internazionale nel quartiere zurighese di Seefeld."@it ;
