    schema:dateModified "2026-02-10T17:55:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Bei AuraVita steht der Mensch als Ganzes im Zentrum. Das heisst, dass sowohl auf die Fitness, aber auch das Wohlbefinden des K&ouml;rpers geachtet wird. Dazu werden bei AuraVita bew&auml;hrte Anwendungen mit innovativen Fitness-, Therapie-, Wellness- und Beauty-Konzepten aus aller Welt kombiniert.<p>Im Kursplan stehen diverse Yoga-Lektionen, intensives Spinning, Bodypump und mehr. Und auch Kurse f&uuml;r die Kleinsten wie beispielsweise Kids Yoga oder Kids Dance. Daneben sorgen Spa-Massagen, Ayurveda Behandlungen, Traditionelle Chinesische Medizin, Medizinische Massagen oder Physiotherapien f&uuml;r die Entspannung des K&ouml;rpers. Und eine Kosmetik-Behandlung rundet das Wohlf&uuml;hlpaket bei AuraVita ab.</p><p>Der Health Club verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber einen Kinderhort und bietet neben Gruppenkursen auch Personal Training an.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>At AuraVita, the focus is placed on the person as a whole. This means that fitness goes hand-in-hand with physical well-being. To achieve this, AuraVita combines proven applications with innovative fitness, therapy, wellness and beauty concepts from all over the world.<p>The course program includes various yoga lessons, intensive spinning, body pump, and more. There are also courses for children, such as Kids Yoga or Kids Dance. In addition, spa massages, ayurvedic treatments, traditional Chinese medicine, medical massages, and physiotherapy ensure that the body is relaxed. Rounding off the feel-good package at AuraVita are various cosmetic treatments.</p><p>The Health Club offers group courses as well as personal training, and also has a day nursery for small children.</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>Chez AuraVita l&rsquo;&ecirc;tre humain dans son int&eacute;gralit&eacute; occupe une position centrale. La condition physique mais &eacute;galement le bien-&ecirc;tre du corps sont des priorit&eacute;s. Des traitements &eacute;prouv&eacute;s sont aussi associ&eacute;s &agrave; des concepts innovants de fitness, th&eacute;rapie, bien-&ecirc;tre et beaut&eacute; issus du monde entier.<p>Le plan des cours pr&eacute;voit yoga, v&eacute;lo intense en salle, body pump et bien plus encore. Il existe aussi des cours pour enfants comme le yoga ou la danse. Massages spa, m&eacute;decine traditionnelle chinoise, massages m&eacute;dicaux ou physioth&eacute;rapies sont promesse de d&eacute;tente du corps. Un traitement cosm&eacute;tique compl&egrave;te le programme de bien-&ecirc;tre de AuraVita.</p><p>Le centre de sant&eacute; dispose d&rsquo;une garderie et propose non seulement des cours en groupe mais aussi un entra&icirc;nement personnalis&eacute;.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Da AuraVita, protagonista indiscussa &egrave; la persona nella sua interezza. Ci&ograve; significa che qui si presta attenzione sia al fitness, sia al benessere fisico. E lo si fa combinando applicazioni comprovate con innovativi concept di fitness, trattamenti, wellness e bellezza di tutto il mondo.<p>Tra i corsi, ci sono varie lezioni di yoga, intense sessioni di spinning, body-pump e altro, ma non mancano le attivit&agrave; per i pi&ugrave; piccoli, come Kids Yoga o Kids Dance. A ci&ograve; si aggiungono massaggi SPA, medicina tradizionale cinese, massaggi medicali o fisioterapia per rilassare tutto il corpo. I trattamenti cosmetici completano poi al meglio il pacchetto benessere di AuraVita.</p><p>La struttura vanta un asilo per bambini, corsi di gruppo e personal training.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Fitness, Therapie, Schönheit und Wellness in der charmanten Rosenstadt Rapperswil."@de,
        "Fitness, therapy, beauty, and wellness in the charming City of Roses, Rapperswil."@en,
        "Fitness, thérapie, beauté et spa dans la charmante cité des roses de Rapperswil."@fr,
        "Fitness, terapie, bellezza e benessere nell’affascinante Rapperswil, città delle rose."@it ;
