    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p><strong>Lebensmittelgesch&auml;fte</strong><br> T&auml;glich 06.15 &ndash; 23.00 Uhr<p><strong>Weitere Gesch&auml;fte im Airport Shopping</strong><br> T&auml;glich 08.00 &ndash; 21.00 Uhr<br><br><strong>Ankunft 1 &amp; 2 und Check-in 1 &amp; 2</strong><br> T&auml;glich 06.00 &ndash; 21.00 Uhr</p></p>"@de,
        "<p><strong>Food stores</strong><br> Daily 6.15am &ndash; 11.00pm<p><strong>Other stores at the Airport Shopping</strong><br> Daily 8.00am &ndash; 9.00pm<br><br><strong>Arrivals 1 &amp; 2 and Check-in 1 &amp; 2</strong><br> Daily 6.00am &ndash; 9.00pm&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p><strong>Magasins d'alimentation</strong><br> Tous les jours &nbsp;6.15h &ndash; 23h<br><br><strong>Autres magasins de l'Airport Shopping</strong><br> Tous les jours 8h &ndash; 21h<br><br><strong>Arriv&eacute;e 1 &amp; 2 et enregistrement 1 &amp; 2</strong><br> Tous les jours 6h &ndash; 21h</p>"@fr,
        "<p><strong>Negozi di alimentari</strong><br> Ogni giorno 6.15 &ndash; 23.00<br><br><strong>Altri negozi dell'Airport Shopping</strong><br> Ogni giorno 8.00 &ndash; 21.00<br><br><strong>Arrivi 1 &amp; 2 e check-in 1 &amp; 2</strong><br> Ogni giorno 6.00 &ndash; 21.00</p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Die Shops und Restaurants am Flughafen Zürich sind 365 Tage im Jahr von früh bis spät geöffnet."@de,
        "The stores and restaurants at Zurich Airport are open 365 days a year from early to late."@en,
        "Boutiques et restaurants de l’aéroport ouvrent 365 jours de l’année de tôt le matin à tard le soir."@fr,
        "I negozi e i ristoranti dell’aeroporto di Zurigo sono aperti 365 giorni all’anno, da mattina a sera."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Airport Shopping"@de,
