    namiont:textTeaser "Der Treffpunkt für alle, die Design-Möbel lieben, mitten im pulsierenden Zürich-West."@de,
        "The meeting place in the heart of the buzzing Zürich-West for all those who love designer furniture."@en,
        "Le lieu de rencontre pour tous les amateurs de meubles design, au cœur de l’effervescence de Zürich-West."@fr,
        "Il ritrovo per tutti coloro che amano i mobili di design, nel cuore del pulsante quartiere di Zürich-West."@it ;
