    schema:dateModified "2026-08-06T11:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:description "<h3><strong>3. &ndash; 20. Dezember 2026</strong><p>Der &laquo;Christkindlim&auml;rt&raquo; bringt zauberhaften Weihnachtsglanz in die mittelalterliche Altstadt von Rapperswil-Jona. Der Markt findet jeweils von Donnerstag bis Sonntag statt &ndash; und w&auml;chst dieses Jahr auf insgesamt 13 Tage. Der beliebte &laquo;Grosse Markt&raquo; startet neu bereits am Mittwoch, 9. Dezember 2026.</p><p>Alle genauen &Ouml;ffnungszeiten sind <a href=\"https://www.rapperswil-zuerichsee.ch/de/christkindlimaert-rapperswil-jona\">hier</a> ersichtlich.</p><h4>Der grosse Weihnachtsmarkt</h4><p>Mit &uuml;ber 200 Marktst&auml;nden verwandelt sich die Rapperswiler Altstadt vom Mittwoch, 9. &ndash; Sonntag, 13. Dezember 2026 in eine zauberhafte Weihnachtswelt: Neu an f&uuml;nf statt wie bisher vier Tagen, erstreckt sich einer der gr&ouml;ssten Weihnachtsm&auml;rkte der Schweiz vom Seeufer &uuml;ber die Marktgasse bis hin zum Hauptplatz.&nbsp;</p><h4>Das Adventsdorf</h4><p>Die Wochenenden vor und nach dem grossen Weihnachtsmarkt (Donnerstag&nbsp;&ndash; Sonntag) gastiert der &laquo;Christkindlim&auml;rt&raquo; in einer etwas kleineren Version aber genau so festlich am Hafen und auf dem Fischmarktplatz.</p><p><a href=\"/de/node/4041\">Weihnachten in Z&uuml;rich&nbsp;</a><br><a href=\"/node/196543\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5344a630-30f0-4ef3-8cb1-6553b2a5f1f6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Weitere Weihnachtsm&auml;rkte</a></p></h3>"@de,
        "<h3>December 3 <strong>&ndash;</strong> 20, 2026<p>The Rapperswil \"Christkindlim&auml;rt\" brings magical Christmas cheer to the medieval old town of Rapperswil-Jona. The market takes place from Thursday through Sunday&mdash;and this year it&rsquo;s expanding to a total of 13 days. The popular &ldquo;Grand Christmas Market\" will now begin as early as Wednesday, December 9, 2026.</p><p>All exact opening hours can be found <a href=\"https://www.rapperswil-zuerichsee.ch/de/christkindlimaert-rapperswil-jona?_gl=1*4h6lxk*_gcl_au*Mzg1NDkzNjk3LjE3ODQ2MjIzOTcuMjA2MzEwNDc0Ni4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQuMTYzNzA0NjUyMS4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQ.*_ga*MTE1NDcyNjg5NC4xNzg0NjIyMzk2*_ga_PJM5D5QC6X*czE3ODU5MjY1MjkkbzQ1JGcxJHQxNzg1OTI3OTU2JGoyMyRsMCRoNjk4MzE2MDQ2*_fplc*OW9MM1ZVNGd1SGp2dUdLenNQUjNyNld6V0JRam1QRkdFa2c5OUNnNkpacVlTWm9ZMnI2TjB3eHp0UGpwdkJUc3pGM2NPNGU5dW9Qd3hOM0tIbWFMaTdSbEhuUWxIUWFzd0ozZXpEaE5tcTlSMmZJSCUyRllDSm5WSDk1Q1F4a2clM0QlM0Q.\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</p><h4>The Grand Christmas Market</h4><p>With over 200 market stalls, Rapperswil&rsquo;s Old Town will be transformed into an enchanting Christmas wonderland from Wednesday, December 9, through Sunday, December 13, 2026. Now spanning five days instead of the previous four, one of Switzerland&rsquo;s largest Christmas markets stretches from the lakeshore along Marktgasse to the main square.</p><h4>The Advent Village</h4><p>On the weekends before and after the grand Christmas market (Thursday &ndash; Sunday), the \"Christkindlim&auml;rt\" makes a guest appearance in a somewhat smaller but no less festive framework in the area around the harbor and on Fischmarktplatz.</p><p><a href=\"/en/node/4041\">Christmas in Zurich</a><br><a href=\"/node/196543\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5344a630-30f0-4ef3-8cb1-6553b2a5f1f6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">All Christmas Markets</a></p></h3>"@en,
        "<h3>3 <strong>&ndash;</strong> 20 d&eacute;cembre 2026<p>Le &laquo;Christkindlim&auml;rt&raquo; apporte la magie de No&euml;l dans la vieille ville m&eacute;di&eacute;vale de Rapperswil-Jona. Le march&eacute; se tient g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement du jeudi au dimanche &ndash; et s'&eacute;tend cette ann&eacute;e sur 13 jours au total. Le tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute; &laquo;grand march&eacute; de No&euml;l&raquo; d&eacute;butera d&eacute;sormais d&egrave;s le mercredi 9 d&eacute;cembre 2026.</p><p>Toutes les heures d'ouverture pr&eacute;cises sont disponibles <a href=\"https://www.rapperswil-zuerichsee.ch/de/christkindlimaert-rapperswil-jona?_gl=1*4h6lxk*_gcl_au*Mzg1NDkzNjk3LjE3ODQ2MjIzOTcuMjA2MzEwNDc0Ni4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQuMTYzNzA0NjUyMS4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQ.*_ga*MTE1NDcyNjg5NC4xNzg0NjIyMzk2*_ga_PJM5D5QC6X*czE3ODU5MjY1MjkkbzQ1JGcxJHQxNzg1OTI3OTU2JGoyMyRsMCRoNjk4MzE2MDQ2*_fplc*OW9MM1ZVNGd1SGp2dUdLenNQUjNyNld6V0JRam1QRkdFa2c5OUNnNkpacVlTWm9ZMnI2TjB3eHp0UGpwdkJUc3pGM2NPNGU5dW9Qd3hOM0tIbWFMaTdSbEhuUWxIUWFzd0ozZXpEaE5tcTlSMmZJSCUyRllDSm5WSDk1Q1F4a2clM0QlM0Q.\"><strong>ici</strong></a>.</p><h4>Le grand march&eacute; de No&euml;l</h4><p>Avec plus de 200 stands, la vieille ville de Rapperswil se transformera en un univers de No&euml;l enchanteur du mercredi 9 au dimanche 13 d&eacute;cembre 2026 : d&eacute;sormais organis&eacute; sur cinq jours au lieu de quatre, l&rsquo;un des plus grands march&eacute;s de No&euml;l de Suisse s&rsquo;&eacute;tendra des rives du lac jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; la place principale en passant par la Marktgasse.</p><h4>Le village de l&rsquo;Avent</h4><p>Les week-ends pr&eacute;c&eacute;dant et suivant le grand march&eacute; de No&euml;l (du jeudi au dimanche), le<br>&laquo;&nbsp;Christkindlim&auml;rt&nbsp;&raquo; s&rsquo;invite dans une version un peu plus petite mais tout aussi festive sur le port et la place du march&eacute; aux poissons.</p><p><a href=\"/fr/node/4041\">No&euml;l &agrave; Zurich</a><br><a href=\"/node/196543\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5344a630-30f0-4ef3-8cb1-6553b2a5f1f6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Tous les march&eacute;s de No&euml;l</a></p></h3>"@fr,
        "<h3>3 <strong>&ndash; </strong>20 dicembre 2026<p>Il &laquo;Christkindlim&auml;rt&raquo; porta la magica atmosfera natalizia nel centro storico medievale di Rapperswil-Jona. Il mercatino si svolge ogni anno da gioved&igrave; a domenica e quest&rsquo;anno si estender&agrave; per un totale di 13 giorni. Il popolare &laquo;Grosse Markt&raquo; inizier&agrave; quest&rsquo;anno gi&agrave; mercoled&igrave; 9 dicembre 2026.</p><p>Tutti gli orari di apertura dettagliati sono disponibili <a href=\"https://www.rapperswil-zuerichsee.ch/de/christkindlimaert-rapperswil-jona?_gl=1*4h6lxk*_gcl_au*Mzg1NDkzNjk3LjE3ODQ2MjIzOTcuMjA2MzEwNDc0Ni4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQuMTYzNzA0NjUyMS4xNzg1OTIwNzcxLjE3ODU5MjEyMTQ.*_ga*MTE1NDcyNjg5NC4xNzg0NjIyMzk2*_ga_PJM5D5QC6X*czE3ODU5MjY1MjkkbzQ1JGcxJHQxNzg1OTI3OTU2JGoyMyRsMCRoNjk4MzE2MDQ2*_fplc*OW9MM1ZVNGd1SGp2dUdLenNQUjNyNld6V0JRam1QRkdFa2c5OUNnNkpacVlTWm9ZMnI2TjB3eHp0UGpwdkJUc3pGM2NPNGU5dW9Qd3hOM0tIbWFMaTdSbEhuUWxIUWFzd0ozZXpEaE5tcTlSMmZJSCUyRllDSm5WSDk1Q1F4a2clM0QlM0Q.\"><strong>qui</strong></a>.</p><h4>Il grande mercatino di Natale</h4><p>Con oltre 200 bancarelle, il centro storico di Rapperswil si trasformer&agrave; in un incantevole mondo natalizio da mercoled&igrave; 9 a domenica 13 dicembre 2026: con una durata estesa a cinque giorni invece dei quattro precedenti, uno dei pi&ugrave; grandi mercatini di Natale della Svizzera si estender&agrave; dalle rive del lago attraverso la Marktgasse fino alla piazza principale.</p><h4>Il villaggio dell&rsquo;Avvento</h4><p>Nei weekend prima e dopo il grande mercatino di Natale (gioved&igrave;&nbsp;&ndash; domenica), il &ldquo;Christkindlim&auml;rt&rdquo;, in una versione un po&rsquo; pi&ugrave; piccola, ma altrettanto suggestiva, si svolge al porto e sulla Fischmarktplatz.</p><p><a href=\"/it/node/4041\">Il Natale a Zurigo</a>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"/node/196543\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5344a630-30f0-4ef3-8cb1-6553b2a5f1f6\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Tutti i mercatini di Natale</a></p></h3>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Der Rapperswiler «Christkindlimärt» verwandelt die historische Altstadt von Rapperswil-Jona in eine zauberhafte Weihnachtswelt – neu an 13 stimmungsvollen Markttagen."@de,
        "The Christmas market transforms the historic old town of Rapperswil-Jona into an enchanting Christmas wonderland – now spanning 13 festive market days."@en,
        "Le «Christkindlimärt» de Rapperswil transforme la vieille ville historique de Rapperswil-Jona en un univers de Noël enchanteur – désormais pendant 13 journées de marché pleines d'ambiance."@fr,
        "Il mercatino di Natale di Rapperswil-Jona trasforma il centro storico di Rapperswil-Jona in un incantevole mondo natalizio – ora con 13 suggestive giornate di mercato."@it ;
