    geo:hasGeometry _:N6e7ee7966e8945e7aee3ee8ab7c121e8 ;
    namiont:detailedInformation "Klassisches Pub"@de,
        "Snacks und Bier"@de,
        "Sportübertragungen"@de,
        "Live sport broadcasts"@en,
        "Snacks and beer"@en,
        "Traditional-style pub"@en,
        "En-cas et bières"@fr,
        "Pub classique"@fr,
        "Retransmissions sportives"@fr,
        "Dirette sportive"@it,
        "Pub classico"@it,
        "Snack e birra"@it ;
    namiont:osmId "370835901" ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Zentral gelegen überzeugt dieses klassische Pub mit unkomplizierter Atmosphäre."@de,
        "Enjoying a central location, this classic pub impresses with its uncomplicated atmosphere."@en,
        "Ce pub classique situé au centre-ville séduit par son ambiance décontractée."@fr,
        "In posizione centrale, questo classico pub convince con la sua atmosfera spensierata."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Big Ben Pub"@de,
        "Big Ben Pub"@en,
        "Big Ben Pub"@fr,
        "Big Ben Pub"@it ;
    namiont:zurichCard false ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Zürich" ;
            schema:postalCode "8001" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Niederdorfstrasse 52" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-04-15T14:17:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Schickimicki gibt&rsquo;s woanders &ndash; hier geht man hin, wenn man unkompliziert etwas trinken und vielleicht auch noch das aktuelle Sportgeschehen verfolgen will. Bier-Fans kommen hier sicherlich auf ihre Kosten, und auch das Angebot an Zigarren und Schnupftabak l&auml;sst keine W&uuml;nsche offen.<p>Das Pub liegt mitten im Niederdorf, wo sich Z&uuml;rich in seiner ganzen Vielfalt zeigt. Die G&auml;steschar ist deshalb gut durchmischt und abends auch oft in Feierlaune. Gut, dass das freundliche Personal stets den &Uuml;berblick beh&auml;lt und trotz Trubel und L&auml;rm effizient bedient.&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>This is the not a place for people looking for chic and elegant - the customers here simply want to enjoy a drink in an uncomplicated atmosphere and perhaps watch some live sport on the TV. Beer lovers are guaranteed to feel at home here, and there is also a wide choice of cigars and snuff.<p>The pub is located in the heart of the Niederdorf quarter, where Zurich shows itself in all its diversity. Consequently, the clientele comprises a good mix and in the evening are often in the mood for celebrating. Just as well that the friendly staff are always able to keep track of things and serve their customers efficiently despite all the noise and goings-on.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>B.C.B.G., c&rsquo;est ailleurs : ici, on profite d&rsquo;une atmosph&egrave;re d&eacute;contract&eacute;e pour boire un coup et suivre l&lsquo;actualit&eacute; sportive. Les fans de bi&egrave;re y trouvent leur bonheur et l&rsquo;offre de cigares et tabacs &agrave; priser r&eacute;pond &agrave; tous les d&eacute;sirs.<p>Le pub se trouve au c&oelig;ur du Niederdorf, dans un quartier qui refl&egrave;te Zurich dans toute sa diversit&eacute;. La client&egrave;le &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s h&eacute;t&eacute;rog&egrave;ne est souvent d&rsquo;humeur festive, surtout le soir. Heureusement que le personnel sympathique sait ma&icirc;triser agitation et bruit et servir de fa&ccedil;on efficace.&nbsp;</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>I fronzoli vanno bene per gli altri. Qui si va per bere qualcosa in un&rsquo;atmosfera disinvolta e per seguire gli eventi sportivi attuali. Gli amanti della birra hanno l&rsquo;imbarazzo della scelta, ma anche l&rsquo;offerta di sigari e tabacco da fiuto &egrave; molto variegata.<p>Il pub si trova nel cuore del Niederdorf, dove Zurigo si mostra in tutte le sue sfaccettature. La clientela &egrave; quindi variopinta, di sera spesso accompagnata da tanta voglia di divertirsi. Un bene, quindi, che il cordiale personale tenga sempre tutto sotto controllo e riesca a servire con efficienza nonostante il trambusto.&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Genau so, wie ein Pub sein muss: Grosse Auswahl an Getränken, über die Bildschirme flimmert Sport, dazu ein paar leckere Snacks."@de,
        "Just like a pub should be: a good selection of drinks, some tasty snacks, and sport transmissions broadcast on TV screens."@en,
        "Le Big Ben propose tout ce qu’on attend d’un pub : un large choix de boissons, des écrans diffusant du sport et des encas savoureux."@fr,
        "Un pub dovrebbe essere proprio così: ampia selezione di bevande, sport sugli schermi e qualche delizioso snack."@it ;
