    geo:hasGeometry _:Nbe49d9204408473e97b4b9fdaef392a8 ;
    namiont:detailedInformation "An der Langstrasse"@de,
        "Laut und lustig"@de,
        "Pub mit Karaoke-Angebot"@de,
        "Loud and welcoming"@en,
        "On Langstrasse"@en,
        "Pub with karaoke evenings"@en,
        "Bruyant et joyeux"@fr,
        "Pub avec karaoké"@fr,
        "Rue Langstrasse"@fr,
        "Chiassoso e divertente"@it,
        "Nella Langstrasse"@it,
        "Pub con karaoke"@it ;
    namiont:osmId "1235083455" ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Hier wird getrunken, mitgefiebert und aus voller Kehle gesungen: ein Lokal voller Leben."@de,
        "Here, guests can drink, sing their hearts out or follow sports on TV: a locale abounding with life."@en,
        "Ce bar animé invite à boire, à vibrer avec les sportifs et à chanter à gorge déployée."@fr,
        "Qui si beve, si fa il tifo e si canta a squarciagola: un locale che trasuda vita!"@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "Old Gregory Pub"@de,
        "Old Gregory Pub"@en,
        "Old Gregory Pub"@fr,
        "Old Gregory Pub"@it ;
    namiont:zurichCard false ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Zürich" ;
            schema:postalCode "8004" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Schöneggstrasse 6" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-04-15T14:17:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Sunday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>An der Langstrasse ist es laut, besonders abends, wenn die Nachtschw&auml;rmer unterwegs sind. Wenn man am Old Gregory Pub vorbeil&auml;uft, wird es vielleicht noch etwas lauter &ndash; dann n&auml;mlich, wenn wieder mal einer der legend&auml;ren Karaoke-Abende l&auml;uft.<p>Aber nicht nur Singfreudige finden in diesem Pub ihr Gl&uuml;ck. Neben gutem Bier, Wein, Whiskeys, Single Malts und allem, was der Gaumen sonst noch begehrt, bietet das Lokal eine gem&uuml;tliche Atmosph&auml;re f&uuml;r langes Sitzenbleiben.</p><p>Anh&auml;nger von Sport&uuml;bertragungen k&ouml;nnen hier ganz entspannt das Geschehen verfolgen, ob im Fussball, Rugby, American Football oder Cricket.</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>On Langstrasse it is loud &ndash; particularly in the evening when the party-goers are out and about. And if you walk past the Old Gregory Pub, it may well be even louder &ndash; such as when one of the legendary karaoke evenings is being held.<p>But not only budding singers feel at home here. Besides good beer, wine, whiskeys, single malts and tasty snacks, the locale offers a welcoming ambiance which makes visitors want to linger for a while.</p><p>Whether soccer, rugby, cricket or American football, sports fans can watch the current sports TV broadcasts in comfort.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>La Langstrasse est bruyante, surtout quand les noctambules commencent &agrave; sortir le soir. Devant l&rsquo;Old Gregory Pub, le bruit est susceptible d&rsquo;augmenter, notamment lorsque le pub f&ecirc;te une de ses soir&eacute;es l&eacute;gendaires de karaok&eacute;. Mais les amateurs de chant ne sont pas les seuls &agrave; y trouver leur bonheur&nbsp;: le pub s&eacute;duit aussi tous ceux qui aiment se d&eacute;tendre dans une atmosph&egrave;re conviviale en d&eacute;gustant un verre de vin, bi&egrave;re, whiskey, single malt etc. Enfin, les adeptes des retransmissions sportives peuvent suivre les &eacute;v&eacute;nements du monde du football, du rugby, du football am&eacute;ricain ou du cricket.</p>"@fr,
        "<p>La Langstrasse &egrave; chiassosa, soprattutto di notte, quando i nottambuli la fanno da padrona. Passando davanti all&rsquo;Old Gregory Pub, pu&ograve; essere che il rumore sia ancora pi&ugrave; assordante, soprattutto se &egrave; in corso una delle sue leggendarie serate di karaoke.<p>Ma questo pub non &egrave; adatto solo a chi ama cantare. Oltre a buona birra, vino, whiskey, single malt e tutto ci&ograve; che possa allietare il palato, il locale propone anche un&rsquo;atmosfera accogliente da godersi comodamente seduti, senza fretta.</p><p>Qui, gli appassionati di trasmissioni sportive possono seguire le discipline pi&ugrave; svariate, da calcio e rugby a football e cricket.</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Im Langstrassen-Quartier gibt es ein gemütliches Pub, in dem nicht nur Sportfans auf ihre Kosten kommen."@de,
        "In the Langstrasse quarter, there is a cozy pub that does not just cater to the needs of sports fans."@en,
        "Situé dans le quartier Langstrasse, ce pub attire des fans de sport et bien d’autres."@fr,
        "Nel quartiere della Langstrasse si trova un accogliente pub molto amato non solo dagli appassionati di sport."@it ;
    schema:email "info@oldgregorypub.ch" ;
    schema:geo _:Nbe49d9204408473e97b4b9fdaef392a8 ;
