    namiont:specialOpeningHoursNote "<p>Monday to Wednesday, 10.00am &ndash; 12.00am<br>Thursday 10.00am &ndash; 1.00am<br>Friday 10.00am &ndash; 2.00am<br>Saturday 6.00pm &ndash; 2.00am</p>"@en,
        "<p>Du lundi au mercredi, 10h &ndash; 24h<br>Jeudi 10h &ndash; 1h<br>Vendredi 10h &ndash; 2h<br>Samedi 18h &ndash; 2h</p>"@fr,
        "<p>Da luned&igrave; a mercoled&igrave;, 10.00 &ndash; 24.00<br>Gioved&igrave; 10.00 &ndash; 1.00<br>Venerd&igrave; 10.00 &ndash; 2.00<br>Sabato 18.00 &ndash; 2.00</p>"@it ;
    namiont:textTeaser "Café, Restaurant und Bar unter einem Dach: im kultigen 4. Akt im Herzen von Zürich West."@de,
        "Café, restaurant, and bar all under one roof: at the cult 4. Akt, in the heart of Zurich West."@en,
        "Café, restaurant et bar : le 4. Akt au cœur de Zürich-West réunit tout sous le même toit."@fr,
        "Caffè, ristorante e bar in uno? Si trova al 4. Akt, nel cuore di Zürich-West."@it ;
    namiont:titleTeaser "4. Akt Restaurant & Bar"@de,
        "4. Akt Restaurant & Bar"@en,
        "4. Akt Restaurant & Bar"@fr,
        "4. Akt Restaurant & Bar"@it ;
    namiont:zurichCard false ;
    schema:address [ a schema:PostalAddress ;
            schema:addressCountry "CH" ;
            schema:addressLocality "Zürich" ;
            schema:postalCode "8005" ;
            schema:streetAddress "Heinrichstrasse 262" ] ;
    schema:copyrightHolder "Zürich Tourismus www.zuerich.com"@de,
        "Zurich Tourism www.zuerich.com"@en,
        "Zürich Tourisme www.zuerich.com"@fr,
        "Zürich Tourismo www.zuerich.com"@it ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-04-15T14:17:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema:dayOfWeek schema:Friday,
        schema:Monday,
        schema:Saturday,
        schema:Thursday,
        schema:Tuesday,
        schema:Wednesday ;
    schema:description "<p>Mitten im pulsierenden Z&uuml;rich-West l&auml;dt der 4. Akt zum kurzen oder langen Verweilen ein: Gute Drinks, tolle Musik und leckeres Essen sind &uuml;berzeugende Argumente.<p>Seit 1997 ist dieses Lokal ein Ort f&uuml;r alle, die dort sein wollen, wo Z&uuml;rich lebt.</p><p>Das Personal ist hier besonders umg&auml;nglich und kollegial. Vielleicht gibt es deshalb so viele Stammg&auml;ste. Oder auch weil man hier in lockerem Ambiente reden, schlemmen und feiern kann. Und das auch an der frischen Luft, im grossz&uuml;gigen Aussenbereich.&nbsp;</p></p>"@de,
        "<p>Located in the middle of the vibrant Z&uuml;rich West quarter, the 4. Akt invites guests to relax and linger awhile &ndash; its good food, tasty drinks, and great music are all convincing arguments in its favor. Since 1997, this establishment has been a popular meeting-place for all those who want to be at the very heart of Zurich life.<p>The staff here are particularly amiable and friendly. Perhaps that is why it has so many regulars &ndash; or perhaps because here you can chat in relaxed surroundings, eat good food, and party to your heart&rsquo;s content. And that outside in the fresh air, too &ndash; in the spacious outdoor area.&nbsp;</p></p>"@en,
        "<p>En plein c&oelig;ur du quartier tr&eacute;pidant de Zurich-Ouest, le 4. Akt invite &agrave; y passer un moment ou s&rsquo;y attarder&nbsp;: les cocktails excellents, la musique superbe et les repas d&eacute;licieux sont des arguments imparables.<p>Depuis 1997, cet &eacute;tablissement est l&rsquo;endroit id&eacute;al pour tous ceux qui veulent &ecirc;tre l&agrave; o&ugrave; la ville s&rsquo;anime.</p><p>Le personnel particuli&egrave;rement sociable forme une excellente &eacute;quipe. Cela explique peut-&ecirc;tre le nombre &eacute;lev&eacute; d&rsquo;habitu&eacute;s. Ou est-ce parce que l&rsquo;endroit invite &agrave; discuter, se r&eacute;galer ou f&ecirc;ter dans une ambiance d&eacute;contract&eacute;e &ndash; m&ecirc;me en plein air, gr&acirc;ce au vaste espace ext&eacute;rieur.</p></p>"@fr,
        "<p>Nel cuore del pulsante quartiere di Z&uuml;rich-West, il 4. Akt &egrave; un luogo dove fermarsi un po&rsquo; pi&ugrave; a lungo. Ottimi drink, musica favolosa e cibo delizioso sono argomenti convincenti per farlo.<p>Dal 1997, questo locale &egrave; un ritrovo per tutti coloro che vogliono frequentare la Zurigo pi&ugrave; viva.</p><p>Il personale &egrave; particolarmente alla mano e cordiale. Forse &egrave; per questo che ci sono cos&igrave; tanti habitu&eacute;. O perch&eacute; qui si pu&ograve; chiacchierare, mangiare e fare festa in un&rsquo;atmosfera disinvolta, persino all&rsquo;aria aperta, nell&rsquo;ampio dehors.&nbsp;</p></p>"@it ;
    schema:disambiguatingDescription "Vom morgendlichen Kaffee zum lockeren Lunch bis zum spritzigen Feierabenddrink – ein lebendiges Lokal mit aussergewöhnlicher Stimmung."@de,
        "From a morning coffee to a relaxed lunch to a fun after-work drink – the 4. Akt is a lively locale with an out-of-the-ordinary ambiance."@en,
        "Café matinal, déjeuner décontracté ou boisson rafraîchissante après une journée de travail – un établissement animé avec une ambiance exceptionnelle."@fr,
        "Caffè del mattino, pranzo leggero o aperitivo frizzante in un locale vivace con un’atmosfera unica."@it ;
    schema:email "info@4akt.ch" ;
    schema:geo _:N929d5ead043449ce8bdd5c51daa05da8 ;
    schema:identifier "88366" ;
